", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3"}, {"Company": "Vabiotech (Vietnam Vaccine JSC)", "Website": "https://vabiotech.com.vn", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Hanoi, Vietnam, Its", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Vietnam)", "Operational Presence": "Vietnam", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Produces vaccines and biological products in Vietnam.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "VN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Vabiotech (Vietnam Vaccine JSC) — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover).", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3"}], "final_kept": [{"Company": "Abbott Laboratories", "Website": "https://www.abbott.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "United, States, Abbott", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Abbott has a diverse portfolio including biologics and is involved in biosimilar development.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "Abbott Laboratories — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Has a diverse portfolio including biologics and biosimilar development.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "abbott.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "abbott.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Abbott has been a part of India's healthcare landscape since 1910, making it one of the oldest and\nmost established health companies in the country. With more than 12,000 employees working across\nurban centers and rural communities alike, Abbott India serves a vast and varied population —\noffering over 400 trusted pharmaceutical brands alongside nutritional products, medical devices and\ndiagnostic solutions. The company's headquarters in Mumbai anchors a network that reaches into\npractically every corner of the subcontinent, reflecting a belief that world-class healthcare should\nnot be a privilege reserved for the few. \n\nAbbott India Limited, a publicly listed subsidiary of Abbott Laboratories, is one of India's\nfastest-growing pharmaceutical companies and a recognized leader in women's health,\ngastroenterology, metabolic conditions, neurology and vaccines. The company has invested in local\nmanufacturing for its two largest businesses — nutrition and pharmaceuticals — because building for\nIndia means building in India. That commitment to local production ensures that products are\ndesigned and made with the specific needs of Indian consumers in mind, from the nutritional\nrequirements of infants and young children to the health challenges facing aging adults. \n\nFor more than 115 years, Abbott in India has strived to be closer to the people it serves. That\ncloseness shapes everything — the products developed, the communities supported and the partnerships\nforged with healthcare professionals across the country. From creating excellent workplaces\nrecognized by leading industry bodies to addressing the health needs of both rural and urban\npopulations, Abbott in India takes pride in the lasting difference it makes every day. \n\nProducts and Solutions\n* [Overview][1]\n* [Diabetes][2]\n* [Nutrition][3]\n* [Diagnostics Testing][4]\n* [Cardiovascular][5]\n* [Pain and Movement][6]\n* [Biowearables][7]\n* [Medicines][8]\n* [All Products][9]\n\nNeed Help?\n* [Where to Buy][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Partners][12]\n* [Global Locations][13]\n* [Site Map][14]\n\n[ ][15] [ ][16] [ ][17] [ ][18] [ ][19] © 2026 Abbott. All Rights Reserved. Please read the Legal\nNotice for further details. Unless otherwise specified, all product and service names appearing in\nthis Internet site are approved for use in the U.S. only and are trademarks owned by or licensed to\nAbbott, its subsidiaries or affiliates. No use of any Abbott trademark, trade name, or trade dress\nin this site may be made without the prior written authorization of Abbott, except to identify the\nproduct or services of the company.\nLoading...\n\n[1]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/products-solutions\n[2]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/products-solutions/diabetes\n[3]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/products-solutions/nutrition\n[4]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/products-solutions/diagnostics-testing\n[5]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/products-solutions/cardiovascular\n[6]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/products-solutions/pain-and-movement\n[7]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/products-solutions/biowearables\n[8]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/products-solutions/medicines\n[9]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/products-solutions/product-list\n[10]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/where-to-buy\n[11]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/about-abbott/contact\n[12]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/partners\n[13]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/global-locations-contacts\n[14]: https://www.abbott.com/en-us/site-map\n[15]: https://www.facebook.com/Abbott\n[16]: http://instagram.com/abbottglobal\n[17]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/1612\n[18]: https://twitter.com/AbbottNews\n[19]: https://www.youtube.com/c/abbott"}}, "page_text": "Abbott has been a part of India's healthcare landscape since 1910, making it one of the oldest and most established health companies in the country. With more than 12,000 employees working across urban centers and rural communities alike, Abbott India serves a vast and varied population — offering over 400 trusted pharmaceutical brands alongside nutritional products, medical devices and diagnostic solutions. The company's headquarters in Mumbai anchors a network that reaches into practically every corner of the subcontinent, reflecting a belief that world-class healthcare should not be a privilege reserved for the few. Abbott India Limited, a publicly listed subsidiary of Abbott Laboratories, is one of India's fastest-growing pharmaceutical companies and a recognized leader in women's health, gastroenterology, metabolic conditions, neurology and vaccines. The company has invested in local manufacturing for its two largest businesses — nutrition and pharmaceuticals — because building for India means building in India. That commitment to local production ensures that products are designed and made with the specific needs of Indian consumers in mind, from the nutritional requirements of infants and young children to the health challenges facing aging adults. For more than 115 years, Abbott in India has strived to be closer to the people it serves. That closeness shapes everything — the products developed, the communities supported and the partnerships forged with healthcare professionals across the country. From creating excellent workplaces recognized by leading industry bodies to addressing the health needs of both rural and urban populations, Abbott in India takes pride in the lasting difference it makes every day. Products and Solutions * [Overview][1] * [Diabetes][2] * [Nutrition][3] * [Diagnostics Testing][4] * [Cardiovascular][5] * [Pain and Movement][6] * [Biowearables][7] * [Medicines][8] * [All Products][9] Need Help? * [Where to Buy][10] * [Contact Us][11] * [Partners][12] * [Global Locations][13] * [Site Map][14] [ ][15] [ ][16] [ ][17] [ ][18] [ ][19] © 2026 Abbott. All Rights Reserved. Please read the Le