ps and markets a range of pharmaceutical products, including biologics and biosimilars in Australia and New Zealand.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "NZ", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "AFT Pharmaceuticals — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops and markets pharmaceutical products including biologics and biosimilars.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "aftpharm.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "aftpharm.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Investors][1]\n\nEnglish\n[English][2][中文][3]\n🌐 Global\n[🌐 Global][4][ Australia][5][ Canada][6][ Hong Kong][7][ Malaysia][8][ New Zealand][9][\nSingapore][10][ South Africa][11][ USA][12][ United Kingdom][13]\n* [News][14]\n* [Our Products][15]\n* [Prescription Range][16]\n* [About us][17]\n* [Contact][18]\n\n# Pharmaceuticals with a difference.\n\nWith a guiding principle of working to improve your health, we deliver pharmaceuticals that make a\nreal difference in people’s health.\n\n[Find Out More][19]\n\n## Investor centre\n\n#### AFT’s product portfolio comprises both proprietary and in-licensed products, and includes\n#### patented, branded and generic drugs.\n\n## Invest in AFT Pharmaceuticals\n\n#### We went from ‘go’ to global in under 20 years\n\n[Information][20]\n\n## Latest news\n\n#### Stay informed with our latest advancements in healthcare and pharmaceutical innovation\n\n[More news][21]\n\nJuly 23, 2026\n\n## Pitt St Research initiates coverage on AFT Pharmaceuticals\n\nAFT Pharmaceuticals (NZX: AFT; ASX: AFP), today announces that Pitt St Research has initiated\ncoverage on AFT Pharmaceuticals Ltd….\n\n[Read More][22]\n\nNovember 28, 2025\n\n## AFT Pharmaceuticals SA acquires the Hospital Division of Pharma Dynamics\n\nAFT Pharmaceuticals SA (Pty) Ltd (‘AFT SA’) announces it has successfully completed the acquisition\nof the Hospital Division business of Pharma Dy…\n\n[Read More][23]\n\nNovember 20, 2025\n\n## AFT delivers 10th consecutive first half revenue increase\n\nAFT Pharmaceuticals (NZX: AFT, ASX: AFP) today reports a strong first-half performance for the six\nmonths to 30 September 2025, with revenue growing 3…\n\n[Read More][24]\n[More News][25]\n\n## The AFT Pharmaceuticals Journey\n\n#### Discover our incredible team and culture\n\n[Find out more][26]\n\n## Frequently asked questions\n\nHow do I invest in AFT?\nHead to our [Investors][27] website to find out more about how you can invest with** AFT\nPharmaceuticals.**\nHow can I work at AFT?\nIf we have any current vacancies, you can find them on the [Careers][28] page.\nI am interested in partnering with you as a licensee/licensor, how do I get in touch?\nPlease use the enquiry form on the [Contact Us][29] page and someone will be in touch.\nWhere can I find out more about your product range?\nYou can find further information about our products on the [Product page][30], first selecting the\ncountry/region relevant to you.\nWhere can I report adverse drug reactions?\nPlease get in touch with us at [customer.service@aftpharm.com][31] or go to our [Contact\nUs][32] page.\nCan I buy products directly off your website?\nExplore our online shops to purchase products directly from [New Zealand][33] or [Australia][34], or\nvisit our individual brand websites to find global stockists for in-store and online purchases.\n[Home][35]\n[About][36]\n[Prescription Range][37]\n[Products][38]\n* [Facebook][39]\n* [Instagram][40]\n* [YouTube][41]\n[News][42]\n[Investors][43]\n[Contact][44]\n\n[Terms of Use][45]\n\n[Privacy Policy][46]\n\n[Cookie Policy][47]\n\n[1]: https://investors.aftpharm.com/investors/\n[2]: http://www.aftpharm.com/\n[3]: http://www.aftpharm.com/zh-hans/\n[4]: http://www.aftpharm.com/\n[5]: http://www.aftpharm.com/au-en/\n[6]: http://www.aftpharm.com/ca-en/\n[7]: http://www.aftpharm.com/hk-en/\n[8]: http://www.aftpharm.com/my-en/\n[9]: http://www.aftpharm.com/nz-en/\n[10]: http://www.aftpharm.com/sg-en/\n[11]: http://www.aftpharm.com/za-en/\n[12]: http://www.aftpharm.com/us-en/\n[13]: http://www.aftpharm.com/uk-en/\n[14]: /news\n[15]: /products\n[16]: /prescription\n[17]: /about/\n[18]: /contact\n[19]: /about/\n[20]: https://investors.aftpharm.com/investors/\n[21]: /news\n[22]: https://www.aftpharm.com/news/pitt-st-research-initiates-coverage-on-aft-pharmaceuticals/\n[23]: https://www.aftpharm.com/news/aft-pharmaceuticals-sa-acquires-the-hospital-division-of-pharma-\ndynamics/\n[24]: https://www.aftpharm.com/news/aft-delivers-10th-consecutive-first-half-revenue-increase/\n[25]: /news\n[26]: /about\n[27]: https://investors.aftpharm.com/\n[28]: https://www.aftpharm.com/caree"}}, "page_text": "[Investors][1] English [English][2][中文][3] 🌐 Global [🌐 Global][4][ Australia][5][ Canada][6][ Hong Kong][7][ Malaysia][8][ New Zealand][9][ Singapore][10][ South Africa][11][ USA][12][ United Kingdom][13] * [News][14] * [Our Products][15] * [Prescription Range][16] * [About us][17] * [Contact][18] # Pharmaceuticals with a difference. With a guiding principle of working to improve your health, we deliver pharmaceuticals that make a real difference in people’s health. [Find Out More][19] ## Investor centre #### AFT’s product portfolio comprises both proprietary and in-licensed products, and includes #### patented, branded and generic drugs. ## Invest in AFT Pharmaceuticals #### We went from ‘go’ to global in under 20 years [Information][20] ## Latest news #### Stay informed with our latest advancements in healthcare and pharmaceutical innovation [More news][21] July 23, 2026 ## Pitt St Research initiates coverage on AFT Pharmaceuticals AFT Pharmaceuticals (NZX: AFT; ASX: AFP), today announces that Pitt St Research has initiated coverage on AFT Pharmaceuticals Ltd…. [Read More][22] November 28, 2025 ## AFT Pharmaceuticals SA acquires the Hospital Division of Pharma Dynamics AFT Pharmaceuticals SA (Pty) Ltd (‘AFT SA’) announces it has successfully completed the acquisition of the Hospital Division business of Pharma Dy… [Read More][23] November 20, 2025 ## AFT delivers 10th consecutive first half revenue increase AFT Pharmaceuticals (NZX: AFT, ASX: AFP) today reports a strong first-half performance for the six months to 30 September 2025, with revenue growing 3… [Read More][24] [More News][25] ## The AFT Pharmaceuticals Journey #### Discover our incredible team and culture [Find out more][26] ## Frequently asked questions How do I invest in AFT? Head to our [Investors][27] website to find out more about how you can invest with** AFT Pharmaceuticals.** How can I work at AFT? If we have any current vacancies, you can find them on the [Careers][28] page. I am interested in partnering with you as a licensee/licensor, how do I get in touch? Please use the enquiry form on the [Contact Us][29] page and someone will be in touch. Where can I find out more about your product range? You can find further information about our products on the [Product page][30], first selecting the country/region relevant to you. Where can I report adverse drug reactions? Please get in touch with us at [customer.service@aftpharm.com][31] or go to our [Contact Us][32] page. Can I buy products directly off your website? Explore our online shops to purchase products directly from [New Zealand][33] or [Australia][34], or visit our individual brand websites to find global stockists for in-store and online purchases. [Home][35] [About][36] [Prescription Range][37] [Products][38] * [Facebook][39] * [Instagram][40] * [YouTube][41] [News][42] [Investors][43] [Contact][44] [Terms of Use][45] [Privacy Policy][46] [Cookie Policy][47] [1]: https://investors.aftpharm.com/investors/ [2