m Laboratories — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Alkem is a pharmaceutical company with biosimilar products, likely marketing them.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "80", "X Score": "40", "Y Score": "46", "Overall Score": "43", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Alvogen", "Website": "https://www.alvogen.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Morristown, New, Jersey", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Alvogen is a global pharmaceutical company with a focus on biosimilars.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Marketer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "Alvogen — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Alvogen is a global pharmaceutical company with a focus on biosimilars, indicating it owns or markets products in the biologics/biosimilars market.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "alvogen.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "alvogen.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[][1]\n* 01Company\n  [Company][2]\n  [Brand promise][3]\n  [Our vision][4]\n  [Compliance & ethics][5]\n  [Meet our management][6]\n  [Meet the founder][7]\n* 02Products\n  [Products][8]\n  [Patient safety][9]\n  [Manufacturing facility][10]\n* 03Partnerships\n  [Partnerships][11]\n  [Academic partnerships][12]\n  [Events & Exhibitions][13]\n  [Biosimilars][14]\n* 04Purpose\n  [Purpose][15]\n  [Culture][16]\n* [05Offices][17]\n[Join us][18]\n[Media gallery][19]\n[Join us][20][Media gallery][21]\nCompanyProductsPartnershipsPurpose[Offices][22]\n[\nCompany\n][23]\n[\nBrand promise\n][24]\n[\nOur vision\n][25]\n[\nCompliance & ethics\n][26]\n[\nMeet our management\n][27]\n[\nMeet the founder\n][28]\n[\nProducts\n][29]\n[\nPatient safety\n][30]\n[\nManufacturing facility\n][31]\n[\nPartnerships\n][32]\n[\nAcademic partnerships\n][33]\n[\nEvents & Exhibitions\n][34]\n[\nBiosimilars\n][35]\n[\nPurpose\n][36]\n[\nCulture\n][37]\n[][38]\nAlvogen\n\n# Setting a new standard for the future of pharma\n* [\n  Solaxa and Alvogen enter into license agreement for the development and commercialization of\n  SLX-100\n  ][39]\n* [\n  Alvogen Issues Voluntary Nationwide Recall for One Lot of Fentanyl Transdermal System 25 mcg/h Due\n  to a Defective Delivery System\n  ][40]\n* [\n  Alvogen Completes Sale to Lotus, Creating a Leading International Specialized Generics Platform\n  ][41]\n\nAlvogen\n\n## America's pharmaceutical future\n\n**America's pharmaceutical future is strengthened in Norwich, New York.** For over 130 years,\nNorwich has been a bedrock of American pharmaceutical manufacturing. Today, Alvogen continues this\nproud tradition by producing high-quality generic medications that make healthcare more affordable\nand accessible for millions of Americans.\n\n[America's pharmaceutical future][42]\nCompany\n\n## Who we are\n\nAlvogen is a US-based company focused on developing, in-licensing, manufacturing and marketing\npharmaceutical products.\n\nAlvogen's companies include:\n\nAlvogen generic business\nAlmatica brand products\nAlmaject injectables\nNorwich US-based manufacturing\n\n[About us][43]\nProducts\n\n## Targeted portfolio\n\nAlvogen is growing its portfolio of complex, high value products including complex inhalation,\ninjectables and strategic 505(b)(2) products.\n\nAlvogen has over 50 products currently on market and extensive R&D capabilities fueling its growing\npipeline.\n\n[Our Products][44]\nPurpose\n\n## Making a difference\n\nOur true purpose as a company is to make people's lives better by producing high quality medicines\nthat help people live longer, healthier and more active lives and making them more accessible to\nthose who might not otherwise be able to afford them.\n\n[Our purpose][45]\nPartnerships\n\n## Open for collaboration\n\nAt Alvogen, we value partnerships and collaboration. Our future strategy relies heavily on our\nstrategic selection of people and successful partnerships around the world.\n\n[Partnerships][46]\nOffices\n\n## Offices\n\nAlvogen has offices in New Jersey and manufacturing plant in Norwich, New York.\n\n[Discover offices][47]\n* [Company][48]\n* [Products][49]\n* [Partnerships][50]\n* [Purpose][51]\n* [Offices][52]\n* [Citizenship][53]\n* [Leadership team][54]\n* [Contact us][55]\n[][56]\n* [Media Gallery][57]\n* [][58]\n* [Terms of Use][59]\n* [Privacy Policy][60]\n* [Cookie Policy][61]\n* [Return goods policy][62]\n\n© 2024 Alvogen. All Rights Reserved\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /company\n[3]: /company/brand-promise\n[4]: /company/our-vision\n[5]: /company/compliance--ethics\n[6]: /company/meet-our-management-usa\n[7]: /company/meet-the-founder\n[8]: /products\n[9]: /products/patient-safety\n[10]: /products/facilities\n[11]: /partnerships\n[12]: /partnerships/academic-partnerships\n[13]: /partnerships/events--exhibitions\n[14]: /partnerships/biosimilars\n[15]: /purpose\n[16]: /purpose/culture\n[17]: /offices\n[18]: /join-us\n[19]: /media-gallery\n[20]: /join-us\n[21]: /media-gallery\n[22]: /offices\n[23]: /company\n[24]: /company/brand-promise\n[25]: /company/our-vision\n[26]: /company/compliance--ethics\n[27]: /company/meet-our-management-usa\n[28]: /company/meet-the-founder\n[29"}}, "page_text": "[][1] * 01Company [Company][2] [Brand promise][3] [Our vision][4] [Compliance & ethics][5] [Meet our management][6] [Meet the found