. Alvogen has over 50 products currently on market and extensive R&D capabilities fueling its growing pipeline. [Our Products][44] Purpose ## Making a difference Our true purpose as a company is to make people's lives better by producing high quality medicines that help people live longer, healthier and more active lives and making them more accessible to those who might not otherwise be able to afford them. [Our purpose][45] Partnerships ## Open for collaboration At Alvogen, we value partnerships and collaboration. Our future strategy relies heavily on our strategic selection of people and successful partnerships around the world. [Partnerships][46] Offices ## Offices Alvogen has offices in New Jersey and manufacturing plant in Norwich, New York. [Discover offices][47] * [Company][48] * [Products][49] * [Partnerships][50] * [Purpose][51] * [Offices][52] * [Citizenship][53] * [Leadership team][54] * [Contact us][55] [][56] * [Media Gallery][57] * [][58] * [Terms of Use][59] * [Privacy Policy][60] * [Cookie Policy][61] * [Return goods policy][62] © 2024 Alvogen. All Rights Reserved [1]: / [2]: /company [3]: /company/brand-promise [4]: /company/our-vision [5]: /company/compliance--ethics [6]: /company/meet-our-management-usa [7]: /company/meet-the-founder [8]: /products [9]: /products/patient-safety [10]: /products/facilities [11]: /partnerships [12]: /partnerships/academic-partnerships [13]: /partnerships/events--exhibitions [14]: /partnerships/biosimilars [15]: /purpose [16]: /purpose/culture [17]: /offices [18]: /join-us [19]: /media-gallery [20]: /join-us [21]: /media-gallery [22]: /offices [23]: /company [24]: /company/brand-promise [25]: /company/our-vision [26]: /company/compliance--ethics [27]: /company/meet-our-management-usa [28]: /company/meet-the-founder [29]: /products [30]: /products/patient-safety [31]: /products/facilities [32]: /partnerships [33]: /partnerships/academic-partnerships [34]: /partnerships/events--exhibitions [35]: /partnerships/biosimila