in Europe based on sound science that will improve and protect the\n    health of patients with serious illnesses, support advances in clinical development and enhance\n    access to medicines.\n    ][18]\n* [NEWSROOM][19]\n* [Careers][20]\n* [ [amgen-worldwide-web] ][21]\n* chevron_leftMain menu\n* chevron_left About chevron_right\n  * [ About Amgen\n    Explore the legacy and impact of Amgen in Europe, a pioneering biotechnology firm\n    revolutionizing medicine through innovative biological drugs and cutting-edge research.\n    ][22] [ Locations\n    Amgen Locations in Europe. Meet where Amgen in Europe has presence.\n    ][23] [ Leadership\n    Meet Amgen's Europe esteemed leadership team driving innovation and excellence in biotechnology.\n    Learn about our leaders and their roles in shaping healthcare.\n    ][24] [ Mission & Values\n    Amgen's mission is to harness the potential of science and biotechnology to develop life-saving\n    therapies, guided by values like ethics, teamwork, and quality.\n    ][25] [ Contact Us\n    Connect with Amgen for inquiries and assistance. Access our contact form and essential\n    information on media, investors, careers, and more.\n    ][26] [ Amgen History\n    Explore Amgen's extensive history of over 35 years, marked by groundbreaking therapeutic\n    innovation. Learn about our journey shaping the future of healthcare.\n    ][27]\n* chevron_left SCIENCE & INNOVATION chevron_right\n  * [ Overview\n    Discover how Amgen's innovations in biotechnology are shaping the future of medicine. Explore\n    our pioneering role in advancing science to transform lives.\n    ][28] [ Biosimilars\n    Explore Amgen's expertise in biosimilars backed by over 40 years of biotechnology experience.\n    Learn about biosimilar basics, manufacturing, and more.\n    ][29] [ Clinical trials\n    Clinical Trial"}}, "page_text": "[ [Amgen-blue.svg] [Amgen-blue.svg] ][1] * [ About keyboard_arrow_down ][2] * [ About Amgen Explore the legacy an