teamwork, and quality.\n    \n    ][5]\n  * [ Contact Us\n    \n    Connect with Amgen for inquiries and assistance. Access our contact form and essential\n    information on media, investors, careers, and more.\n    \n    ][6]\n  * [ Our Medicines\n    \n    Discover Amgen's array of innovative prescription drugs aimed at treating serious illnesses.\n    Explore our impactful therapies dedicated to improving lives.\n    \n    ][7]\n  * [ Leadership\n    \n    Connect with Amgen for inquiries and assistance. Access our contact form and essential\n    information on media, investors, careers, and more.\n    \n    ][8]\n  * [ Partnerships ][9]\n  * [ Collaborative Working and Joint Initiatives ][10]\n  * [ Next Generation Population Health ][11]\n  * [ QuicDNA ][12]\n* [ SCIENCE ][13]\n  * [ Overview\n    \n    Discover how Amgen's innovations in biotechnology are shaping the future of medicine. Explore\n    our pioneering role in advancing science to transform lives.\n    \n    ][14]\n  * [Clinical Trials\n    \n    Understanding clinical trials, including risks, benefits, placebos, participation, and\n    regulations. Learn how to get involved and what to expect.\n    \n    ][15]\n  * [Biotechnology ][16]\n  * [The Science of Biotechnology ][17]\n  * [Discovering and Developing Medicines ][18]\n  * [Biosimilars\n    \n    Explore Amgen's expertise in biosimilars backed by over 40 years of biotechnology experience.\n    Learn about biosimilar basics, manufacturing, and more.\n    \n    ][19]\n  * [Biomanufacturing ][20]\n  * [How Are Biotechnology Medicines Made? ][21]\n* [ THERAPEUTIC AREAS ][22]\n  * [Overview\n    \n    Explore Amgen's commitment to advancing healthcare across key areas: oncology, cardiovascular\n    disease, osteoporosis, and more.\n    \n    ][23]\n  * [Pharmacovigilance\n    \n    Delve into Amgen's pharmacovigilance commitment, ensuring safety and efficacy of our medicines.\n    Learn about our rigorous monitoring and reporting practices.\n    \n    ][24]\n* [ Responsibility ][25]\n  * [ Overview\n    \n    Amgen strives to make a difference through the Foundation, environmental initiatives, ethics,\n    and more. Discover our impactful programs and achievements.\n    \n    ][26]\n  * [Corporate Sustainability\n    \n    Explore Amgen's Corporate Sustainability commitment for a better world: Healthy People, Society,\n    Planet, and a Healthy Amgen. Serving patients and global well-being.\n    \n    ][27]\n  * [Diversity, Inclusion and Belonging\n    \n    Discover Amgen's commitment to diversity, inclusion and belonging, fostering an innovative,\n    welcoming work environment for all.\n    \n    ][28]\n  * [Ethics and Compliance\n    \n    Amgen upholds ethical conduct and transparency in all business operations. Explore our Code of\n    Conduct, Compliance Policy, and reporting mechanisms.\n    \n    ][29]\n  * [The Amgen Foundation\n    \n    The Amgen Foundation is an integral component of Amgen’s commitment to dramatically improve\n    people’s lives.\n    \n    ][30]\n  * [ Transparency\n    \n    Access Amgen's transparency reports. Learn about our commitment to openness and accountability.\n    \n    ][31]\n  * [ Collaborative Working ][32]\n  * [ Patient Advocacy Groups ][33]\n  * [ Members of the Public ][34]\n* [ Newsroom ][35]\n* [ Working at Amgen ][36]\n* [ ][37][\n  [amgen-worldwide-web]\n  ][38]\n* [\n  [search-icon] [search]\n  ][39]\n\n\n## Fighting the World’s Toughest Diseases\n\nBy sel"}}, "page_text": "* [ ** Main Menu ][1] * [ ABOUT ][2] * [ About Amgen Explore the legacy and impact of Amgen, a pioneering biotechnology firm revolutionizing medicine through innovative biological drugs and cutting-edge research. ][3] * [Amgen History Explore Amgen's extensive history of over 35 years, marked by groundbreaking therapeutic innovation. Learn about our journey shaping the future of healthcare. ][4] * [ Mission & Values Amgen's mission is to harness the potential of science and biotechnology to develop life-saving therapies, guided by values like ethics, teamwork, and quality. ][5] * [ Contact Us Connect with Amgen for inquiries and assistance. Access our contact form and essential information on media, investors, careers, and more. ][6] * [ Our Medicines Discover Amgen's array of innovative prescription drugs aimed at treating serious illnesses. Explore our impactful therapies dedicated to improving lives. ][7] * [ Leadership Connect with Amgen for inquiries and assistance. Access our contact form and essential information on media, investors, careers, and more. ][8] * [ Partnerships ][9] * [ Collaborative Working and Joint Initiatives ][10] * [ Next Generation Population Health ][11] * [ QuicDNA ][12] * [ SCIENCE ][13] * [ Overview Discover how Amgen's innovations in biotechnology are shaping the future of medicine. Explore our pioneering role in advancing science to transform lives. ][14] * [Clinical Trials Understanding clinical trials, including risks, benefits, placebos, participation, and regulations. Learn how to get involved and what to expect. ][15] * [Biotechnology ][16] * [The Science of Biotechnology ][17] * [Discovering and Developing Medicines ][18] * [Biosimilars Explore Amgen's expertise in biosimilars backed by over 40 years of biotechnology experience. Learn about biosimilar basics, manufacturing, and more. ][19] * [Biomanufacturing ][20] * [How Are Biotechnology Medicines Made? ][21] * [ THERAPEUTIC AREAS ][22] * [Overview Explore Amgen's commitment to advancing healthcare across key areas: oncology, cardiovascular disease, osteoporosis, and more. ][23] * [Pharmacovigilance Delve into Amgen's pharmacovigilance commitment, ensuring safety and efficacy of our medicines. Learn about our rigorous monitoring and reporting practices. ][24] * [ Responsibility ][25] * [ Overview Amgen strives to make a difference through the Foundation, environmental initiatives, ethics, and more. Discover our impactful programs and achievements. ][26] * [Corporate Sustainability Explore Amgen's Corporate Sustainability commitment for a better world: Healthy People, Society, Planet, and a Healthy Amgen. Serving patients and global well-being. ][27] * [Diversity, Inclusion and Belonging Discover Amgen's commitment to diversity, inclusion and belonging, fostering an innovative, welcoming work environment for all. ][28] * [Ethics and Compliance Amgen upholds ethical conduct and transparency in all business operations. Explore our Code of Conduct, Compliance Policy, and reporting mechanisms. ][29] * [The Amgen Foundation The Amgen Foundation is an integral component of Amgen’s commitment to dramatically improve people’s lives. ][30] * [ Transparency Access Amgen's transparency reports. Learn about our commitment to openness and accountability. ][31] * [ Collaborative Working ][32] * [ Patient Advocacy Groups ][33] * [ Members of the Public ][34] * [ Newsroom ][35] * [ Working at Amgen ][36] * [ ][37][ [amgen-worldwide-web] ][38] * [ [search-icon] [search] ][39] ## Fighting the World’s Toughest Diseases By selecting the Yes option, Leave Amgen.co.uk option, you understand that you are leaving the corporate page of Amgen UK and that you will be redirected to another Internet site belonging to third parties, for whose content or opinions Amgen UK Ltd is not responsible and makes no representations regarding such content or its accuracy. By selecting this option and accessing linked third party sites, you understand that you do so at your own risk. The website to which you will be redirected may be designed exclusively for residents of a particular country or countries, as advertised on that website. As a consequence, the website to which you will be directed may contain information on pharmaceutical products or indications that are not approved in UK. If You reside in a country other than the one to which such website is directed, please contact your local Amgen affiliate for the correct information on products in your country of residence. [ yes, leave amgen.co.uk ][40] [ CANCEL ][41] * ## Introduction * ## View Video Transcript ## Serving Patients At Amgen, our mission is to serve patients, and in the UK, we bring this mission to life every day. From harnessing global scientific innovation which addresses local unmet medical needs, to forging strategic partnerships that deliver transformative solutions, we are committed to advancing patient care in everything we do. With world leading universities in pioneering technologies, the UK has made a lasting impact on global science and public health. At Amgen, we share this vision to improve health, harnessing the best of biology and technology globally to tackle some of the toughest diseases. This is what unites our dedicated team and we're proud to leverage our global science to enhance, enrich and extend people's lives in the UK by reimagining how we conduct clinical trials, gathering real world patient insights, inspiring the next generation of STEM talent, partnering with healthcare professionals and helping patients find their voice. We do this so we can provide innovative new medicines, improve access to treatment and help people across the UK. At Amgen our mission is to serve patients and in the UK we bring this mission to life every day. [Amgen Uxbridge Exterior] Our Company Amgen is a values-based company, deeply rooted in science and innovation to transform new ideas and discoveries into medicines for patients with serious illnesses. [LEARN MORE][42] [Close-up image of neurons in the brain ] Our Science Amgen is a pioneer in the science of using living cells to make biologic medicines. [LEARN MORE][43] Working at Amgen At Amgen we strive to improve lives. Explore your career opportunities at Amgen UK. [LEARN MORE][44] Our Medicine Amgen’s medicines treat serious illnesses and typically address diseases with a limited number of treatment options. [LEARN MORE][45] [Man with his child on his shoulders in a forest] Our Responsibility Making a positive difference in the world is at the heart of what we do at Amgen – and it goes beyond making vital medicines. [LEARN MORE][46] [Image of Uxbridge office outside] Contact Us Contact us to report an experienced side effect or ask a question. [LEARN MORE][47] GBR-NP-0924-80005 January 2025 [ Contact Us ][48] [ Terms of Use ][49] [ Privacy Statement ][50] [ Cookie Preferences ][51] [ Cookie Statement ][52] [ Sitemap ][53] **** © 2008-2025 Amgen Limited. All Rights Reserved. [1]: # [2]: /about [3]: /about [4]: /about/history [5]: /about/mission-and-values [6]: /about/contact [7]: /about/our-medicine [8]: /about/leadership [9]: /about/Partnerships [10]: /about/Partnerships/Collaborative-working-projects [11]: /about/Partnerships/next-generation-population-health [12]: /about/Partnerships/QuicDNA [13]: /science [14]: /science [15]: /science/clinical-trials [16]: /science/Biotechnology [17]: /science/Biotechnology/the-science-of-biotechnology [18]: /science/Biotechnology/discovering-and-developing-medicines [19]: /science/biosimilars [20]: /science/manufacturing [21]: /science/manufacturing/how-biotechnology-medicines-are-made [22]: /therapeutic-areas [23]: /therapeutic-areas [24]: /therapeutic-areas/pharmacovigilance [25]: /responsibility [26]: /responsibility [27]: /responsibility/corporate-sustainability [28]: /responsibility/diversity-inclusion-and-belonging [29]: /responsibility/ethics-and-compliance [30]: /responsibility/amgen-foundation [31]: /Transparency [32]: /Transparency/collaborative-working [33]: /Transparency/patient-advocacy-groups [34]: /Transparency/members-of-the-public [35]: /media [36]: /careers [37]: # [38]: https://wwwext.amgen.com/amgen-worldwide [39]: # [40]: [41]: # [42]: /about [43]: /science [44]: /careers [45]: /about/our-medicine [46]: /responsibility [47]: /about/contact [48]: /about/contact [49]: /terms-of-use [50]: /privacy-and-terms [51]: javascript: Cookiebot.renew() [52]: https://www.amgen.eu/cookie-information-for-us