ogy", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Amoun Pharmaceutical", "Website": "https://www.amoun.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Cairo, Egypt", "Continent / Geography": "AF(Egypt)", "Operational Presence": "Egypt", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Amoun is an Egyptian pharmaceutical company that markets biosimilars in the region and participates in trade shows.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Marketer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "EG", "Region Code": "AF", "Summary": "Amoun Pharmaceutical — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Pharmaceutical company that markets biosimilars in the region.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "X Score": "40", "Y Score": "45", "Overall Score": "42", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Apotex", "Website": "https://www.apotex.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Toronto, Canada", "Continent / Geography": "NA(Canada)", "Operational Presence": "Canada", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Canadian pharma with biosimilar products", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CA", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Apotex — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Canadian pharma with biosimilar products, owns and markets biosimilars.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "X Score": "44", "Y Score": "45", "Overall Score": "44", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Aroa Biosurgery", "Website": "https://www.aroabio.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Auckland, New, Zealand", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(New Zealand)", "Operational Presence": "New Zealand", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "New Zealand-based company developing and marketing extracellular matrix (ECM) biologics for wound care and surgery.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "Aroa Biosurgery — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops and markets extracellular matrix (ECM) biologics for wound care and surgery.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "aroabio.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "aroabio.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "* [About AROA][1]\n* [Clinical Evidence][2]\n* [News][3]\n* [Investors][4]\n* [Reimbursement][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n[[AROA]][7]\n* [Endoform™][8]\n* [Myriad Matrix™][9]\n* [Myriad Morcells™][10]\n* [Myriad Morcells Fine™][11]\n* [Myriad Meshed™][12]\n* [Symphony™][13]\n* [Reinforced Bioscaffolds][14]\n\n# Unlocking regenerative healing for everybody\n\nA range of products based on AROA ECM™ platform technology that aims to improve the rate and quality\nof soft tissue repair.\n\n[Learn More][15]\n\n## Our Products\n\n\nPrevious Next\n\n#### Endoform™\n\nEndoform™ restorative bioscaffolds can be used in the management of acute and chronic wounds\n\n[Learn More][16]\n\n#### Myriad Matrix™\n\nMyriad Matrix™ is a surgical soft tissue bioscaffold for complex wounds and reconstruction\n\n[Learn More][17]\n\n#### Myriad Morcells™\n\nMyriad Morcells™ utilizes the AROA ECM platform technology\n\n[Learn More][18]\n\n#### Myriad Meshed™\n\nA fenestrated configuration of our AROA ECM™ bioscaffold.\n\n[Learn More][19]\n\n#### Symphony™\n\nSymphony is combination cellular and tissue product (CTP*), comprising of AROA ECM with hyaluronic\nacid\n\n[Learn More][20]\n\n#### Reinforced Bioscaffolds\n\nDesigned specifically for hernia repair and abdominal wall reconstruction\n\n[Learn More][21]\n[[AROA]][22]\n\nUnlocking regenerative healing for everybody\n\n##### AROA\n* [About AROA][23]\n* [News][24]\n* [Subscribe][25]\n* [Careers][26]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n* [Endoform™][27]\n* [Myriad Matrix™][28]\n* [Myriad Morcells™][29]\n* [Myriad Morcells Fine™][30]\n* [Myriad Meshed™][31]\n* [Symphony™][32]\n* [Reinforced Bioscaffolds][33]\n* [Instructions for Use][34]\n* [Product Evaluation T&Cs][35]\n\n© 2026 AROA BIOSURGERY LIMITED\n* [Contact Us][36]\n* [Investors][37]\n* [Privacy Policy][38]\n* [HIPAA Privacy][39]\n* [Terms and Conditions][40]\n* [[linkedin logo]][41]\n* [][42]\n\nWe use cookies on our website to give you the most relevant experience by remembering your\npreferences and repeat visits. By clicking “Accept”, you consent to the use of ALL the cookies. You\ncan limit the cookies that are used by clicking on the “Cookie settings” link.\nCookie settingsAccept\nManage consent\nClose\n\n#### Privacy Overview\n\nThis website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of\nthese cookies, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they are\nessential for the working of basic functionalities of the website. We also use third-party cookies\nthat help us analyze and understand how you use this website. These cookies will be stored in your\nbrowser only with your consent. You also have the option to opt-out of these cookies. But opting out\nof some of these cookies may have an effect on your browsing experience.\nNecessary\nNecessary\nAlways Enabled\nNecessary cookies are absolutely essential for the website to function properly. These cookies\nensure basic functionalities and security features of the website, anonymously.\n\n────────────────┬────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nCookie          │Dura│Description                                                                   \n                │tion│                                                                              \n────────────────┼────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\ncookielawinfo-ch│11  │This cookie is set by GDPR Cookie Consent plugin. The cookie is used to store \neckbox-analytics│mont│the user consent for the cookies in the category \"Analytics\".                 \n                │hs  │                                                                              \n────────────────┼────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\ncookielawinfo-ch│11  │The cookie is set by GDPR cookie consent to record the user consent for the   \neckbox-functiona│mont│cookies in the category \"Functional\".                                         \nl               │hs  │                                                      "}}, "page_text": "* [About AROA][1] * [Clinical Evidence][2] * [News][3] * [Investors][4] * [Reimbursement][5] * [Contact Us][6] [[AROA]][7] * [Endoform™][8] * [Myriad Matrix™][9] * [Myriad Morcells™][10] * [Myriad Morcells Fine™][11] * [Myriad Meshed™][12] * [Symphony™][13] * [Reinforced Bioscaffolds][14] # Unlocking regenerative healing for everybody A range of products based on AROA ECM™ platform technology that aims to improve the rate and quality of soft tissue repair. [Learn More][15] ## Our Products Previous Next #### Endoform™ Endoform™ restorative bioscaffolds can be used in the management of acute and chronic wounds [Learn More][16] #### Myriad Matrix™ Myriad Matrix™ is a surgical soft tissue bioscaffold for complex wounds and reconstruction [Learn More][17] #### Myriad Morcells™ Myriad Morcells™ utilizes the AROA ECM platform technology [Learn More][18] #### Myriad Meshed™ A fenestrated configuration of our AROA ECM™ bioscaffold. [Learn More][19] #### Symphony™ Symphony is combination cellular and tissue product (CTP*), comprising of AROA ECM with hyaluronic acid [Learn More][20] #### Reinforced Bioscaffolds Designed specifically for hernia repair and abdominal wall reconstruction [Learn More][21] [[AROA]][22] Unlocking regenerative healing for everybody ##### AROA * [About AROA][23] * [News][24] * [Subscribe][25] * [Careers][26] ##### PRODUCTS * [Endoform™][27] * [Myriad Matrix™][28] * [Myriad Morcells™][29] * [Myriad Morcells Fine™][30] * [Myriad Meshed™][31] * [Symphony™][32] * [Reinforced Bioscaffolds][33] * [Instructions for Use][34] * [Product Evaluation T&Cs][35] © 2026 AROA BIOSURGERY LIMITED * [Contact Us][36] * [Investors][37] * [Privacy Policy][38] * [HIPAA Privacy][39] * [Terms and Conditions][40] * [[linkedin logo]][41] * [][42] We use cookies on our website to give you the most relevant experience by remembering your preferences and repeat visits. By clicking “Accept”, you consent to the use of ALL the cookies. You can limit the cookies that are used by clicking on the “Cookie settings” link. Cookie settingsAccept Manage consent Close #### Privacy Overview This website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of these cookies, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they are essential for the working of basic functionalities of th