"Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Aspen is a leading African pharmaceutical company with a significant biosimilars portfolio and strong presence across the continent.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Marketer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "ZA", "Region Code": "AF", "Summary": "Aspen Pharmacare — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Leading African pharmaceutical company with significant biosimilars portfolio.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "aspenpharma.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "aspenpharma.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Share Price:\n\nAPNASPENAspen Pharmacare Hldgs15751303 (1.96%)\nSearch\n[ Our Response to Covid ][1]\n[ Country Sites ][2]\n* [About Aspen][3]\n  \n  ##### [ About Aspen ][4]\n  * [ Corporate Governance ][5]\n  * [ Regional Overviews ][6]\n  * [ Our Leadership ][7]\n  * [ Global Presence ][8]\n  * [ Business Segments ][9]\n  \n  ##### [ Corporate Governance ][10]\n  \n  The Board is accountable to shareholders and other stakeholders and is ultimately responsible for\n  the implementation of sound corporate governance practices throughout the Group. Aspen’s Board of\n  Directors is committed to ensuring that the Group adheres to high standards of corporate\n  governance in the conduct of its business.\n  \n  ##### [ Regional Overview ][11]\n  * [ Africa Middle East ][12]\n  * [ Americas ][13]\n  * [ Asia ][14]\n  * [ Australasia ][15]\n  * [ Europe CIS ][16]\n  \n  ##### [ Business Segments ][17]\n  * [ Prescription ][18]\n  * [ Over the Counter ][19]\n  * [ Injectables ][20]\n  * [ Manufacturing ][21]\n  \n  ##### [ Manufacturing ][22]\n  \n  Aspen has 23 manufacturing facilities across 15 sites. Our\n  strategic manufacturing sites are widely accredited, holding international approval from some of\n  the most stringent global regulatory agencies. We manufacture a wide variety of product types\n  including steriles, oral solid dose, liquids, semi-solids, biologicals and APIs.\n  \n  ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][23]\n  \n  Watch the Webcast\n  \n  [ Read More » ][24]\n  \n  ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][25]\n  \n  View or Download\n  \n  [ Read More » ][26]\n* [Investor Relations][27]\n  \n  ##### [ Investor Relations ][28]\n  * [ Investor Hub ][29]\n  * [ Financial Information ][30]\n  * [ Financial Results and Presentations ][31]\n  * [ Integrated Reporting ][32]\n  * [ Share Price Information ][33]\n  * [ Financial Calendar ][34]\n  * [ SENS ][35]\n  \n  ##### [ Investor Relations ][36]\n  \n  Access our investor hub for information and tools including corporate reporting, share price,\n  dividends, calendar, SENS and other relevant documents.\n  \n  ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][37]\n  \n  Watch the Webcast\n  \n  [ Read More » ][38]\n  \n  ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][39]\n  \n  View or Download\n  \n  [ Read More » ][40]\n* [We Care][41]\n  \n  ##### We Care\n  * [ Ethics & Compliance Management ][42]\n  * [ SED Initiatives ][43]\n  * [ Mandela Day ][44]\n  * [ Sustainability ][45]\n  * [ Responsible Corporate Citizenship ][46]\n  \n  ##### Ethics & Compliance Management\n  \n  “A bright future beckons. The onus is on us, through hard work, honesty, and integrity, to reach\n  for the stars. ” – Nelson Mandela\n  \n  ##### SED Initiatives\n  \n  Aspen has demonstrated an unwavering commitment to our credo ‘Healthcare. We Care” through a wide\n  range of initiatives and activities that span more than two decades.\n  \n  ##### Mandela Day\n  \n  DURBAN – JSE Limited listed Aspen Pharmacare Holdings Limited (“Aspen”), a global specialty and\n  branded pharmaceutical company, has hosted more than 800 activities over 12 years in celebration\n  of the annual Nelson Mandela International Day (“Mandela Day”).\n  \n  ##### Our Sustainability Commitments\n  \n  We believe that doing business in a sustainable and responsible manner is integral to our purpose,\n  our values and our philosophy “Healthcare. We Care”.\n  \n   \n  \n  Our sustainability commitments are integrated into the Group’s strategic objectives and underpin\n  the way we do business.\n  \n  ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][47]\n  \n  Watch the Webcast\n  \n  [ Read More » ][48]\n  \n  ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][49]\n  \n  View or Download\n  \n  [ Read More » ][50]\n* [Careers][51]\n  \n  ##### [ Careers ][52]\n  * [ Careers at Aspen ][53]\n  * [ Aspen Jobs ][54]\n  * [ Bursary Applications ][55]\n  \n  ##### [ High Performing, Inclusive Culture ][56]\n  \n  Our purpose is to deliver a differentiated portfolio of high quality and affordable medicines to\n  im"}}, "page_text": "Share Price: APNASPENAspen Pharmacare Hldgs15751303 (1.96%) Search [ Our Response to Covid ][1] [ Country Sites ][2] * [About Aspen][3] ##### [ About Aspen ][4] * [ Corporate Governance ][5] * [ Regional Overviews ][6] * [ Our Leadership ][7] * [ Global Presence ][8] * [ Business Segments ][9] ##### [ Corporate Governance ][10] The Board is accountable to shareholders and other stakeholders and is ultimately responsible for the implementation of sound corporate governance practices throughout the Group. Aspen’s Board of Directors is committed to ensuring that the Group adheres to high standards of corporate governance in the conduct of its business. ##### [ Regional Overview ][11] * [ Africa Middle East ][12] * [ Americas ][13] * [ Asia ][14] * [ Australasia ][15] * [ Europe CIS ][16] ##### [ Business Segments ][17] * [ Prescription ][18] * [ Over the Counter ][19] * [ Injectables ][20] * [ Manufacturing ][21] ##### [ Manufacturing ][22] Aspen has 23 manufacturing facilities across 15 sites. Our strategic manufacturing sites are widely accredited, holding international approval from some of the most stringent global regulatory agencies. We manufacture a wide variety of product types including steriles, oral solid dose, liquids, semi-solids, biologicals and APIs. ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][23] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][24] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][25] View or Download [ Read More » ][26] * [Investor Relations][27] ##### [ Investor Relations ][28] * [ Investor Hub ][29] * [ Financial Information ][30] * [ Financial Results and Presentations ][31] * [ Integrated Reporting ][32] * [ Share Price Information ][33] * [ Financial Calendar ][34] * [ SENS ][35] ##### [ Investor Relations ][36] Access our investor hub for information and tools including corporate reporting, share price, dividends, calendar, SENS and other relevant documents. ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][37] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][38] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][39] View or Download [ Read More » ][40] * [We Care][41] ##### We Care * [ Ethics & Compliance Management ][42] * [ SED Initiatives ][43] * [ Mandela Day ][44] * [ Sustainability ][45] * [ Responsible Corporate Citizenship ][46] ##### Ethics & Compliance Management “A bright future beckons. The onus is on us, through hard work, honesty, and integrity, to reach for the stars. ” – Nelson Mandela ##### SED Initiatives Aspen has demonstrated an unwavering commitment to our credo ‘Healthcare. We Care” through a wide range of initiatives and activities that span more than two decades. ##### Mandela Day DURBAN – JSE Limited listed Aspen Pharmacare Holdings Limited (“Aspen”), a global specialty and branded pharmaceutical company, has hosted more than 800 activities over 12 years in celebration of the annual Nelson Mandela International Day (“Mandela Day”). ##### Our Sustainability Commitments We believe that doing business in a sustainable and responsible manner is integral to our purpose, our values and our philosophy “Healthcare. We Care”. Our sustainability commitments are integrated into the Group’s strategic objectives and underpin the way we do business. ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][47] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][48] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][49] View or Download [ Read More » ][50] * [Careers][51] ##### [ Careers ][52] * [ Careers at Aspen ][53] * [ Aspen Jobs ][54] * [ Bursary Applications ][55] ##### [ High Performing, Inclusive Culture ][56] Our purpose is to deliver a differentiated portfolio of high quality and affordable medicines to improve the health and quality of life of patients across the markets we operate and how we show up every day to achieve this has shaped a culture of agility, high performance and inclusion. ##### Working At Aspen We believe that doing business in a sustainable and responsible manner is integral to our purpose, our values and our philosophy “Healthcare. We Care”. Our sustainability commitments are integrated into the Group’s strategic objectives and underpin the way we do business and how we show up every day, across the world. ##### Bursary Applications Aligned with our philosophy of “Healthcare. We Care”, Aspen supports education as a way of empowering people. We offer certain bursary opportunities in South Africa for specific qualifications offered at specific institutions. ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][57] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][58] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][59] View or Download [ Read More » ][60] * [Media][61] ##### [ Media ][62] * [ Press Releases ][63] * [ Our Stories ][64] * [ Media Coverage ][65] ##### [ Aspen Holding News ][66] ## [Aspen Pharmacare expands access ambitions for