arch * [ Clear ][122] Quick Links * east[Astellas Media][123] * east[Clinical Trials][124] Recent Search * [ Contact Us][125] menu Close * [ arrow_back Back ][126] * [ Close close ][127] * [ Contact Us][128] close ##### You are about to leave this site. You are about to leave www.astellas.com and enter a third-party website. Astellas is not responsible for the content or services on the third-party website. Would you like to continue? * [ arrow_right_alt Cancel arrow_right_alt ][129] * [ arrow_right_alt Yes, Continue arrow_right_alt ][130] * [ Close close ][131] ###### Choose Language * [ English ][132] * [ Japanese ][133] ## Astellas We are a global life sciences company committed to turning innovative science into VALUE for patients. * [ Careers ][134] * [ News ][135] * [ Careers ][136] * [ News ][137] [Financial Results of Astellas for Q1/FY2026] Financial Results of Astellas for Q1/FY2026 Posted Financial Results of Astellas for Q1/FY2026. * [ Learn more arrow_right_alt ][138] ## Our stories ### An error occurred Please try again [Human, AI, robots: Co-creating cell therapy] XLMTM Story thumbnail - 648x470 - 1 * Innovation * Patient focus Human, AI, robots: Co-creating cell therapy * [ Read article arrow_right_alt ][139] [The true cost of neglecting menopause] XLMTM Story thumbnail - 648x470 - 1 * Culture * Patient focus The true cost of neglecting menopause * [ Read article arrow_right_alt ][140] [Advancing X-Linked Myotubular Myopathy Advocacy] XLMTM Story thumbnail - 648x470 - 1 * Innovation * Patient focus Advancing X-Linked Myotubular Myopathy Advocacy * [ Read article arrow_right_alt ][141] * [ View all ][142] * [ View all ][143] [Exterior view of Astellas’ Tokyo headquarters, home to a global life sciences company shaping healthcare worldwide.] About Astellas Astellas is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan and operates in more than 70 countries and areas around the world. * [ About Astellas arrow_right_alt ][144] [Hands held in a quiet moment of care, echoing Astellas’ focus on improving lives through patient-centered innovation.] Medicines and Disease Areas Astellas provides transformative therapies in disease areas that include oncology, ophthalmology, urology, immunology and women's health. * [ Our current portfolio arrow_right_alt ][145] [Molecular models used in Astellas’ research and development to advance innovative therapies in high- need disease areas.] Research and Development Through our research and development (R&D) programs, we are pioneering new healthcare solutions in disease areas with high unmet medical need. * [ Our R&D approach arrow_right_alt ][146] [Astellas scientists work together at a whiteboard as part of a culture that values bold ideas and collaborative innovation.] Careers Astellas brings together experts from around the world and some of the brightest talent in the industry – all united in our dedication to pursuing brave ideas and ambitious outcomes. * [ Join us arrow_right_alt ][147] close This year, we highlighted our Competitive Advantage at the beginning of the report. We also featured timely topics such as enhancing our drug discovery capabilities through the implementation of AI and visualizing the social impacts of our non-financial activities. You can also find many passionate messages and interviews with our Top Management, outside Directors, and employees. Click on the link below to learn more about Astellas and its exciting future. [https://www.astellas.com/en/about/astellas-integrated-report][148] close ##### You are about to leave this site. You are about to leave www.astellas.com and enter a third-party website. Astellas is not responsible for the content or services on the third-party website. Would you like to continue? * [ Cancel ][149] * [ Yes, Continue ][150] [Astellas logo represents a global life sciences company turning science into value for patients through transformative therapies] menu close Navigate * [ About ][151] * [ Science ][152] * [ Partnering ][153] * [ Inve