alking with patient at the bedsite] ### More time for patient care. Global staff shortages make health care professionals the most valuable resource in hospitals. Their most limited asset is time. Discover solutions to help free up precious time. ][160] [ [A healthcare professional is shown standing proudly with a sustainable-produced medical container.] ### New standards in sterile processing and operating room supply A reliable and efficient supply of the OR is essential for creating daily and long-term success in hospital processes. Digitally enhanced solutions to achieve clinical excellence. ][161] [ [A medical laboratory employee is pouring liquid for a quality check.] ### Sustainability from the depths With the expansion of its disinfectant production facility in Sempach, Switzerland, B. Braun is now seizing the opportunity to set new standards in energy management. ][162] [ [Digital microscope for neurosurgery named Aesculap Aeos® in front of a white background] ### A precise view of the future: New digital microscope technology for neurosurgery New technology allows high-resolution views into the human body, making it a prerequisite for more precise surgery. ][163] chevron_left chevron_right 1. Annual report 2025 2. More time for patient care 3. OR momentum 4. N.I.C.O 5. A precise view of the future ## Your time to join us Discover your job opportunities and become an important part of our future. [ Apply now ][164] Our DNA ## We live our values * [ ### Innovation We drive the development of cutting-edge technologies to significantly improve clinical outcomes, cost of care and patient satisfaction. ][165] * [ ### Efficiency We understand our customers’ needs and work on providing solutions. ][166] * [ ### Sustainability We live responsibly. We take business decisions with future generations in mind. ][167] ## Take part in our customer survey Your feedback matters! Participate in our customer survey to help us enhance our website, products and services. Thank