gics and biosimilars. | Argentina | Buenos Aires, Argentina", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "42", "Y Score": "52", "Overall Score": "47", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Bausch Health Canada", "Website": "https://www.bauschhealth.ca", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Laval, Quebec, Canada", "Continent / Geography": "NA(Canada)", "Operational Presence": "Canada", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Markets biosimilars in Canada, including for ophthalmology and dermatology.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Marketer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CA", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Bausch Health Canada — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Markets biosimilars in Canada.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "bauschhealth.ca", "data": {"company": {"name": "bauschhealth.ca"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ [Bausch Health] ][1]\n[Canadian Flag]      \n* [ABOUT US][2]\n  [Who We Are][3][Our Ambition, Purpose and Values][4][Canadian Leadership Team][5][Our Canadian\n  Locations][6][Contact Us][7]\n* [PRODUCTS][8]\n  [Dermatology Products][9][Gastroenterology][10][Specialty Medicine][11][Weight\n  Management][12][Canadian Product List][13]\n* [CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY][14]\n  [Canadian Compassionate Use Program][15][Grants and Investigator-Initiated Studies][16]\n* [NEWSROOM][17]\n* [CAREERS][18]\n  [Working at Bausch Health][19]\n* [Français][20]\n* Search for:\n\n# Delivering on our commitments\n\nBausch Health’s mission is to improve people’s lives with our health care products worldwide\n\n[More About Bausch Health, Canada»][21]\n\n# Working at Bausch Health, Canada\n\nBausch Health is hiring dedicated and innovative team members who want to make a difference\n\n[See Careers at Bausch Health, Canada»][22]\n\n## Welcome to Bausch Health, Canada\n\nAs a company dedicated to innovation and advancement of global health, Bausch Health is constantly\nbuilding on our commitment to help Canadians and people around the world live longer, healthier and\nmore productive lives, through initiatives that often go beyond health care.\n* Reaching out from our Canadian headquarters to 100 countries around the world\n* Proudly collaborating with patient communities, physicians, universities, hospitals, and\n  charitable organizations to improve lives with our health care products\n\n[Read More About Who We Are»][23]\n\nLatest News\nAugust 21, 2025\n\n[Bausch Health, Canada Inc. treatment for acne vulgaris, ^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate,\nadapalene and benzoyl peroxide gel), now available through public drug plans of Quebec and\nSaskatchewan ][24]\n\n\nJuly 9, 2025\n\n[Bausch Health, Canada Inc. treatment for acne vulgaris, ^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate,\nadapalene and benzoyl peroxide gel), now available through public drug plans of Ontario, Nova Scotia\nand two federal programs ][25]\n\n\nApril 9, 2025\n\n[Bausch Health, Canada Inc. and the pan-Canadian Pharmaceutical Alliance sign letter of intent for\npublic drug plan coverage of ^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate, adapalene and benzoyl\nperoxide gel) treatment for acne vulgaris][26]\n\n\nNovember, 2024\n\n[^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate, adapalene and benzoyl peroxide gel) Treatment for Acne\nVulgaris Receives Positive Reimbursement Recommendations from Canada’s Drug Agency and Quebec’s\nINESSS][27]\n\n\nSeptember, 2024\n\n[Health Canada Approves ^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate, adapalene and benzoyl peroxide)\nTriple-Combination Topical Treatment for Acne Vulgaris in Patients 12 Years of Age and Older][28]\n\n\nMay, 2024\n\n[Bausch Health, Canada Inc. announces additional public drug plan listings for ^{Pr}UCERIS^{®}\n(budesonide) aerosol foam to treat mild to moderate distal ulcerative colitis in adults][29]\n\n\nApril, 2024\n\n[Acne vulgaris treatment ^{Pr}ARAZLO^{TM} (tazarotene lotion, 0.045%) now available to patients\nthrough British Columbia PharmaCare public drug plan][30]\n\n\n## Our mission: Improving people’s lives with our health care products\n\nLearn more about our products.\n\n[See Our Canadian Product List»][31]\n\n### NYSE:BHC\n\n## $\n\n### TSX:BHC\n\n## $\n\n**Bausch Health, Canada Inc.**\n2150 St. Elzéar Blvd. West\nLaval, Quebec H7L 4A8\nCanada\n800-361-1448\n514-744-6792\n* [CONTACT US ][32]\n* [LEGAL NOTICE ][33]\n* [SITE MAP ][34]\n* [SOCIAL MEDIA COMMUNITY GUIDELINES][35]\n\nAll information herein is intended only for residents of Canada.\nCopyright © Bausch Health, Canada Inc 2026. All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: https://bauschhealth.ca/\n[2]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/\n[3]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/who-we-are/\n[4]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/our-mission-vision-and-values/\n[5]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/canadian-leadership-team/\n[6]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/our-canadian-locations/\n[7]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/contact-us/\n[8]: https://bauschhealth.ca/products/\n[9]: https://bauschhealth.ca/"}}, "page_text": "[ [Bausch Health] ][1] [Canadian Flag] * [ABOUT US][2] [Who We Are][3][Our Ambition, Purpose and Values][4][Canadian Leadership Team][5][Our Canadian Locations][6][Contact Us][7] * [PRODUCTS][8] [Dermatology Products][9][Gastroenterology][10][Specialty Medicine][11][Weight Management][12][Canadian Product List][13] * [CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY][14] [Canadian Compassionate Use Program][15][Grants and Investigator-Initiated Studies][16] * [NEWSROOM][17] * [CAREERS][18] [Working at Bausch Health][19] * [Français][20] * Search for: # Delivering on our commitments Bausch Health’s mission is to improve people’s lives with our health care products worldwide [More About Bausch Health, Canada»][21] # Working at Bausch Health, Canada Bausch Health is hiring dedicated and innovative team members who want to make a difference [See Careers at Bausch Health, Canada»][22] ## Welcome to Bausch Health, Canada As a company dedicated to innovation and advancement of global health, Bausch Health is constantly building on our commitment to help Canadians and people around the world live longer, healthier and more productive lives, through initiatives that often go beyond health care. * Reaching out from our Canadian headquarters to 100 countries around the world * Proudly collaborating with patient communities, physicians, universities, hospitals, and charitable organizations to improve lives with our health care products [Read More About Who We Are»][23] Latest News August 21, 2025 [Bausch Health, Canada Inc. treatment for acne vulgaris, ^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate, adapalene and benzoyl peroxide gel), now available through public drug plans of Quebec and Saskatchewan ][24] July 9, 2025 [Bausch Health, Canada Inc. treatment for acne vulgaris, ^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate, adapalene and benzoyl peroxide gel), now available through public drug plans of Ontario, Nova Scotia and two federal programs ][25] April 9, 2025 [Bausch Health, Canada Inc. and the pan-Canadian Pharmaceutical Alliance sign letter of intent for public drug plan coverage of ^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate, adapalene and benzoyl peroxide gel) treatment for acne vulgaris][26] November, 2024 [^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate, adapalene and benzoyl peroxide gel) Treatment for Acne Vulgaris Receives Positive Reimbursement Recommendations from Canada’s Drug Agency and Quebec’s INESSS][27] September, 2024 [Health Canada Approves ^{Pr}CABTREO^{TM} (clindamycin phosphate, adapalene and benzoyl peroxide) Triple-Combination Topical Treatment for Acne Vulgaris in Patients 12 Years of Age and Older][28] May, 2024 [Bausch Health, Canada Inc. announces additional public drug plan listings for ^{Pr}UCERIS^{®} (budesonide) aerosol foam to treat mild to moderate distal ulcerative colitis in adults][29] April, 2024 [Acne vulgaris treatment ^{Pr}ARAZLO^{TM} (tazarotene lotion, 0.045%) now available to patients through British Columbia PharmaCare public drug plan][30] ## Our mission: Improving people’s lives with our health care products Learn more about our products. [See Our Canadian Product List»][31] ### NYSE:BHC ## $ ### TSX:BHC ## $ **Bausch Health, Canada Inc.** 2150 St. Elzéar Blvd. West Laval, Quebec H7L 4A8 Canada 800-361-1448 514-744-6792 * [CONTACT US ][32] * [LEGAL NOTICE ][33] * [SITE MAP ][34] * [SOCIAL MEDIA COMMUNITY GUIDELINES][35] All information herein is intended only for residents of Canada. Copyright © Bausch Health, Canada Inc 2026. All rights reserved. [1]: https://bauschhealth.ca/ [2]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/ [3]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/who-we-are/ [4]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/our-mission-vision-and-values/ [5]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/canadian-leadership-team/ [6]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/our-canadian-locations/ [7]: https://bauschhealth.ca/about-us/contact-us/ [8]: https://bauschhealth.ca/products/ [9]: https://bauschhealth.ca/products/dermatology-products/ [10]: https://bauschhealth.ca/products/gastroenterology/ [11]: https://bauschhealth.ca/products/specialty-medicine/ [12]: https://bauschhealth.ca/products/weight-management/ [13]: https://bauschhealth.ca/products/canadian-product-list/ [14]: https://bauschhealth.ca/responsibility/ [15]: https://bauschhealth.ca/responsibility/canadian-compassionate-use-program/ [16]: https://bauschhealth.ca/responsibility/grants-and-investigator-initiated-studies/ [17]: https://bauschhealth.ca/newsroom/ [18]: https://bauschhealth.ca/careers/ [19]: https://bauschhealth.ca/careers/working-at-bausch-health/ [20]: https://bauschhealth.ca/fr/index/ [21]: /about/ [22]: /careers/ [23]: /who-we-are/ [24]: https://bauschhealth.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/BHC-CABTREO-Canada-QC-SK-Listing_FINAL-EN_2 1AUG2025.pdf [25]: https://bauschhealth.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/CABTREO-First-listings-FINAL-EN-July-9-2025 .pdf [26]: https://bauschhealth.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/CABTREO-pCPA-LOI-EN-FINAL-April-9-2025.pdf [27]: https://bauschhealth.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/CABTREO-Canada-release-EN-FINAL-Nov-18-2024 .pdf [28]: https://bauschhealth.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/CABTREO-Canada-approval-FINAL-EN-Sept-11-20 24.pdf [29]: https://bauschhealth.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/UCERIS-new-listings-news-release-EN-formatt ed-for-website-May-23-2024.pdf [30]: https://bauschhealth.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/ARAZLO-News-release-EN-2024-04-11.pdf [31]: /canadian-product-list/ [32]: /wp/contact-us/ [33]: /wp/terms/ [34]: /wp/site-map/ [35]: /social-media-community-guidelines/", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Bausch Health Canada — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Markets biosimilars in Canada. | Markets biosimilars in Canada, including for ophthalmology and dermatology. | Canada | Laval, Quebec, Canada", "role_description": "Marketer"}}, "X Score": "40", "Y Score": "49", "Overall Score": "44", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Baxter International", "Website": "https://www.baxter.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "United, States, Baxter", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Baxter markets biosimilars and biologic therapies globally.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "Baxter International — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Baxter markets biosimilars and biologic therapies globally.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "baxter.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "baxter.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\n\n## Utility Navigation\n* [Investors][2]\n* [Careers][3]\n* [Contact Us][4]\n* [Locations][5]\n* Language(EN) English\n\n[ [Home] ][6]\n* About Baxter\n  \n  About Baxter\n  \n  We’re everywhere healthcare happens, and everywhere it’s going. With an unmatched portfolio of\n  connected solutions, medical devices and injectable medicines, our team works alongside our\n  customers to provide the essential innovations and support they need to deliver the best patient\n  care possible.\n  \n  [Discover Who We Are][7]\n  [Clinician Examines a Patient with a Stethoscope]\n  * [ Sustainability ][8]\n  * [ Culture, Mission and Vision ][9]\n  * [ Our Evolution ][10]\n  * [ Governance ][11]\n  * [ Leadership ][12]\n  * [ Partners and Suppliers ][13]\n  Quick Links\n  * [ Affiliated Brands ][14]\n  * [ Sustainability Report ][15]\n  * [ Inclusion and Diversity ][16]\n  * [ Policies & Positions ][17]\n  * [ Purchase Order Terms & Conditions ][18]\n  * [ Ethics and Compliance ][19]\n* What We Do\n  \n  What We Do\n  \n  Discover how we’re redefining healthcare delivery—working alongside clinicians, patients and\n  caregivers to create a future where connected solutions help improve patient safety and enhance\n  the care experience.\n  \n  [Explore Our Offerings][20]\n  [Nurse caring for patient in bed]\n  * [ Products ][21]\n  * [ Care Settings ][22]\n  * [ Connected Care ][23]\n  * [ Support ][24]\n  Quick Links\n  * [ Important Product Updates (U.S.) ][25]\n  * [ Product Support ][26]\n  * [ Surgical Equipment and Technologies ][27]\n  * [ Infusion Therapies and Technologies ][28]\n  * [ Beds and Patient Mobility ][29]\n  * [ Care Communications ][30]\n  * [ Diagnostics and Examination ][31]\n* [ News and Insights ][32]\n* ## Utility Navigation\n  * [Investors][33]\n  * [Careers][34]\n  * [Contact Us][35]\n  * [Locations][36]\n  * Language(EN) English\n\n# Redefining Healthcare Delivery\n\n## Everywhere Care Happens\n\nWe are everywhere healthcare happens—and everywhere it is going, with essential solutions in the\nhospital, physician’s office and other sites of care. Every day, millions of patients and healthcare\nproviders rely on our unmatched portfolio of connected solutions, medical devices and advanced\ninjectable technologies to help deliver smarter, more personalized care. Together, we are redefining\nhow care is delivered to make a greater impact today, tomorrow and beyond.\n\n[About Baxter][37]\n[Nurse helping patient in Baxter smart bed]\n\n## The Future of Healthcare Is Connected\n\nConnected care is no longer optional—it’s essential. We’re addressing the challenges of healthcare\nby helping organizations integrate devices, streamline workflows and empower clinicians with data\nthat makes a difference.\n\n[See How][38]\n\n### $8B+\n\nInefficiencies, system downtimes and poor health IT integration have contributed to healthcare\nindustry losses exceeding $8 billion annually, up from $1.7 billion in 2017.¹\n\n### 80%\n\nWhile 8 out of 10 healthcare leaders see the clinical value in Internet of Things technologies,\nintegration with existing workflows is commonly cited as a top challenge.²\n\n## Shaping the Future of Care\n\nDriven by compassion and powered by innovation, we deliver connected solutions that transform\nhealthcare. By uniting life-saving technologies with the professionals who use them, we help improve\noutcomes, streamline workflows and create meaningful advancements for patients everywhere.\n\n[What We Do][39]\nProducts Connected Care Care Settings Support\nSelect... Products Connected Care Care Settings Support\nSelecting an option will show the corresponding tab content below\n\nFrom the first exam to complex treatments, we deliver products and digital solutions that help\npersonalize care, improve staff efficiency and support patient safety. Our portfolio spans care\ncommunications, infusion and nutrition, diagnostics, pharmaceuticals, surgical technologies, and\nmore—trusted tools designed to support patients and care teams at every step. \n* [**Beds and Mobility Equipment**][40]\n* [**Ca"}}, "page_text": "[ Skip to main content ][1] ## Utility Navigation * [Investors][2] * [Careers][3] * [Contact Us][4] * [Locations][5] * Language(EN) English [ [Home] ][6] * About Baxter About Baxter We’re everywhere healthcare happens, and everywhere it’s going. With an unmatched portfolio of connected solutions, medical devices and injectable medicines, our team works alongside our customers to provide the essential innovations and support they need to deliver the best patient care possible. [Discover Who We Are][7] [Clinician Examines a Patient with a Stethoscope] * [ Sustainability ][8] * [ Culture, Mission and Vision ][9] * [ Our Evolution ][10] * [ Governance ][11] * [ Leadership ][12] * [ Partners and Suppliers ][13] Quick Links * [ Affiliated Brands ][14] * [ Sustainability Report ][15] * [ Inclusion and Diversity ][16] * [ Policies & Positions ][17] * [ Purchase Order Terms & Conditions ][18] * [ Ethics and Compliance ][19] * What We Do What We Do Discover how we’re redefining healthcare delivery—working alongside clinicians, patients and caregivers to create a future where connected solutions help improve patient safety and enhance the care experience. [Explore Our Offerings][20] [Nurse caring for patient in bed] * [ Products ][21] * [ Care Settings ][22] * [ Connected Care ][23] * [ Support ][24] Quick Links * [ Important Product Updates (U.S.) ][25] * [ Product Support ][26] * [ Surgical Equipment and Technologies ][27] * [ Infusion Therapies and Technologies ][28] * [ Beds and Patient Mobility ][29] * [ Care Communications ][30] * [ Diagnostics and Examination ][31] * [ News and Insights ][32] * ## Utility Navigation * [Investors][33] * [Careers][34] * [Contact Us][35] * [Locations][36] * Language(EN) English # Redefining Healthcare Delivery ## Everywhere Care Happens We are everywhere healthcare happens—and everywhere it is going, with essential solutions in the hospital, physician’s office and other sites of care. Every day, millions of patients and healthcare providers rely on our unmatched portfolio of connected solutions, medical devices and advanced injectable technologies to help deliver smarter, more personalized care. Together, we are redefining how care is delivered to make a greater impact today, tomorrow and beyond. [About Baxter][37] [Nurse helping patient in Baxter smart bed] ## The Future of Healthcare Is Connected Connected care is no longer optional—it’s essential. We’re addressing the challenges of healthcare by helping organizations integrate devices, streamline workflows and empower clinicians with data that makes a difference. [See How][38] ### $8B+ Inefficiencies, system downtimes and poor health IT integration have contributed to healthcare industry losses exceeding $8 billion annually, up from $1.7 billion in 2017.¹ ### 80% While 8 out of 10 healthcare leaders see the clinical value in Internet of Things technologies, integration with existing workflows is commonly cited as a top challenge.² ## Shaping the Future of Care Driven by compassion and powered by innovation, we deliver connected solutions that transform healthcare. By uniting life-saving technologies with the professionals who use them, we help improve outcomes, streamline workflows and create meaningful advancements for patients everywhere. [What We Do][39] Products Connected Care Care Settings Support Select... Products Connected Care Care Settings Support Selecting an option will show the corresponding tab content below From the first exam to complex treatments, we deliver products and digital solutions that help personalize care, improve staff efficiency and support patient safety. Our portfolio spans care communications, infusion and nutrition, diagnostics, pharmaceuticals, surgical technologies, and more—trusted tools designed to support patients and care teams at every step. * [**Beds and Mobility Equipment**][40] * [**Care Collaboration and Communications**][41] * [**Diagnostics and Examination**][42] * [**Infusion and Nutrition**][43] * [**Pharmaceuticals**][44] * [**Respiratory Therapy and Devices**][45] * [**Surgical Equipment and Technologies **][46] [Explore All of Baxter’s Product Categories][47] [Our Products - Centrella Bed] We’re building a future where devices, data and teams work seamlessly together. By breaking down silos between systems, we help clinicians manage growing workloads, improve efficiency and deliver safer, more coordinated care. Connected care isn’t just technology, it’s the foundation for better experiences and enhanced patient safety outcomes. [See How We’re Connecting Care][48] [Connected care nurse with patient] We support clinicians and patients wherever care is delivered—bringing connected solutions, therapies and devices that improve efficiency, strengthen safety outcomes and adapt to the needs of each environment. We’re working every day to help clinicians treat patients more efficiently and effectively across many care settings, including the following: * **Hospitals and Health Systems, **including medical-surgical suites, operating rooms, emergency rooms, nurses’ stations and intensive care units * **Physician Offices & Alternate Sites,** including primary care practices, ambulatory surgery centers, skilled nursing facilities, long-term care facilities, oncology and infusion clinics and cardiac diagnostics centers * **Home Care** for respiratory and nutritional therapies * **Hospital Pharmacies** including medication preparation and compounding [Care Settings][49] [A healthcare worker poses in a hospital room next to infusion pumps with a bag attached] We’re here to back the people behind every solution: care teams, biomedical technicians and IT specialists. Whether you need technical assistance, product training, or self-service tools, we provide the resources to keep your products and systems running smoothly. You can find the following on our Support page: * [**Medical Affairs**][50] * [**Ordering Support**][51] * [**Patient Support**][52] * [**Product Support **][53] [Get Support][54] [Healthcare workers shaking hands with a man in a suit] ## Our Latest Stories, Insights and News Stay in touch with the latest perspectives and announcements from important members of our collective healthcare community. [See All Insights and News][55] Featured [Izzy sits on a deck next to Baxter the dog, who is wearing a Baxter neckscarf] Article ### From Pump to Pup: Finding Comfort in 'Baxter' Izzy, a young cancer fighter and survivor, spent much of her treatment with a special partner by her side: her dog, Baxter. [A healthcare worker smiling at the camera] Article ### Technology and Service Support Chronic Disease Management at Home Conditions such as hypertension, respiratory illnesses and cardiac issues can be monitored effectively with innovative tools and connected devices, helping support quality of life and efficient care. [A group of Baxter employees at a baseball game] Article ### The Power of Teamwork to Support Patient Care Teams bridged the pandemic and borders to bring an innovative ICU bed to life. [A worker in a hardhat manipulates a graphic with charts in front of robot manufacturing arms] Article ### Supply Chain Innovation Delivers More Nimble, Efficient Solutions The COVID-19 pandemic exposed the fragility of the global supply chain. Want to renovate your house? Expect a 6-month delay in building materials. Buying a smartphone? With an astounding 2,000 components in many of the latest models, just one missing element creates a bottleneck in manufacturing and represents billions of dollars in lost revenue. Similar supply chain threats exist in the medtech industry. Press Releases Press Release August 19, 2026 ### Baxter Appoints John Rogers Chief Financial Officer Press Release July 30, 2026 ### Baxter Reports Second-Quarter 2026 Results Press Release July 9, 2026 ### Baxter to Host Second-Quarter 2026 Financial Results Conference Call for Investors Press Release June 22, 2026 ### Baxter Publishes 2025 Sustainability Report Highlighting Refreshed Strategy, Ongoing Commitment ### to Drive Meaningful Impact ## This is where we are driven by purpose and powered by people Ready to discover where your passion meets purpose? Explore our career opportunities and learn more about the people, culture, and vision that define who we are. Whether you’re looking to grow your skills, contribute to groundbreaking projects, or be part of a community that cares, you’ll find your next chapter here. We invite you to join us in redefining the future of healthcare. [Careers at Baxter][56] [Baxter Employees in Factory Showing Hearts with Hands] ## References 1. Diaz, N. (2024, October 1). Health IT inefficiencies are costing hospitals billions. Becker’s Hospital Review. [https://www.beckershospitalreview.com/healthcare-information-technology/health-it-inefficiencies -are-costing-hospitals-billions/][57] 2. Jacobson, S., Jones, R., Doty, B., Cook, C., & Chang, C. (2025, May 27). Connected care is here. How can MedTech help move the industry forward? Deloitte Center for Health Solutions. [https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/health-care/medtech-connected-care-innovation.h tml][58] Collapsed [[Baxter]][59] * [ About Baxt