 participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: BeiGene is a biopharmaceutical company that develops and markets biologics, including tislelizumab, in Asia Pacific. It owns and markets its products. | Markets tislelizumab and other biologics in Asia Pacific. | China | Beijing, China", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "80", "Y Score": "75", "Overall Score": "78", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Benitec Biopharma", "Website": "https://www.benitec.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Hayward, USA", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Australia)", "Operational Presence": "United States; Australia", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops gene-silencing biologics (RNAi-based therapeutics).", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Benitec Biopharma — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops gene-silencing biologics (RNAi-based therapeutics).", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "benitec.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "benitec.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to main content][1] [Skip to footer][2]\n[ [Benitec Biopharma Inc. Corporate Page] ][3]\nSearch\nMENU CLOSE\n* [About Us][4]\n  * [Overview][5]\n  * [Board][6]\n  * [Management Team][7]\n  * [Corporate Directory][8]\n* [Our Science][9]\n  * [Gene Silencing][10]\n  * [Intellectual Property][11]\n  * [Partnering][12]\n* [Our Programs][13]\n  * [Areas of Research][14]\n  * [Pipeline][15]\n  * [Presentations and Publications][16]\n  * [Clinical Trials][17]\n* [For Investors][18]\n  * [Overview][19]\n  * [News & Events][20]\n  * [Company Info][21]\n  * [Financial Info][22]\n  * [Stock Data][23]\n  * [SEC Filings][24]\n  * [Governance][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n* Search\n\n# Benitec Biopharma Inc.\n\n## Giving Disease the Silent Treatment\n\nWe have created a novel combination of gene therapy and RNA interference (gene silencing) to change\ntreatment paradigms of human disease.\n\n[Explore ddRNAi Technology][27] [Play Video][28]\nAbout\n\n## [ About Us ][29]\n\nWith our leading gene therapy capabilities and highly credentialed scientific and management team,\nwe play an essential role in the scientific community by advancing novel treatment options for\ntreating human diseases.\n\nInvest\n\n## Investor Centre\n\nView share prices and more for Benitec Biopharma Inc.\n\nExplore\n\n## Pipeline\n\nOur in-house programs target chronic and life-threatening conditions which are gene-associated, and\nfor which there is no effective treatment or cure.\n\nExplore\n\n## Our Science\n\nPermanent gene silencing with DNA-Directed RNA Interference (ddRNAi).\n* About Us\n  * [Overview][30]\n  * [Board][31]\n  * [Management Team][32]\n  * [Corporate Directory][33]\n* Our Science\n  * [Gene Silencing][34]\n  * [Intellectual Property][35]\n  * [Partnering][36]\n* Our Programs\n  * [Areas of Research][37]\n  * [Pipeline][38]\n  * [Presentations and Publications][39]\n  * [Clinical Trials][40]\n* For Investors\n  * [Overview][41]\n  * [News & Events][42]\n  * [Company Info][43]\n  * [Financial Info][44]\n  * [Stock Data][45]\n  * [SEC Filings][46]\n  * [Governance][47]\n* Additional Information\n  * [Privacy Policy][48]\n  * [Disclaimer][49]\n  * [Sitemap][50]\n  * [Accessibility Statement][51]\n* Address\n  \n  Benitec Biopharma\n  3940 Trust Way\n  Hayward, CA. 94545\n  United States\n  P: [+1 (510) 780-0634][52]\n  E. [info@benitec.com][53]\n\nBy [Drawhistory][54] & [Hatchet][55]\n\n[1]: #mainContent\n[2]: #footer\n[3]: /\n[4]: #submenu-about-us\n[5]: /about-us\n[6]: /for-investors/governance/board-of-directors\n[7]: /for-investors/company-info/management-team\n[8]: /for-investors/company-info/contacts\n[9]: #submenu-our-science\n[10]: /our-science/gene-silencing\n[11]: /our-science/intellectual-property\n[12]: /our-science/partnering\n[13]: #submenu-our-programs\n[14]: /our-programs/areas-of-research\n[15]: /our-programs/pipeline\n[16]: /our-programs/presentations-and-publications\n[17]: /our-programs/clinical-trials\n[18]: #submenu-for-investors\n[19]: /for-investors\n[20]: /for-investors/news-events\n[21]: /for-investors/company-info\n[22]: /for-investors/financial-info\n[23]: /for-investors/stock-data\n[24]: /for-investors/sec-filings\n[25]: /for-investors/governance\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: /our-science/gene-silencing\n[28]: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UuicPthdT70\n[29]: /for-investors/company-info\n[30]: /about-us\n[31]: /for-investors/governance/board-of-directors\n[32]: /for-investors/company-info/management-team\n[33]: /for-investors/company-info/contacts\n[34]: /our-science/gene-silencing\n[35]: /our-science/intellectual-property\n[36]: /our-science/partnering\n[37]: /our-programs/areas-of-research\n[38]: /our-programs/pipeline\n[39]: /our-programs/presentations-and-publications\n[40]: /our-programs/clinical-trials\n[41]: /for-investors\n[42]: /for-investors/news-events\n[43]: /for-investors/company-info\n[44]: /for-investors/financial-info\n[45]: /for-investors/stock-data\n[46]: /for-investors/sec-filings\n[47]: /for-investors/governance\n[48]: /privacy-policy\n[49]: /disclaimer\n[50]: /sitemap\n[51]: /accessibility-statement\n[52]: tel:+15107800634\n[53]: mailto:info@benitec.com"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] [Skip to footer][2] [ [Benitec Biopharma Inc. Corporate Page] ][3] Search MENU CLOSE * [About Us][4] * [Overview][5] * [Board][6] * [Management Team][7] * [Corporate Directory][8] * [Our Science][9]