.": "", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Bharat Biotech — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Vaccine and biologic manufacturer with products like Revac-B and other biologics.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "bharatbiotech.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "bharatbiotech.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Toggle navigation [[Bhart Biotech Logo]][1]\n* [Company ][2]\n  * [Vision & Mission][3]\n  * [History & Milestones][4]\n  * [Leadership ][5]\n    * [Founder's Profile][6]\n    * [Management team][7]\n  * [Chairman's Message][8]\n  * [Accolades][9]\n  * [EH&S ][10]\n  * [Quality Control][11]\n* [Research ][12]\n  * [Patents][13]\n  * [Publications][14]\n  * [Manufacturing Facilities][15]\n  * [R&D Pipeline ][16]\n  * [Clinical Research][17]\n  * [Research Areas][18]\n  * [Partnerships][19]\n  * [Exports][20]\n* [Products ][21]\n  * [Vaccines ][22]\n    * [Biohib^{®}][23]\n    * [Biopolio^{®}][24]\n    * [Chikungunya^{®}][25]\n    * [Comvac 4^{®}][26]\n    * [Comvac 5^{®}][27]\n    * [COVAXIN^{®}][28]\n    * [Hillchol^{®}][29]\n    * [HNVAC^{®}][30]\n    * [iNCOVACC^{®}][31]\n    * [Indirab^{®}][32]\n    * [JENVAC^{®}][33]\n    * [Revac-B mcf^{®}][34]\n    * [Revac-B^{®}+][35]\n    * [ROTAVAC^{®}][36]\n    * [ROTAVAC 5D^{®}][37]\n    * [Typbar^{®}][38]\n    * [Typbar TCV^{®}][39]\n  * [Therapeutics ][40]\n    * [SLVRGEN^{®}][41]\n    * [Biogit^{®}][42]\n    * [Regen-D^{®} 150][43]\n    * [Regen-D^{®} 60][44]\n* [Corporate Governance ][45]\n  * [Other Resources][46]\n  * [CSR Policy][47]\n  * [Nomination and Remuneration Policy][48]\n  * [POSH Policy][49]\n  * [Vigil Mechanism][50]\n  * [Announcements & Notices][51]\n* [Careers ][52]\n  * [HR Philosophy][53]\n  * [Apply][54]\n  * [Work @ Bharat Biotech][55]\n* [Media ][56]\n  * [Announcements][57]\n  * [Bharat in News][58]\n  * [Gallery][59]\n  * [Corporate Profile][60]\n  * [Press Releases][61]\n* [Contact ][62]\n  * [Route map][63]\n[30 Years Logo]\n[Typhoid Vaccine Typbar TCV Family]\n[Typhoid Vaccine Typbar TCV]\n[Rotavac Vaccine]\n[Jenvac Vaccine]\n[ Previous ][64] [ Next ][65]\n\n##### Three Decades of Innovation\n\nFor 30 years, we have been creating innovative vaccines and biotherapeutics for people across the\nworld to lead healthier lives.\n\nRead More\n[twenty years of bharat biotech]\n\n##### AT THE CUTTING-EDGE OF SCIENCE\n\nAs a research-led company, we have successfully pursued scientific breakthroughs to overcome\nchallenging diseases.\n\nRead More\n\n##### Three Decades of Innovation\n\nFor 30 years, we have been creating innovative vaccines and bio-therapeutics that help patients\naround the world lead healthier lives.\n\n[BBIL twenty years]\n\n##### At the cutting-edge of science\n\nAs a research-led company, we have successfully pursued scientific breakthroughs that help patients\novercome challenging diseases.\n\n** Hillchol^{®} - A Breakthrough Single-Strain Oral Cholera Vaccine for Global Prevention. ROTAVAC\n5D^{®} - The World's First Liquid, Low-Dose Rotavirus Vaccine for Easy Storage & Administration.\nTypbar TCV^{®} - The World's First WHO-Prequalified Typhoid Conjugate Vaccine for Long-Term\nProtection.**\n\n[DR Krishna M Ella Message]\n\n## Global Leaders In Clinical Research\n\n[clinical-trials]\n[ [Bharath Biotech] ][66]\n[ [Lead Innovation] ][67]\n[ [Rotavac-5D] ][68]\n[ Previous ][69] [ Next ][70]\n\n\n\nBharat Biotech is a pioneering biotechnology company known for its world-class R&D and manufacturing\ncapabilities. Our mission is to deliver affordable, safe and high-quality vaccines and\nbio-therapeutics that help people prevail over diseases. We seek to lead innovation in biotechnology\nin order to lead the fight against disease with a focus on emerging markets.\n\nQuick Links\n* [Overview][71]\n* [History & Milestones][72]\n* [Founder's Profile][73]\n* [Accolades][74]\n* [Quality Control][75]\n* [Publications][76]\n* [Clinical Research][77]\n* [Manufacturing Facilities][78]\n* [Partnerships][79]\n* [HR Philosophy][80]\n* [Media Library][81]\n* [Bharat in News][82]\n* [Press Releases][83]\n* [Research Areas][84]\n* [R&D Pipeline][85]\n* [Patents][86]\n* [EH&S ][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\nOur Products\n* [Biohib][89]\n* [Biogit][90]\n* [Biopolio][91]\n* [Chikungunya^{®}][92]\n* [Comvac 4][93]\n* [Comvac 5][94]\n* [Hillchol][95]\n* [HNVAC][96]\n* [Indirab][97]\n* [iNCOVACC][98]\n* [JENVAC][99]\n* [Revac-B mcf][100]\n* [Revac-B+][101]\n* [Regen-D 150][102]\n* [Regen-D 60][103]\n* [ROTAVAC][104]\n* [R"}}, "page_text": "Toggle navigation [[Bhart Biotech Logo]][1] * [Company ][2] * [Vision & Mission][3] * [History & Milestones][4] * [Leadership ][5] * [Founder's Profile][6] * [Management team][7] * [Chairman's Message][8] * [Accolades][9] * [EH&S ][10] * [Quality Control][11] * [Research ][12] * [Patents][13] * [Publications][14] * [Manufacturing Facilities][15] * [R&D Pipeline ][16] * [Clinical Research][17] * [Research Areas][18] * [Partnerships][19] * [Exports][20] * [Products ][21] * [Vaccines ][22] * [Biohib^{®}][23] * [Biopolio^{®}][24] * [Chikungunya^{®}][25] * [Comvac 4^{®}][26] * [Comvac 5^{®}][27] * [COVAXIN^{®}][28] * [Hillchol^{®}][29] * [HNVAC^{®}][30] * [iNCOVACC^{®}][31] * [Indirab^{®}][32] * [JENVAC^{®}][33] * [Revac-B mcf^{®}][34] * [Revac-B^{®}+][35] * [ROTAVAC^{®}][36] * [ROTAVAC 5D^{®}][37] * [Typbar^{®}][38] * [Typbar TCV^{®}][39] * [Therapeutics ][40] * [SLVRGEN^{®}][41] * [Biogit^{®}][42] * [Regen-D^{®} 150][43] * [Regen-D^{®} 60][44] * [Corporate Governance ][45] * [Other Resources][46] * [CSR Policy][47] * [Nomination and Remuneration Policy][48] * [POSH Policy][49] * [Vigil Mechanism][50] * [Announcements & Notices][51] * [Careers ][52] * [HR Philosophy][53] * [Apply][54] * [Work @ Bharat Biotech][55] * [Media ][56] * [Announcemen