ded by our shared mission, we are focused on delivering life-changing therapies to patients everywhere. [MORE >>][144] ### WHO WE ARE ## Driven by purpose. We are a global biopharmaceutical company with the belief that everyone, everywhere deserves access to affordable quality medicines. [MORE >>][145] ### OUR BUSINESSES ## Focused on delivering life-changing ## therapies to patients everywhere. [ GENERICS >> [...] ][146] [ BIOSIMILARS >> [...] ][147] [ RESEARCH SERVICES >> [...] ][148] [ NOVEL BIOLOGICS >> [...] ][149] ## GLOBAL PRESENCE 0 + Countries 0 + Employees 0 + Patents Granted 0 + Registered Trademarks ## VIDEOS Biocon Advancing Access to Cancer Care – BBC StoryWorks Rewriting Cancer Biocon Brand Purpose Film ## NEWS * [ Biocon Biocon Announces Pegfilgrastim Biosimilar Marketing Approval by Japan Ministry of Health, Labour and Welfare (MHLW) Tue, 25-Aug-2026 ][150] [ Details][151] * [ Biocon Announces U.S. FDA Approval for Yesintek® (ustekinumab-kfce) Single-dose Prefilled Autoinjector Tue, 18-Aug-2026 ][152] [ Details][153] * [ Biocon Q1FY27 Total Income at Rs 4,391 Cr, Up 9%; EBITDA at Rs 902 Cr; Net Profit at Rs 141 Cr; Biopharma Revenue Up 17% Wed, 05-Aug-2026 ][154] [ Details][155] [MORE >>][156] ## [INTEGRATED ANNUAL REPORT 2026][157] Science For People **Advancing Impact** [VIEW >>][158] ## [BRSR & ESG DATA BOOK 2026][159] Science For People **Advancing Impact** [View >>][160] ## [GOVERNANCE][161] Behind consistent growth is good governance. [MORE >>][162] ### RESPONSIBILITY ## Transforming ## tomorrow. Biocon is committed to address the world’s developmental challenges [More >>][163] #### Quick Links * [Home][164] * [About Us][165] * [Investors][166] * [Careers][167] * [Fact Sheet][168] * [Key Therapeutic Areas][169] * [News][170] * [Responsibility][171] * [Products][172] #### Businesses * [Generics][173] * [Biosimilars][174] * [Novel Biologics][175] * [Research Services][176] #### Recommended Sites * [ABLE][177] * [DBT][178] * [IBAB][179] * [Scienc