karriere/biogen-als-arbeitgeber.html [119]: /karriere/ihr-einstieg-bei-biogen.html [120]: /nutzungsbedingungen.html [121]: /datenschutzrichtlinien.html [122]: /cookies.html [123]: /impressum.html [124]: /ueber-uns/kontakt.html [125]: https://www.youtube.com/@Biogen_Deutschland [126]: https://www.instagram.com/biogen_deutschland/ [127]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/biogen-/ [128]: https://www.facebook.com/Biogen/", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Biogen GmbH — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: German subsidiary of Biogen, marketing biologics; owns and markets its products. | German subsidiary of Biogen, marketing biologics in Germany | Germany | Munich, Germany, Its", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "69", "Y Score": "61", "Overall Score": "65", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Biogen Idec Limited", "Website": "https://www.biogen.co.uk", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Berkshire, United, Kingdom", "Continent / Geography": "EU(United Kingdom)", "Operational Presence": "United Kingdom", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "UK affiliate of Biogen, a biotechnology company specializing in neurological biologics.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "Biogen Idec Limited — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: UK affiliate of Biogen, a biotechnology company specializing in neurological biologics; markets products under its brand.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "biogen.co.uk", "data": {"company": {"name": "biogen.co.uk"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[[Biogen]][1]\n[ [Biogen] ][2]\nMenu Close\n* [Company][3]\n  * [About Us][4]\n  * [Team][5]\n  * [Locations][6]\n  * [Careers][7]\n  * [Contact][8]\n  Back\n* [Services][9]\n  * [Food Waste Recycling][10]\n  * [Local Authorities][11]\n  * [Fertiliser for Agriculture][12]\n  * [Energy Offtake Agreements][13]\n  * [Crop Purchasing][14]\n  Back\n* [Case Studies][15]\n* [News][16]\n* [Contact][17]\n\n© 2026 Biogen (UK) Ltd, Milton Parc, Milton Ernest, Bedfordshire, MK44 1YU Reg. in England No.\n5616520. All Rights Reserved. Website by [Lewis Edward][18]\n\n×\n\n19\n\n19 AD Facilities operating across the UK.\n\n×\n\n37 MWe\n\nGenerating capacity\n\n×\n\n650,000\n\n650,000 tonnes of organic waste recycled every year.\n\n×\n\n120,000\n\nHouseholds can be powered by our sites\n\n# Biogen is the UK's leading Anaerobic Digestion plant owner and operator, producing renewable\n# energy locations across the country. We have national coverage and are leading the transition from\n# fossil gas to homegrown biomethane.\n\nAbout Us Locations¹⁹\nPlay\nPlay\n\n12\n\nFood Waste AD Plants\n\n7\n\nAgricultural AD Plants\n\n250+\n\nWaste Producing Customers\n\nTrusted by over 250 customers, including local authorities, national retailers and leading waste\nmanagement companies, Biogen helps organisations manage food waste efficiently and cost‑effectively.\nThe business supports all collection methods, from bulk collections and roll‑on roll‑offs to food\nbins and palletised stock, delivering solutions that fit seamlessly into customers’ operations.\n\nBulk collections, roll-on-offs, food bins, palletized stock. We cater for all collection\nmethodologies. Our team have an exceptional level of expertise in waste management both\noperationally and commercially. We will find the most cost-effective methodology of collecting your\nfood waste and roll it out for you seamlessly.\n\n[\n[Food Waste Recycling]\n\nFeatured\n\n### Food Waste Recycling\n\nBiogen provides reliable, compliant and sustainable food waste recycling across the UK, processing\ndiverse waste streams into renewable energy through its national network of AD plants and transfer\nstations.\n\nLearn More\n][19]\n[\n[Local Authorities]\n\nFeatured\n\n### Local Authorities\n\nBiogen treats over 150,000 tonnes of local authority food waste annually, providing flexible\ncollection solutions, transparent reporting and high‑quality, customer‑focused services to councils\nacross the UK and Channel Islands.\n\nLearn More\n][20]\n[\n[Fertiliser for Agriculture]\n\nFeatured\n\n### Fertiliser for Agriculture\n\nBiogen supplies PAS110‑certified liquid digestate to farmers—an efficient, sustainable biofertiliser\nthat returns nutrients to the land, reduces reliance on synthetic fertilisers and supports a\ncircular agricultural system.\n\nLearn More\n][21]\n[\n[Energy Offtake Agreements]\n\nFeatured\n\n### Energy Offtake Agreements\n\nBiogen offers long‑term renewable energy offtake agreements that provide organisations with stable,\nfully traceable biomethane or green electricity, supporting price certainty, carbon reduction and\nprogress toward net‑zero goals.\n\nLearn More\n][22]\n[\n[Crop Purchasing]\n\nFeatured\n\n### Crop Purchasing\n\nBiogen partners with farmers to purchase energy crops for its AD facilities, offering flexible\nsupply agreements that support reliable feedstock, farm resilience and the generation of low‑carbon\nrenewable energy.\n\nLearn More\n][23]\n\nProcess Biogen has over 20 years experience of owning and operating AD plants. Biogen has\nindustry-leading operational expertise resulting in market leading site avaliability. Partnering\nwith Biogen gives our clients class leading customer service and peace of mind.\n\nCrops &\nAgri-Residues\nFood Waste\nDepackaging &\nPre-treatment\nAnaerobic\nDigestion\nGas Holder\nGas Network\nInjection\nBio-Fertiliser\nCombined Heat\n& Power\nElectricity\n\n01\n\nFood waste is collected from supermarkets, restaurants, manufacturers and households.\n\n02\n\nAt our AD plant the organic matter is depackaged and processed to produce biogas.\n\n03\n\nThe biogas is captured and fed into super-efficient gas engines to ge"}}, "page_text": "[[Biogen]][1] [ [Biogen] ][2] Menu Close * [Company][3] * [About Us][4] * [Team][5] * [Locations][6] * [Careers][7] * [Contact][8] Back * [Services][9] * [Food Waste Recycling][10] * [Local Authorities][11] * [Fertiliser for Agriculture][12] * [Energy Offtake Agreements][13] * [Crop Purchasing][14] Back * [Case Studies][15] * [News][16] * [Contact][17] © 2026 Biogen (UK) Ltd, Milton Parc, Milton Ernest, Bedfordshire, MK44 1YU Reg. in England No. 5616520. All Rights Reserved. Website by [Lewis Edward][18] × 19 19 AD Facilities operating across the UK. × 37 MWe Generating capacity × 650,000 650,000 tonnes of organic waste recycled every year. × 120,000 Households can be powered by our sites # Biogen is the UK's leading Anaerobic Digestion plant owner and operator, producing renewable # energy locations across the country. We have national coverage and are leading the transition from # fossil gas to homegrown biomethane. About Us Locations¹⁹ Play Play 12 Food Waste AD Plants 7 Agricultural AD Plants 250+ Waste Producing Customers Trusted by over 250 customers, including local authorities, national retailers and leading waste management companies, Biogen helps organisations manage food waste efficiently and cost‑effectively. The business supports all collection methods, from bulk collections and roll‑on roll‑offs to food bins and palletised stock, delivering solutions that fit seamlessly into customers’ operations. Bulk collections, roll-on-offs, food bins, palletized stock. We cater for all collection methodologies. Our team have an exceptional level of expertise in waste management both operationally and commercially. We will find the most cost-effective methodology of collecting your food waste and roll it out for you seamlessly. [ [Food Waste Recycling] Featured ### Food Waste Recycling Biogen provides reliable, compliant and sustainable food waste recycling across the UK, processing diverse waste streams into renewable energy through its national network of AD plants and transfer stations. Learn More ][19] [ [Local Authorities] Featured ### Local Authorities Biogen treats over 150,000 tonnes of local authority food waste annually, providing flexible collection solutions, transparent reporting and high‑quality, customer‑focused services to councils across the UK and Channel Islands. Learn More ][20] [ [Fertiliser for Agriculture] Featured ### Fertiliser for Agriculture Biogen supplies PAS110‑certified liquid digestate to farmers—an efficient, sustainable biofertiliser that returns nutrients to the land, reduces reliance on synthetic fertilisers and supports a circular agricultural system. Learn More ][21] [ [Energy Offtake Agreements] Featured ### Energy Offtake Agreements Biogen offers long‑term renewable energy offtake agreements that provide organisations with stable, fully traceable biomethane or green electricity, supporting price certainty, carbon reduction and progress toward net‑zero goals. Learn More ][22] [ [Crop Purchasing] Featured ### Crop Purchasing Biogen partners with farmers to purchase energy crops for its AD facilities, offering flexible supply agreements that support reliable feedstock, farm resilience and the generation of low‑carbon renewable energy. Learn More ][23] Process Biogen has over 20 years experience of owning and operating AD plants. Biogen has industry-leading operational expertise resulting in market leading site avaliability. Partnering with Biogen gives our clients class leading customer service and peace of mind. Crops & Agri-Residues Food Waste Depackaging & Pre-treatment Anaerobic Digestion Gas Holder Gas Network Injection Bio-Fertiliser Combined Heat & Power Electricity 01 Food waste is collected from supermarkets, restaurants, manufacturers and households. 02 At our AD plant the organic matter is depackaged and processed to produce biogas. 03 The biogas is captured and fed into super-efficient gas engines to generate renewable electricity for the grid. 04 Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. 05 Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. [ [Biogen Pilots Internal Haulage on Key Route] ][24] Announcements ### [ Biogen Pilots Internal Haulage on Key Route ][25] [ [Biogen take on the Edale Skyline Walk] ][26] Community ### [ Biogen take on the Edale Skyline Walk ][27] [ [Biogen supports Bedford Foodbank] ][28] Community ### [ Biogen supports Bedford Foodbank ][29] [ [Biogen join the Green Gas Task Force] ][30] Announcements ### [ Biogen join the Green Gas Task Force ][31] [ [Biogen recognised in Award for Contribution to Tackling Net Zero] ][32] Awards and Recognition ### [ Biogen recognised in Award for Contribution to Tackling Net Zero ][33] [ [Biogen acquires five AD plants from Ingenious] ][34] Industry News ### [ Biogen acquires five AD plants from Ingenious ][35] #### Our scope 4 is your scope 3. Our sustainability reporting can help you calculate your scope 3 #### emissions and the carbon offset impact of treating food waste through anaerobic digestion. On #### average our plants offset 691kg carbon per tonne of food waste treated. Learn more Locations ### Find your nearest site Explore Contact ### Speak to our team Learn More # The UK’s leading AD operator, providing a cost effective and sustainable food waste recycling # service for local authorities and commercial organisations. Turning food waste into renewable # energy and nutrient-rich bio-fertiliser. * [ADBA — Anaerobic Digestion and Bioresources Association] * [Toitū Carbon Reduce — ISO 14064-1 Organisation] * [REA — Renewable Energy Association] * [ISO 9001 Registered — UKAS Management Systems 