ublikationen][209] * Medien & PR #### [ Medien & PR][210] [[Medien & PR]][211] Willkommen im Biotest Pressebereich * [ Pressemitteilungen][212] * [ Publikationen][213] * [ Downloadcenter][214] * [ Kontakt][215] * Investor Relations #### [ Investor Relations][216] [[Investor Relations]][217] Werte schaffen für unsere Aktionäre * [ Informationen zum Rechtsformwechsel][218] * [ News und Publikationen ][219] * [ Biotest Pressemitteilungen][220] * [ Geschäftsberichte][221] * [ Finanzkalender][222] * [ Biotest Aktie][223] * [ Aktieninformationen/ Stammdaten][224] * [ Aktionäre][225] * [ Hauptversammlung 2026][226] * [ Archiv 2025][227] * [ Archiv 2024 - 2019][228] * [ Corporate Governance][229] * [ Erklärung zur Unternehmensführung][230] * [ Entsprechenserklärung][231] * [ Satzung][232] * [ Frauenanteil in Führungspositionen ][233] * [ Kontakt & Services][234] * Karriere #### [ Karriere][235] [[Karriere]][236] Motiviert, mit uns Leben zu retten? * [ Karriereportal][237] * Kontakt #### [ Kontakt][238] [[Kontakt]][239] * [ Anfahrt][240] * [ Sicherheitsunterweisung für externe Besucher][241] * [ Auftragsannahme für Deutschland][242] * [ Internationale Aufträge und Anfragen][243] * [ Melden von Verdachtsfällen auf Nebenwirkungen][244] * [ Nebenwirkungen aus Saudi-Arabien][245] * [ Medizinische Anfragen][246] * [ Hinweise zu medizinischen Anfragen][247] * [ Anfragen zur Serialisierung und zum Fälschungsschutz][248] * [ Biotest SpeakUp Helpline][249] [Seite drucken][250] # Formwechsel ## Wir firmieren jetzt unter Biotest GmbH & Co. KGaA [Weitere Informationen][251] ## Karriere # Karriere Motiviert, mit Biotest Leben zu retten? [Weitere Informationen][252] ## Unser Produktangebot # Intensivmedizin Im Bereich der Intensivmedizin stellt Biotest verschiedene, aus dem menschlichen Plasma gewonnene Produkte her. Das beinhaltet Pentaglobin, ein IgM-angereichertes Immunglobulinpräparat, und weitere intravenös applizierbare Lösungen zur Behandlung von schwerwiegenden bakteriellen Infektionen, Gerinnungsstörungen und Volumen- bzw. Proteinsubstitution. [Weitere Informationen][253] # Hämatologie Zur Behandlung der Hämophilie A und B stellt Biotest zwei intravenös applizierbare Präparate her, welche aus menschlichem Plasma gewonnen werden. [Weitere Informationen][254] # Klinische Immunologie Biotest stellt verschiedene Antikörperkonzentrate aus menschlichem Plasma her, die als Fertiglösung zur intravenösen Applikation zur Verfügung stehen. Dazu gehören das polyvalente Immunglobulin G-Präparat Intratect und Hyperimmunglobulinpräparate mit einem erhöhten Titer an Antikörpern gegen Cytomegaloviren (CMV), Hepatitis-B-Viren (HBV) oder Varizella-Zoster-Viren (VZV). [Weitere Informationen][255] ## **Human Albumin für Industriekunden** Durch seine vielfältigen biologischen Eigenschaften, seiner Stabilität und hohen Löslichkeit eignet sich Biotest Human Serum Albumin hervorragend als multifunktionaler Hilfsstoff für biotechnologische, pharmazeutische und diagnostische Anwendungen. Es ist GMP-konform hergestellt und erfüllt in vielen Ländern die regulatorischen Anforderungen für diese Zwecke. [Weitere Informationen][256] ## Unsere Forschungsprojekte nach Therapiegebieten ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬─────────┬─────────┬───────────┬──────── ### Phase 1 │### Phase│### Phase│### Zulassu│### Laun │### 2 │### 3 │### ng │### ch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────┼─────────┼───────────┼──────── IgG Next Generation / Yimmugo (BT595) - Primäre │ │ │ │ Immundefizienz (PID) │ │ │ │ ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────┼─────────┼───────────┼──────── IgG Next Generation / Yimmugo (BT595) - │ │ │ │ Immunthrombocytopenie (ITP) │ │ │ │ ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────┼─────────┼────", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Biotest AG — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Biotest is a biopharmaceutical company that markets plasma-derived and recombinant biologics, owning and marketing its products. | Biotest markets plasma-derived and recombinant biologics. | Germany | Dreieich, Germany", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "49", "Y Score": "48", "Overall Score": "48", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Biovac", "Website": "https://www.biovac.co.za", "Founded": "2003", "Headquarters": "Cape Town, South Africa", "Continent / Geography": "AF(South Africa)", "Operational Presence": "South Africa", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Produces and supplies vaccines and biologics, partnering with global companies to manufacture in Africa.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "ZA", "Region Code": "AF", "Summary": "Biovac — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Produces and supplies vaccines and biologics, partnering to manufacture in Africa; it markets its own products.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "biovac.co.za", "data": {"company": {"name": "Biovac", "domain": "biovac.co.za", "description": "Biovac is a bio-pharmaceutical company based in Cape Town, established in 2003 through a partnership with the South African government to create local vaccine manufacturing capability. The company focuses on the development, end-to-end manufacture, and global supply of vaccines and other biologicals, with a vision to be the leading biopharmaceutical company in Africa.", "founded_year": 2003, "headquarters": {"city": "Cape Town", "country": "South Africa"}}, "business": {"products": [{"name": "Paediatric vaccines", "category": "Vaccines", "description": "Vaccines for children, manufactured through technology transfers from international pharmaceutical companies."}, {"name": "Other biologicals", "category": "Biological products", "description": "Development and manufacture of additional biological products."}], "services": [{"name": "Vaccine development", "category": "Development", "description": "Research and development of vaccine products."}, {"name": "End-to-end vaccine manufacturing", "category": "Manufacturing", "description": "Full-scale manufacturing of vaccines, including aseptic production."}], "industries": ["Public Health", "Government", "Healthcare"], "key_markets": ["South Africa", "Africa", "Global"]}, "financials": {"key_numbers": [], "employee_count": null, "scale_signals": []}, "relationships": {"customers": [], "investors": []}, "intel": "Biovac is a key player in African vaccine manufacturing, established with government support to ensure local vaccine security. Its partnerships with international pharmaceutical companies and collaborations with The Wellcome Trust and Boston Consulting Group highlight its strategic role in scaling up regional capacity. The company targets national health systems in Africa and globally, operating across public health and government sectors.", "location": {"offices": ["Cape Town"], "countries": ["South Africa"], "regions_served": ["Africa", "Global"]}, "media": {"articles": [], "press_releases": [], "investor_presentations": []}}, "page_text": "", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Biovac — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Produces and supplies vaccines and biologics, partnering to manufacture in Africa; it markets its own products. | Produces and supplies vaccines and biologics, partnering with global companies to manufacture in Africa. | South Africa | Cape Town, South Africa", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "40", "Y Score"