.html [79]: /research-and-development.html [80]: /medicines.html [81]: /medical-resources.html [82]: /our-impact.html [83]: /life-and-science.html [84]: /news-and-media.html [85]: /investors.html [86]: /our-company.html [87]: /our-commitments.html [88]: /legal-notice.html [89]: /privacy-policy.html [90]: # [91]: /trademarks.html [92]: /forward-looking-statement.html [93]: /assets/bms/us/english-documents/our-principles/UK-CA-Slavery-Human-Trafficking-Statement.pdf [94]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/bristol-myers-squibb [95]: https://www.youtube.com/bristolmyerssquibb [96]: https://www.facebook.com/BristolMyersSquibb [97]: https://www.instagram.com/bristolmyerssquibb [98]: https://twitter.com/BMSNEWS [99]: /contact-us.html [100]: /our-company/locations.html [101]: /", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Bristol-Myers Squibb — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: BMS markets biologic drugs such as Opdivo and Yervoy. | BMS markets biologic drugs such as Opdivo and Yervoy, significant in oncology biologics. | United States | United, States, Some", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "74", "Y Score": "62", "Overall Score": "68", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Bristol-Myers Squibb (Brazil)", "Website": "https://www.bms.com.br", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "São Paulo, Brazil", "Continent / Geography": "LATAM(Brazil)", "Operational Presence": "Brazil", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Brazilian subsidiary of BMS, marketing biologic therapies for oncology and immunology.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "BR", "Region Code": "LATAM", "Summary": "Bristol-Myers Squibb (Brazil) — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Brazilian subsidiary of BMS, a major pharmaceutical company that markets biologic therapies.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "X Score": "74", "Y Score": "77", "Overall Score": "76", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Cadila Pharmaceuticals", "Website": "https://www.cadilapharma.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(India)", "Operational Presence": "India", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Indian company with biologic products including recombinant streptokinase.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Cadila Pharmaceuticals — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Indian pharmaceutical company with biologic products including recombinant streptokinase.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "cadilapharma.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "cadilapharma.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[[Cadila Pharmaceuticals]][1]\nMenu\n\n# Advancing Care , Improving Every Life\n\nWe have been on a mission to make health simpler and safer. Our innovation-led drug discovery and\nexcellence in R&D have delivered breakthrough therapies that have changed lives and impacted global\nwell-being.\n\n[\nOur Breakthroughs\n][2]\n[arrow]\n\n\n0+\n\nCountries covered\n\n0\n\nSpecialities in key\ntherapy areas\n\n0\n\nProducts in tablets, capsules & injectables\n\n0+\n\nEmployees across departments\n\n### Our pillars that power better health\n\n[Formulations]\n[APIs]\n\nWith 850+ products across 45 therapies and 12 specialities, we create trusted formulations that\nbring reliable, accessible care to all.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][3]\n\n01\n\nFormulations\n\n02\n\nAPIs\n\n01\n\nFormulations\n\nWith 850+ products across 45 therapies and 12 specialities, we create trusted formulations that\nbring reliable, accessible care to all.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][4]\n\n02\n\nAPIs\n\n[[CDMO & CMO]\n\nCDMO & CMO\n\nOur CDMO-CMO solutions speed the journey from molecule to market, providing affordable, safe, and\nlife-changing therapies.\n\n][5]\n[[CRO]\n\nCRO\n\nOur CRO delivers end-to-end clinical research, from BA/BE studies to Phase I-IV trials, bringing\nsafe, effective therapies to patients faster.\n\n][6]\n\n## Trusted leaders across therapeutic specialities\n\n[\nOur Therapies\n][7]\n\nGastroenterology\n\nWe provide trusted gastroenterology therapies that ease disruption, restore gut health, and rebuild\ndaily well-being.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][8]\n[Gastroenterology]\n\nOncology\n\nBuilt to extend life and ease suffering, our oncology therapies provide high-quality, affordable\ncare for all patients.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][9]\n[Oncology]\n\nCardiology\n\nOur trusted cardiovascular treatments help prevent risk, manage conditions, and support lifelong\nheart health.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][10]\n[Cardiology]\n\nDiabetology\n\nDriven by care and innovation, we deliver accessible diabetes care solutions that help patients\nacross all geographies and ages.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][11]\n[Diabetology]\n\nNeurology\n\nFrom migraine to neuropathic pain, we provide trusted therapies that deliver effective relief and\nhelp regain control.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][12]\n[Neurology]\n\nGynaecology\n\nPromoting women’s health with our nutritional, fertility, reproductive and pregnancy care.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][13]\n[Gynaecology]\n\nOrthopaedic\n\nOffering innovative solutions for complex orthopaedic problems, ensuring serenity and relief for\nailing patients.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][14]\n[Orthopaedic]\n\nDermatology and Cosmetology\n\nDeveloping practical, patient-centred treatments for common skin conditions, such as dry skin,\nhyperpigmentation, and more.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][15]\n[Dermatology and Cosmetology]\n\nRespiratory\n\nOffering a high-quality product portfolio developed through research to address respiratory needs\nfrom chronic management to acute infections.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][16]\n[Respiratory]\n\nVaccines\n\nDelivering key vaccine innovations to boost protection, simplify regimens, and improve patient\ncompliance in high-burden regions.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][17]\n[Vaccines]\n\nAnti-Infective\n\nA specialised portfolio of anti-infective agents using advanced formulations to improve efficacy and\npatient outcomes against resistant pathogens.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][18]\n[Anti-Infective]\n\nHerbal\n\nA leading Ayurvedic wellness brand offering a wide range of safe, natural, and effective products to\nsupport embracing an Ayurveda-based lifestyle.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][19]\n[Herbal]\n\nPaediatric\n\nA pediatric portfolio targeting common childhood issues, offering safe, effective, child-friendly\ntreatments.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][20]\n[Paediatric]\n\nCritical Care\n\nDedicated to serving critically ill patients with a broad portfolio of high-quality, evidence-based\nmedicines across various therapeutic segments.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][21]\n[Critical Care]\n[\nOur Therapies\n][22]\n[Care that continues beyond medicine]\n\n## Care that continues beyond medicine\n\nFor healthier lives and a thriving planet\n\nWe believe true progress is sustainable, where health, communities, and the environment grow\ntogether. Our CSR and sustainability efforts "}}, "page_text": "[[Cadila Pharmaceuticals]][1] Menu # Advancing Care , Improving Every Life We have been on a mission to make health simpler and safer. Our innovation-led drug discovery and excellence in R&D have delivered breakthrough therapies that have changed lives and impacted global well-being. [ Our Breakthroughs ][2] [arrow] 0+ Countries covered 0 Specialities in key therapy areas 0 Products in tablets, capsules & injectables 0+ Employees across departments ### Our pillars that power better health [Formulations] [APIs] With 850+ products across 45 therapies and 12 specialities, we create trusted formulations that bring reliable, accessible care to all. [ Know More ][3] 01 Formulations 02 APIs 01 Formulations With 850+ products across 45 therapies and 12 specialities, we create trusted formulations that bring reliable, accessible care to all. [ Know More ][4] 02 APIs [[CDMO & CMO] CDMO & CMO Our CDMO-CMO solutions speed the journey from molecule to market, providing affordable, safe, and life-changing therapies. ][5] [[CRO] CRO Our CRO delivers end-to-end clinical research, from BA/BE studies to Phase I-IV trials, bringing safe, effective therapies to patients faster. ][6] ## Trusted leaders across therapeutic specialities [ Our Therapies ][7] Gastroenterology We provide trusted gastroenterology therapies that ease disruption, restore gut health, and rebuild daily well-being. [ Know More ][8] [Gastroenterology] Oncology Built to extend life and ease suffering, our oncology therapies provide high-quality, affordable care for all patients. [ Know More ][9] [Oncology] Cardiology Our trusted cardiovascular treatments help prevent risk, manage conditions, and support lifelong heart health. [ Know More ][10] [Cardiology] Diabetology Driven by care and innovation, we deliver accessible diabetes care solutions that help patients across all geographies and ages. [ Know More ][11] [Diabetology] Neurology From migraine to neuropathic pain, we provide trusted therapies that deliver effective relief and help regain control. [ Know More ][12] [Neurology] Gynaecology Promoting women’s health with our nutritional, fertility, reproductive and pregnancy care. [ Know More ][13] [Gynaecology] Orthopaedic Offering innovative solutions for complex orthopaedic problems, ensuring serenity and relief for ailing patients. [ Know More ][14] [Orthopaedic] Dermatology and Cosmetology Developing practical, patient-centred treatments for common skin conditions, such as dry skin, hyperpigmentation, and more. [ Know More ][15] [Dermatology and Cosmetology] Respiratory Offering a high-quality product portfolio developed through research to address respiratory needs from chronic management to acute infections. [ Know More ][16] [Respiratory] Vaccines Delivering key vaccine innovations to boost protection, simplify regimens, and improve patient compliance in high-burden regions. [ Know More ][17] [Vaccines] Anti-Infective A specialised portfolio of anti-infective agents using advanced formulations to improve efficacy and patient outcomes against resistant pathogens. [ Know More ][18] [Anti-Infective] Herbal A leading Ayurvedic wellness brand offering a wide range of safe, natural, and effective products to support embracing an Ayurveda-based lifestyle. [ Know More ][19] [Herbal] Paediatric A pediatric portfolio targeting common childhood issues, offering safe, effective, child-friendly treatments. [ Know More ][20] [Paediatric] Critical Care Dedicated to serving critically ill patients with a broad portfolio of high-quality, evidence-based medicines across various therapeutic segments. [ Know More ][21] [Critical Care] [ Our Therapies ][22] [Care that continues beyond medicine] ## Care that continues beyond medicine For healthier lives and a thriving planet We believe true progress is sustainable, where health, communities, and the environment grow together. Our CSR and sustainability efforts bring this belief to life. [ Our CSR Efforts ][23][ Our Sustainability Efforts ][24] [ Media ][25] [ We’re Hiring ][26] [ Corporate Social Responsibility ][27] [