neering PhotoMedicine\n& PhotoCosmetics\nDiscover CLINUVEL's innovative solutions for skin and brain /0{{total_slide_count}}\n0{{current_slide_index}}\n\n## Pharmaceuticals\n\nSKIN & BRAIN | Developing pioneering treatments for patients with severe, unmet medical needs\n\n## PhotoCosmetics\n\nNEW SCIENCE IN SKINCARE | Translating scientific expertise to develop luxury skincare solutions that\nprotect, repair and safely bronze\n\n## The CLINUVEL Group works to translate scientific concepts and breakthroughs into commercial\n## products to prevent or treat acute and chronic medical conditions where no alternatives exist.\n\n## 2026 Annual Report\n\nOUR YEAR DOCUMENTED | On 27 August 2026, CLINUVEL released its Annual Report for the year ended 30\nJune 2026\n\n## Products\n\nPHARMACEUTICAL PRODUCTS | Discover CLINUVEL’s innovative solutions for acute and systemic disorders\naffecting the skin and brain\n\n## Investors\n\nCLINUVEL’s hub for investors\n\n## The Science\n\nBIOMIMICRY | Our commitment to benefit patient populations with unmet medical needs\n\n## Disease Entities\n\nLONGITUDINAL CARE | Our commitment to benefit patient populations with unmet medical needs\n\n## EXPERTISE\n\n### [Photomedicine, ][2] [PhotoCosmetics, ][3] [Melanocortins, ][4] [DNA repair, ][5]\n### [Repigmentation, ][6] [Central nervous system, ][7] [Erythropoietic protoporphyria (EPP), ][8]\n### [Vitiligo, ][9] [Arterial ischaemic stroke (AIS), ][10] [Variegate porphyria (VP), ][11]\n### [Xeroderma pigmentosum(XP).][12]\n\n## Latest News\n\n[ SEE ALL ][13]\n[\n\n### CLINUVEL considers Nasdaq listing, ASX delisting\n\n][14]\n[2026 Announcements][15]  .  [Financial][16]  .  [News][17]  .  [Regulatory][18]\n27.08.2026\n[\n\n### A decade of profitability provides foundation for CLINUVEL’s U.S. expansion\n\n][19]\n[2026 Announcements][20]  .  [Financial][21]  .  [News][22]  .  [Regulatory][23]\n27.08.2026\n[\n\n### Appendix 4E & Annual Report\n\n][24]\n[2026 Announcements][25]  .  [Financial][26]