"page_text": "[ MENU CLOSE ][1] Discover CLINUVEL's innovative solutions for skin and brain Pioneering PhotoMedicine & PhotoCosmetics Pioneering PhotoMedicine & PhotoCosmetics Discover CLINUVEL's innovative solutions for skin and brain /0{{total_slide_count}} 0{{current_slide_index}} ## Pharmaceuticals SKIN & BRAIN | Developing pioneering treatments for patients with severe, unmet medical needs ## PhotoCosmetics NEW SCIENCE IN SKINCARE | Translating scientific expertise to develop luxury skincare solutions that protect, repair and safely bronze ## The CLINUVEL Group works to translate scientific concepts and breakthroughs into commercial ## products to prevent or treat acute and chronic medical conditions where no alternatives exist. ## 2026 Annual Report OUR YEAR DOCUMENTED | On 27 August 2026, CLINUVEL released its Annual Report for the year ended 30 June 2026 ## Products PHARMACEUTICAL PRODUCTS | Discover CLINUVEL’s innovative solutions for acute and systemic disorders affecting the skin and brain ## Investors CLINUVEL’s hub for investors ## The Science BIOMIMICRY | Our commitment to benefit patient populations with unmet medical needs ## Disease Entities LONGITUDINAL CARE | Our commitment to benefit patient populations with unmet medical needs ## EXPERTISE ### [Photomedicine, ][2] [PhotoCosmetics, ][3] [Melanocortins, ][4] [DNA repair, ][5] ### [Repigmentation, ][6] [Central nervous system, ][7] [Erythropoietic protoporphyria (EPP), ][8] ### [Vitiligo, ][9] [Arterial ischaemic stroke (AIS), ][10] [Variegate porphyria (VP), ][11] ### [Xeroderma pigmentosum(XP).][12] ## Latest News [ SEE ALL ][13] [ ### CLINUVEL considers Nasdaq listing, ASX delisting ][14] [2026 Announcements][15] . [Financial][16] . [News][17] . [Regulatory][18] 27.08.2026 [ ### A decade of profitability provides foundation for CLINUVEL’s U.S. expansion ][19] [2026 Announcements][20] . [Financial][21] . [News][22] . [Regulatory][23] 27.08.2026 [ ### Appendix 4E & Annual Report ][24] [2026 Announ