tics/dna-repair/ [53]: https://www.clinuvel.com/photocosmetics/melanogenesis/ [54]: # [55]: https://www.clinuvel.com/investor/ [56]: https://www.clinuvel.com/investor/asx-announcements/ [57]: https://www.clinuvel.com/investor/sec-filings/ [58]: https://www.clinuvel.com/investor/analyst-coverage/ [59]: https://www.clinuvel.com/investor/media-coverage/ [60]: https://www.clinuvel.com/investor/company-snapshot/ [61]: https://www.clinuvel.com/investor/financial-summary/ [62]: https://www.clinuvel.com/investor/shareholder-information/ [63]: https://www.clinuvel.com/investor/investor-enquiry/ [64]: https://www.clinuvel.com/news/ [65]: https://www.clinuvel.com/contact/ [66]: https://store.clinuvel.com/ [67]: #", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Clinuvel Pharmaceuticals — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops and markets Scenesse, a biologic product. | Develops and markets Scenesse, a biologic for erythropoietic protoporphyria. | Australia | Melbourne, Australia", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "44", "Y Score": "50", "Overall Score": "47", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Coherus BioSciences, Inc.", "Website": "https://www.coherus.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Redwood, City, California", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Markets biosimilars such as Udenyca and Cimerli.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Coherus BioSciences, Inc. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Coherus markets biosimilars such as Udenyca and Cimerli.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "coherus.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "coherus.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "* [Patient Advocacy][1]\n* [Investigator Studies][2]\n* [Educational Grants][3]\n[ [Coherus Oncology] ][4]\n* [Company][5]\n  * [About Us][6]\n  * [Leadership][7]\n  * [Partnering][8]\n  * [Patient Advocacy][9]\n  * [Contact][10]\n* [Science][11]\n  * [Oncology Focus][12]\n  * [Scientific Posters][13]\n* [Medicines][14]\n  * [Product Portfolio][15]\n  * [Patient Support Services][16]\n  * [Medical Information Support][17]\n* [Pipeline][18]\n  * [Our Pipeline][19]\n  * [Toripalimab-tpzi (PD-1)][20]\n  * [Tagmokitug (CCR8)][21]\n  * [Casdozokitug (IL-27)][22]\n  * [Clinical Trials][23]\n* [Careers][24]\n  * [Our Culture][25]\n  * [Job Openings][26]\n* [Investors & Media][27]\n  * [Corporate Overview][28]\n  * [Press Releases][29]\n  * [Events & Presentations][30]\n  * [Stock Information][31]\n    * [Stock Quote & Chart][32]\n    * [Historical Price Lookup][33]\n    * [IRC Section 6045B][34]\n    * [Analyst Coverage][35]\n  * [SEC Filings][36]\n  * [Corporate Governance][37]\n    * [Governance Documents][38]\n    * [Management Team][39]\n    * [Board of Directors][40]\n  * [Shareholder Services][41]\nSelect Page\n\n# The Right Combinations to Overcome\n# Immune Resistance in Cancer\n\n### We are advancing next-generation combination therapies to elevate what’s possible for people\n### living with cancer.\n\n[Learn More][42]\n[ \" ][43]\n\n##### Immuno-Oncology\n\nWe are focused on advancing a diversified portfolio of next-generation immuno-oncology therapies to\ntransform cancer treatment and extend survival for patients living with cancer.\n\n[Learn More][44]\n[LOQTORZI]\n\n##### Anti-PD-1 Monoclonal Antibody\n\nLOQTORZI® (toripalimab-tpzi) is the only available FDA-approved therapy for the treatment of\nrecurrent, locally advanced or metastatic nasopharyngeal carcinoma (NPC) in combination with\nchemotherapy or as a single agent.\n\n[Learn More][45]\nOur Programs\n\n### Developing a Portfolio of Immuno-Oncology Drugs to Improve Patient Outcomes\n\nOur pipeline includes multiple clinical stage immuno-oncology drug candidates that target the tumor\nmicroenvironment.\n\n[View Our Pipeline][46]\nOur Clinical Trials\n\n### Testing the Safety and Effectiveness of Our I-O Drug Candidates\n\nWe have multiple ongoing clinical trials across a range of cancer indications assessing our\ninvestigational immuno-oncology therapeutics.\n\n[See Clinical Trials][47]\n\n### Recent news\n\n08/17/2026\n\n[Coherus Oncology Announces Special Dividend of Biosimilar Contingent Value Rights][48]\n[View All][49]\n\n08/05/2026\n\n[Coherus Oncology Reports Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results and Provides Business Update][50]\n\n07/22/2026\n\n[Coherus Oncology to Report Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results on August 5, 2026][51]\n\n06/23/2026\n\n[Coherus and Zumutor Biologics Announce Clinical Collaboration to Evaluate ZM008 in Combination with\nLOQTORZI® (toripalimab-tpzi)][52]\n[View All][53]\n\n### Become part of our talented and passionate organization and make an impact.\n\n[See Open Positions][54]\n[Coherus Logo with Tagline]\n\nFollow Us\n\n#### Company\n* [About Us][55]\n* [Leadership][56]\n* [Partnering][57]\n* [Patient Advocacy][58]\n* [Contact][59]\n\n#### Science\n* [Oncology Focus][60]\n* [Scientific Posters][61]\n\n#### Medicines\n* [Product Portfolio][62]\n* [Patient Support Services][63]\n* [Medical Information Support][64]\n\n#### Pipeline\n* [Our Pipeline][65]\n* [Toripalimab-tpzi (PD-1)][66]\n* [Tagmokitug (CCR8)][67]\n* [Casdozokitug (IL-27)][68]\n* [Clinical Trials][69]\n\n#### Careers\n* [Our Culture][70]\n* [Job Openings][71]\n\n#### Investors & Media\n* [Corporate Overview][72]\n* [Press Releases][73]\n* [Events & Presentations][74]\n* [Stock Information][75]\n* [SEC Filings][76]\n* [Corporate Governance][77]\n* [Shareholder Services][78]\n\n© 2026 Coherus Oncology\n* [Privacy Policy][79]\n* [Terms of Use][80]\n* [Return Goods Policy][81]\n\n[Website by 22 Fillmore][82]\n\n[1]: https://www.coherus.com/patient-advocacy/\n[2]: https://coherus.com/clinical-trials/#investigator-initiated-studies\n[3]: https://coherus.com/clinical-trials/#investigator-initiated-studies\n[4]: https://www.cohe"}}, "page_text": "* [Patient Advocacy][1] * [Investigator Studies][2] * [Educational Grants][3] [ [Coherus Oncology] ][4] * [Company][5] * [About Us][6] * [Leadership][7] * [Partnering][8] * [Patient Advocacy][9] * [Contact][10] * [Science][11] * [Oncology Focus][12] * [Scientific Posters][13] * [Medicines][14] * [Product Portfolio][15] * [Patient Support Services][16] * [Medical Information Support][17] * [Pipeline][18] * [Our Pipeline][19] * [Toripalimab-tpzi (PD-1)][20] * [Tagmokitug (CCR8)][21] * [Casdozokitug (IL-27)][22] * [Clinical Trials][23] * [Careers][24] * [Our Culture][25] * [Job Openings][26] * [Investors & Media][27] * [Corporate Overview][28] * [Press Releases][29] * [Events & Presentations][30] * [Stock Information][31] * [Stock Quote & Chart][32] * [Historical Price Lookup][33] * [IRC Section 6045B][34] * [Analyst Coverage][35] * [SEC Filings][36] * [Corporate Governance][37] * [Governance Documents][38] * [Management Team][39] * [Board of Directors][40] * [Shareholder Services][41] Select Page # The Right Combinations to Overcome # Immune Resistance in Cancer ### We are advancing next-generation combination therapies to elevate what’s possible for people ### living with cancer. [Learn More][42] [ \" ][43] ##### Immuno-Oncology We are focused on advancing a diversified portfolio of next-generation immuno-oncology therapies to transform cancer treatment and extend survival for patients living with cancer. [Learn More][44] [LOQTORZI] ##### Anti-PD-1 Monoclonal Antibody LOQTORZI® (toripalimab-tpzi) is the only available FDA-approved therapy for the treatment of recurrent, locally advanced or metastatic nasopharyngeal carcinoma (NPC) in combination with chemotherapy or as a single agent. [Learn More][45] Our Programs ### Developing a Portfolio of Immuno-Oncology Drugs to Improve Patient Outcomes Our pipeline includes multiple clinical stage immuno-oncology drug candidates that target the tumor microenvironment. [View Our Pipeline][46] Our Clinical Trials ### Testing the Safety and Effectiveness of Our I-O Drug Candidates We have multiple ongoing clinical trials across a range of cancer indications assessing our investigational immuno-oncology therapeutics. [See Clinical Trials][47] ### Recent news 08/17/2026 [Coherus Oncology Announces Special Dividend of Biosimilar Contingent Value Rights][48] [View All][49] 08/05/2026 [Coherus Oncology Reports Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results and Provides Business Update][50] 07/22/2026 [Coherus Oncology to Report Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results on August 5, 2026][51] 06/23/2026 [Coherus and Zumutor Biologics Announce Clinical Collaboration to Evaluate ZM008 in Combination with LOQTORZI® (toripalimab-tpzi)][52] [View All][53] ### Become part of our talented and passionate organization and make an impact. [See Open Positions][54] [Coherus Logo with Tagline] Follow Us #### Company * [About Us][55] * [Leadership][56] * [Partnering][57] * [Patient Advocacy][58] * [Contact][59] #### Science * [Oncology Focus][60] * [Scientific Posters][61] #### Medicines * [Product Portfolio][62] * [Patient Support Services][63] * [Medical Information Support][64] #### Pipeline * [Our Pipeline][65] * [Toripalimab-tpzi (PD-1)][66] * [Tagmokitug (CCR8)][67] * [Casdozokitug (IL-27)][68] * [Clinical Trials][69] #### Careers * [Our Culture][70] * [Job Openings][71] #### Investors & Media * [Corporate Overview][72] * [Press Releases][73] * [Events & Presentations][74] * [Stock Information][75] * [SE