ugh innovation, we’re helping to build a healthier world for all people. [ Learn More About Gilead ][158] [Medicines Offered Globally ] 25+ Medicines Offered Globally [HIV-and-Viral-Hepatitis] 53 Clinical Programs Across Virology, Oncology and Inflammation [Philanthropic Funder of HIV-Related Programs] #1 Funder of Philanthropic HIV Programs in the U.S. [Four Gilead researchers in a lab.][Four Gilead researchers in a lab.] ## Using Science to Improve the Lives of People and Communities We invest in world-class science to combat the world's most serious diseases. [ Explore Science ][159] ## A Strong Pipeline Spanning Three Therapeutic Areas We have a deep, diverse pipeline across Virology, Oncology and Inflammation. [View Our Pipeline ][160] [A Gilead scientist smiling][A Gilead scientist smiling] [ #### Virology [Virology logo] ][161] [ #### Oncology [Oncology icon] ][162] [ #### Inflammation [Inflammation icon] ][163] [ View All Therapeutic Areas ][164] ## Stories@Gilead **Follow our journey to create a healthier world for all people** No story to list Loading Results... [ View Stories@Gilead ][165] ## An Inclusive Workplace Where We All Can Make an Impact Gilead employees work to advance scientific innovation, help ensure our medicines reach those who need it and make a difference in the communities where we live and work. [ Explore Careers at Gilead ][166] [Five people standing and smiling][Five people standing and smiling] ## News *Some of the content on this page is not intended for users outside the U.S.* [ View News ][167] Loading Results... ## **Investors** Driven by Purpose, Delivering ** Life-Changing Therapies ** ### Resources for Investors [Investor Relations ][168] [Events and Presentations][169] [Stock Information ][170] [a Gilead building][Gilead Building] [All-Pages-Gilead-logo] This is our global website, intended for visitors seeking information on Gilead’s worldwide business. Some content on this site is not intended for people outside the United 