iwilliges Erwerbsangebot (Delisting) (2025) ][89] [ Presentation First-Half 2026 Results ][90] [ 2025 Integrated and Sustainability Annual Report ][91] * Careers Careers People are at the heart of our business. We are committed to continued investment in training and development. [ Explore Opportunities ][92] * [ Why Grifols ][93] * [ People & Culture ][94] * [ Our teams ][95] * [ Training and Development ][96] * [ Hiring Journey ][97] * [ Early Careers ][98] * Media Media Latest news about the company and contact information for journalists and communication professionals. [ Read more ][99] * [ Newsroom ][100] * [ Events ][101] * [ H1 2026 Financial Results ][102] * [ General Shareholders' Meeting 2026 ][103] * [ Media Contacts ][104] * [ Media Center ][105] * Suppliers Suppliers At Grifols, we believe in long-term, mutually trusting relationships with our partners. [ More details ][106] * [ Join Grifols Supplier Network ][107] Clear EN * Change Language * [Español][108] * [Deutsch][109] * [中文][110] * Company * [ Company ][111] * Corporate Structure * [ Board of Directors ][112] * [ Management Team ][113] * What We Do * [ What We Do ][114] * [ Biopharma ][115] * [ Diagnostic ][116] * [ Bio Supplies ][117] * [ Healthcare Solutions for Hospitals ][118] * [ Mission, vision and values ][119] * [ Ethics and Compliance ][120] * [ Our History ][121] * Grifols Museum * [ Grifols Museum ][122] * [ La Casa: Where It All Began ][123] * [ The Plant: People Helping People ][124] * [ The World: From Family Business to Global Company ][125] * Grifology * [ Grifology ][126] * [ The Cabinet ][127] * [ Grifols Engineering ][128] * Innovation * [ Innovation ][129] * [ Plasma Powerhouse ][130] * [ Beyond Plasma ][131] * Key Therapeutic Areas * [ Key Therapeutic Areas ][132] * [ Immunology ][133] * [ Hepatology and Intensive Care ][134] * [ Pulmonology ][135] * [ Hematology ][136] * [ Neurology ][137] * [ Infectious Diseases ][138] * [ Further Therapeutic Opportunities ][139] * [ CHRONOS-PD: Plasma Science in Parkinson’s Research ][140] * Extending Our Innovative Reach * [ Extending Our Innovative Reach ][141] * [ Team Up with Grifols Innovation and New Technologies ][142] * [ Scientific Awards and Programs ][143] * [ Connecting Knowledge - Our R&D Network ][144] * Sustainability * [ Sustainability ][145] * Social Commitment * [ Supporting Patients ][146] * [ Supporting Donors ][147] * [ Our People ][148] * [ Social Action ][149] * [ Environmental Responsibility ][150] * [ Ethical Leadership ][151] * [ Sustainability Reports & Corporate Policies ][152] * [ Products ][153] * Investors * [ Investors ][154] * Stock Information * [ Stock and share capital ][155] * [ Dividends ][156] * [ Major Holders and Treasury Stock ][157] * [ Agreements between Shareholders ][158] * [ Analyst Coverage ][159] * Financials * [ Financial Results ][160] * [ Annual Accounts ][161] * [ Fixed Income and Credit Ratings ][162] * [ Average Period of Payment to Suppliers ][163] * [ Key Figures ][164] * [ Press Releases ][165] * [ Presentations and Events ][166] * [ Agenda ][167] * Communications with CNMV and SEC * [ CNMV ][168] * [ SEC ][169] * [ Other Relevant Information ][170] * [ Inside Information ][171] * [ Significant events until 8 February 2020 ][172] * [ Corporate Stewardship Reports ][173] * Corporate Governance * [ Board of Directors ][174] * [ General Shareholders’ Meeting ][175] * [ Annual Corporate Governance Report ][176] * [ Directors' Remuneration Report ][177] * [ Articles of Association ][178] * [ Corporate Policies ][179] * [ Mergers ][180] * [ Biotest: Voluntary Takeover Offer | Freiwilliges Übernahmeangebot (2021) ][181] * [ Biotest: Acquisition offer (delisting) / freiwilliges Erwerbsangebot (Delisting) (2025) ][182] * Careers * [ Careers ][183] * Why Grifols * [ Why Grifols ][184] * [ People & Culture ][185] * [ Our teams ][186] * [ Training and Development ][187] * [ Hiring Journey ][188] * [ Early Careers ][189] * Media * [ Media ][190] * [ Newsroom ][191] * Events * [ Events ][192] * [ H1 2026 Financial Results ][193] * [ General Shareholders' Meeting 2026 ][194] * [ Media Contacts ][195] * [ Media Center ][196] * Suppliers * [ Suppliers ][197] * [ Join Grifols Supplier Network ][198] Connect with us # Advancing science. # Amplifying impact. [ What We Do ][199] Grifols is a leading global healthcare company. Our trusted and innovative plasma-derived medicines, other biopharmaceuticals and solutions in transfusion medicine enable millions of patients around the world to lead more productive lives. Since our founding in 1909, our ever-growing mastery of plasma, diagnostics and life sciences, backed by our ethical leadership and industry-leading quality and safety standards, have contributed to a healthier and more sustainable society. ## TIME and Forbes rank us among the world’s best companies TIME magazine has recognized Grifols as one of the world’s top companies for the third consecutive year. Additionally, for the second year in a row, Forbes has named Grifols one of the World’s Best Employers. This achievement reflects our relentless commitment to our people and long-term impact. ## Latest news Grifols announces Last Patient Last Visit in SPARTA, its Phase 3 Outcomes Study of Prolastin^{®}-C in patients with emphysema due to alpha-1 antitrypsin deficiency August 10, 2026 Read Release [ Read Release ][200] Grifols increases revenue by 2.6% to €3.6 billion, and net profit by 28.7% to €227 million until June July 28, 2026 Read Release [ Read Release ][201] Grifols doses first patients in two Phase 3 trials to expand indications of its flagship immunoglobulins July 16, 2026 Read Release [ Read Release ][202] [Show more news][203] ## Barcelona honors Víctor Grífols i Lucas The Barcelona City Council has named the street where the company’s institutional headquarters is located after Víctor Grífols i Lucas. This tribute recognizes a pioneer in the biomedical industry who, for more than six decades, was the heart and driving force behind Grifols. Uncover the story behind Grifols’ legacy. [ Read more ][204] ## Commitment to people and the planet Aligned with the United Nations plan to achieve the Sustainable Development Goals defined in its 2030 Agenda, we work every day to do more and do better to contribute to the health and quality of life of people around the world. The patients we serve are able to lead better lives. Patients inspire the work we do every day. [ Read more ][205] Innovation ## Scientific innovation at work Our deep and expanding knowledge of plasma and the life sciences is helping us better understand human health and research potential treatments to improve it. [ Read more ][206] ## Get to know us Our history We trace our roots back to 1909 when Dr. Josep Antoni Grifols i Roig founded a clinical analysis laboratory in Barcelona, the precursor to Laboratorios Grifols. Read more [ Read more ][207] Company Grifols' mission, to improve people's health and well-being, has patients, donors and society at the heart of everything we do. Read more [ Read more ][208] Careers Would you like to make a positive impact on the lives of others? Join our team! Read more [ Read more ][209] BIOPHARMA ## Lifegiving plasma Our innovative medicines made from human plasma enable millions of patients with chronic and rare diseases to lead more fulfilling lives. [ Read more ][210] ## Find out more about Grifols", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Grifols — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Grifols markets plasma-derived biologics and diagnostic products, owning and marketing branded biologics. | Grifols markets plasma-derived biologics and diagnostic products. | Spain | Barcelona, Spain", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "69", "Y Score": "75", "Overall Score": "72", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Hanmi Pharmaceutical", "Website": "https://www.hanmi.co.kr", "Founded": "Not publicly d