": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "hetero.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "hetero.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[][1]\n**🌐 **\n* [[Colombia Flag]Colombia][2]\n* [[Colombia Flag]Dominican Republic][3]\n* [[Guatemala Flag]Guatemala ][4]\n* [[Indonesia Flag] Indonesia][5]\n* [[kazakhstan Flag]Kazakhstan][6]\n* [[philippines Flag]Philippines][7]\n* [[south-africa Flag] South Africa][8]\n* [[south-africa Flag] Vietnam ][9]\n* [[Malaysia Flag] Malaysia ][10]\n* [About Us][11]\n  [Back][12]\n  \n  ## About Us\n  \n  We are inspiring human belief in a healthier world\n  * [Company][13]\n    \n    Our founding mission is to make highly quality medicines affordable and accessible to the world\n  * [Who we are][14]\n    \n    30 years of Service in the pharmaceutical industry, backed by proven track record in R&D\n    excellence\n  * [Leadership][15]\n    \n    Our mission to enable access to affordable medicines and improve lives flow from the top\n  * [Presence][16]\n    \n    Expanding our presence to serve more people and create meaningful impact\n  * [Milestones and Awards][17]\n    \n    Being acknowledged for our efforts motivates our entire team\n* [Focus Areas][18]\n  [Back][19]\n  \n  ## Focus Areas\n  \n  Our expertise across APIs, global generics, biosimilars and custom pharmaceutical services is\n  secured by a strong R&D backbone\n  * [Overview][20]\n    \n    We have steadily invested in a wide range of innovations to make our product portfolio diverse\n    and differentiated in a competitive market\n  * [APIs][21]\n    \n    The path to serving patients better\n  * [Global generics][22]\n    \n    World-class and differentiated portfolio in chronic therapy areas\n  * [Biosimilars][23]\n    \n    Achieving a sustainable health equity\n  * [CPS][24]\n    \n    Fully integrated services across the value chain\n  * [Global Access][25]\n    \n    Committed to transforming standards of care\n  * [Key Therapies][26]\n    \n    Researching areas of unmet medical need\n* [Expertise][27]\n  [Back][28]\n  \n  ## Expertise\n  \n  Our expertise rest on the pillars of our advanced R&D capabilities, world-class manufacturing\n  facilities, our long legacy of trust and our partnerships\n  * [Overview][29]\n    \n    Research excellence for us means to invest in the future of health for the world\n  * [Research & Development][30]\n    \n    We invest in cutting edge research to develop new cures for challenging diseases\n  * [Global Manufacturing Facilities][31]\n    \n    Built to world-class standards, our facilities enable us to produce high-quality and affordable\n    medicines\n  * [Quality Focus][32]\n    \n    Legacy of trust\n  * [Partnerships][33]\n    \n    Growing better, together\n* [Responsibility][34]\n  [Back][35]\n  \n  ## Responsibility\n  \n  We are committed to making a positive impact by contributing to healthy communities and leading a\n  responsible business\n  * [Overview][36]\n    \n    Aiming for a sustainable environment\n  * [Environment, Health & Safety][37]\n    \n    A constant focus on sustainable environment with focus on health and safety\n  * [Community][38]\n    \n    A steadfast commitment to enable communities\n  * [Sustainability ][39]\n    \n    Hetero aims to report comprehensively and transparently for all stakeholders\n* [News and Media][40]\n  [Back][41]\n  \n  ## News and Media\n  \n  Find range of resources including press releases, featured stories and information on social media\n  channels\n  * [Overview][42]\n    \n    Access our latest press releases and resources for News and Media section\n  * [Featured Stories][43]\n    \n    Discover the stories that enumerate the way we understand disease and develop medicines\n  * [Newsroom][44]\n    \n    Latest media releases and statements in the Hetero newsroom\n  * [Press Kit][45]\n    \n    Browse and download multimedia resources for use\n  * [Notices][46]\n    \n    Notices\n* * [ 🌐 ][47]\n    * [ [Colombia Flag] Colombia ][48]\n    * [ [Colombia Flag] Dominican Republic ][49]\n    * [ [Guatemala Flag] Guatemala ][50]\n    * [ [Indonesia Flag] Indonesia ][51]\n    * [ [kazakhstan Flag] Kazakhstan ][52]\n    * [ [philippines Flag] Philippines ][53]\n    * [ [southafrica Flag] South A"}}, "page_text": "[][1] **🌐 ** * [[Colombia Flag]Colombia][2] * [[Colombia Flag]Dominican Republic][3] * [[Guatemala Flag]Guatemala ][4] * [[Indonesia Flag] Indonesia][5] * [[kazakhstan Flag]Kazakhstan][6] * [[philippines Flag]Philippines][7] * [[south-africa Flag] South Africa][8] * [[south-africa Flag] Vietnam ][9] * [[Malaysia Flag] Malaysia ][10] * [About Us][11] [Back][12] ## About Us We are inspiring human belief in a healthier world * [Company][13] Our founding mission is to make highly quality medicines affordable and accessible to the world * [Who we are][14] 30 years of Service in the pharmaceutical industry, backed by proven track record in R&D excellence * [Leadership][15] Our mission to enable access to affordable medicines and improve lives flow from the top * [Presence][16] Expanding our presence to serve more people and create meaningful impact * [Milestones and Awards][17] Being acknowledged for our efforts motivates our entire team * [Focus Areas][18] [Back][19] ## Focus Areas Our expertise across APIs, global generics, biosimilars and custom pharmaceutical services is secured by a strong R&D backbone * [Overview][20] We have steadily invested in a wide range of innovations to make our product portfolio diverse and differentiated in a competitive market * [APIs][21] The path to serving patients better * [Global generics][22] World-class and differentiated portfolio in chronic therapy areas * [Biosimilars][23] Achieving a sustainable health equity * [CPS][24] Fully integrated services across the value chain * [Global Access][25] Committed to transforming standards of care * [Key Therapies][26] Researching areas of unmet medical need * [Expertise][27] [Back][28] ## Expertise Our expertise rest on the pillars of our advanced R&D capabilities, world-class manufacturing facilities, our long legacy of trust and our partnerships * [Overview][29] Research excellence for us means to invest in the future of health for the world * [Research & Development][30] We invest in cutting edge research to develop new cures for challenging diseases * [Global Manufacturing Facilities][31] Built to world-class standards, our facilities enable us to produce high-quality and affordable medicines * [Quality Focus][32] Legacy of trust * [Partnerships][33] Growing better, together * [Responsibility][34] [Back][35] ## Responsibility We are committed to making a positive impact by contributing to healthy communities and leading a responsible business * [Overview][36] Aiming for a sustainable environment * [Environment, Health & Safety][37] A constant focus on sustainable environment with focus on health and safety * [Community][38] A steadfast commitment to enable communities * [Sustainability ][39] Hetero aims to report comprehensively and transparently for all stakeholders * [News and Media][40] [Back][41] ## News and Media Find range of resources including press releases, featured stories and information on social media channels * [Overview][42] Access our latest press releases and resources for News and Media section * [Featured Stories][43] Discover the stories that enumerate the way we understand disease and develop medicines * [Newsroom][44] Latest media releases and statements in the Hetero newsroom * [Press Kit][45] Browse and download multimedia resources for use * [Notices][46] Notices * * [ 🌐 ][47] * [ [Colombia Flag] Colombia ][48] * [ [Colombia Flag] Dominican Republic ][49] * [ [Guatemala Flag] Guatemala ][50] * [ [Indonesia Flag] Indonesia ][51] * [ [kazakhstan Flag] Kazakhstan ][52] * [ [philippines Flag] Philippines ][53] * [ [southafrica Flag] South Africa ][54] * [ [Vietnam Flag] Vietnam ][55] * [ [Malaysia Flag] Malaysia ][56] * [ Thailand ][57] * [Careers][58] * [Contact us][59] * [ 🌐 ][60] * [ [Colombia Flag] Colombia ][61] * [ [Colombia Flag] Dominican Republic ][62] * [ [Colombia Flag] Guatemala ][63] * [ [Indonesia Flag] Indonesia ][64] * [ [south-africa Flag] South Africa ][65] * [ [kazakhstan Flag] Kazakhstan ][66] * [Careers][67] * [Contact Us][68] ### **30** ### feels **GREAT!** Celebrating three decades of inclusive pharmaceutical excellence. Thank you for all the encouragement and unwavering support. #Hetero30 [Doctor in Pharma Lab] [Doctor in Pharma Lab] ### Combining R&D expertise with state-of-the-art infrastructure. [Read More][69] [Doctor in Pharma Lab] [medicine in Hand] ### United against COVID-19 By asserting our role as a responsible corporate citizen, the entire team of Hetero is playing their part in helping the world to cope with the pandemic [Read More][70] [medicine in Hand] [medicine in Hand] ### Wide range of innovations; diverse and differentiated product portfolio [Read More][71] ## At Hetero, our every action seeks to inspire human belief in accessibility and affordability of ## life-saving medicines across the world. With unparalleled strengths in pharmaceutical research, manufacturing, and marketing, we are positioned to serve people regardless of geographies. Our new identity embodies this drive to expand our reach and capabilities in order to respond with agility to the world’s evolving health needs. Our every action seeks to inspire human belief in accessibility and affordability of life-saving medicines across the world. ## Partnering with MPP to expand access of nirmatrelvir & ritonavir generics for COVID-19 treatment To ensure significant increase in access to COVID-19 treatments for all people, particularly those living in the poorest parts of the world. [Read More][72] ## Positive results in Phase III trials of Hetero’s Movfor (Molnupiravir) Demonstrated that Molnupiravir along with Standard of Care (SOC) reduced the risk of hospitalization by over 65% compared to SOC alone. [Read More][73] ## 30 Years of Service ## 450+ APIs ## 550+ FDFs ## 145+ Countries ## 36+ State-of-the-art manufacturing facilities ## 30,000+ Employees globally [Read More][74] ## Focus areas Vast product portfolio backed by robust R&D [Read More][75] ## APIs The path to serving patients better ## Global Generics World-class and differentiated portfolio in chronic therapy areas ## Biosimilars Achieving a sustainable health equity [ ## Custom Pharmaceutical Services(CPS) Fully integrated services across the value chain ][76] ## Global Access Committed to transforming Standards of care ## Key Therapies Researching areas of unmet medical need ## People Hetero is an equal opportunity employer. Our people reinforce our mission. Strive to make a difference, be a part of an enterprising team. [Read More][77] ## Responsibility As a responsible corporate citizen, we conduct our business with complete respect for the environment and community [Read More][78] ## Education Power to nurture talent ## Healthcare Spreading smiles with good health ## Infrastructure Connecting communities with development [ ## Drinking Water Ensuring access to safe drinking water ][79] ## Eyecare Spreading the light to sight ## Green Initiative Greening our world ## Partnerships As a global leader in the industry, we partner with multinational pharmaceutical companies, global agencies and procurement bodies to ensure access to critical life-saving drugs. [Read More][80] ## About Us * [Who we are][81] * [Leadership][82] * [Presence][83] * [Milestones and Awards][84] ## Focus Areas * [APIs][85] * [Global generics][86] * [Biosimilars][87] * [CPS][88] * [Global Access][89] * [Key Therapies][90] * [ARVs][91] ## Expertise * [Research & Development][92] * [Global Manufacturing Facilities][93] * [Quality Focus][94] * [Partnerships][95] ## Responsibility * [Environment, Health & Safety][96] * [Community][97] * [Sustainability ][98]