Chi Minh City, Vietnam", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Vietnam)", "Operational Presence": "Vietnam", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops and markets biosimilars in Vietnam, a growing Southeast Asian market.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Marketer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "VN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Hualen (Vietnam) Pharmaceutical — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops and markets biosimilars in Vietnam.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "X Score": "40", "Y Score": "41", "Overall Score": "40", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Hummingbird Bioscience", "Website": "https://www.hummingbirdbioscience.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Singapore)", "Operational Presence": "Singapore", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops novel biologics for cancer and other diseases.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "Hummingbird Bioscience — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops novel biologics for cancer and other diseases.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "hummingbirdbioscience.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "hummingbirdbioscience.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ [Hummingbird Bioscience] ][1]\n[ [Hummingbird Bioscience] ][2]\n[ [Hummingbird Bioscience] ][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Science][5]\n  * [ADC Platform][6]\n  * [Antibody Platform][7]\n  * [Publications][8]\n* [Pipeline][9]\n  * [HMBD-001][10]\n  * [HMBD-501][11]\n* [News][12]\n* [Partnering][13]\n* [Patients][14]\n* [Contact][15]\n* [Join Us][16]\n\n# Precision Medicine.\n# Precision Therapies.\n\nHummingbird Bioscience is leading a bold new way of engineering biotherapeutics that can define the\nfuture of precision medicine.\n\nBuilding on our deep experience in biologics discovery and development, coupled with our proprietary\nlinker-payload technologies, we are developing a pipeline of next-generation antibody-based\ntherapeutics, including ADCs, giving hope to patients who do not respond to current treatments.\n\n### Precision\n### Biology\n\nWe focus on targets in cancer with strong biological rationale and clinical validation\n\n### Precision\n### Therapies\n\nWe use our proprietary technology platforms to discover and engineer precision therapies with the\npotential for deep and durable responses\n\n### Precision\n### Clinical Trials\n\nWe design and execute global clinical trials to maximize probability of success and make new\nmedicines available to patients as quickly as possible\n\n## Pipeline\n\nHummingbird Bioscience has a deep pipeline of highly differentiated antibody therapeutics with\nupcoming clinical proof-of concept readouts. Our technology has enabled our oncology and autoimmune\ntherapeutics, with capability to design and engineer therapeutics for other disease targets.\n\n[Learn More][17]\n\n## Latest News\n\nNews\n\n#### [Hummingbird Bioscience Wins APAC Trailblazer Award at 2026 Nebius AI Discovery Awards][18]\n\n14 July, 2026\n\nNews\n\n#### [Hummingbird Bioscience Announces First Patient Dosed in Phase I Clinical Trial of HMBD-501 in\n#### Advanced HER3-Expressing Solid Malignancies][19]\n\n6 January, 2026\n\nNews\n\n#### [Hummingbird Bioscience Licenses HMBD-002, Phase II-Ready Anti-VISTA Monoclonal Antibody to\n#### Percheron Therapeutics][20]\n\n26 June, 2025\n\n[Hummingbird Bioscience]\n\nThe Galen\n61 Science Park Road, #06-15\nSingapore 117525\n\n[[Hummingbird Bioscience Twitter] [Hummingbird Bioscience Twitter]][21] [[Hummingbird Bioscience\nLinkedin][Hummingbird Bioscience Linkedin]][22] [[Hummingbird Bioscience YouTube] [Hummingbird\nBioscience YouTube]][23]\n[Subscribe to our updates][24]\nRegistered Company No: 201505192N\n[PRIVACY POLICY][25] | © 2025 Hummingbird Bioscience\n×\n* [About Us][26]\n* [Science][27]\n  * [ADC Platform][28]\n  * [Antibody Platform][29]\n  * [Publications][30]\n* [Pipeline][31]\n  * [HMBD-001][32]\n  * [HMBD-501][33]\n* [News][34]\n* [Partnering][35]\n* [Patients][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n* [Join Us][38]\n×\n\nWhat are you looking for?\n\nSearch for:\n\n### Subscribe to our updates\n\n\n*indicates required\n\n*Email Address\n\n*First Name\n\n*Last Name\n\n*Company\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time by clicking the link in the footer of our emails. For information\nabout our privacy practices, please visit our website. For questions about this mailing list, please\nemail communications@hummingbirdbio.com\n\nWe use Mailchimp as our marketing platform. By clicking below to subscribe, you acknowledge that\nyour information will be transferred to Mailchimp for processing. [ Learn more about Mailchimp's\nprivacy practices here.][39]\n\n\nClose\ndsa8ds9vmd7d9wmksur63n3jd03ms6ej\n\n[1]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/\n[2]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/\n[3]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/\n[4]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/science/\n[6]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/adc-platform/\n[7]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/antibody-platform/\n[8]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/publications/\n[9]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/pipeline/\n[10]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/hmbd-001/\n[11]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/hmbd-501/\n[12]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/news/\n[13]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/partnering/\n[14]"}}, "page_text": "[ [Hummingbird Bioscience] ][1] [ [Hummingbird Bioscience] ][2] [ [Hummingbird Bioscience] ][3] * [About Us][4] * [Science][5] * [ADC Platform][6] * [Antibody Platform][7] * [Publications][8] * [Pipeline][9] * [HMBD-001][10] * [HMBD-501][11] * [News][12] * [Partnering][13] * [Patients][14] * [Contact][15] * [Join Us][16] # Precision Medicine. # Precision Therapies. Hummingbird Bioscience is leading a bold new way of engineering biotherapeutics that can define the future of precision medicine. Building on our deep experience in biologics discovery and development, coupled with our proprietary linker-payload technologies, we are developing a pipeline of next-generation antibody-based therapeutics, including ADCs, giving hope to patients who do not respond to current treatments. ### Precision ### Biology We focus on targets in cancer with strong biological rationale and clinical validation ### Precision ### Therapies We use our proprietary technology platforms to discover and engineer precision therapies with the potential for deep and durable responses ### Precision ### Clinical Trials We design and execute global clinical trials to maximize probability of success and make new medicines available to patients as quickly as possible ## Pipeline Hummingbird Bioscience has a deep pipeline of highly differentiated antibody therapeutics with upcoming clinical proof-of concept readouts. Our technology has enabled our oncology and autoimmune therapeutics, with capability to design and engineer therapeutics for other disease targets. [Learn More][17] ## Latest News News #### [Hummingbird Bioscience Wins APAC Trailblazer Award at 2026 Nebius AI Discovery Awards][18] 14 July, 2026 News #### [Hummingbird Bioscience Announces First Patient Dosed in Phase I Clinical Trial of HMBD-501 in #### Advanced HER3-Expressing Solid Malignancies][19] 6 January, 2026 News #### [Hummingbird Bioscience Licenses HMBD-002, Phase II-Ready Anti-VISTA Monoclonal Antibody to #### Percheron Therapeutics][20] 26 June, 2025 [Hummingbird Bioscience] The Galen 61 Science Park Road, #06-15 Singapore 117525 [[Hummingbird Bioscience Twitter] [Hummingbird Bioscience Twitter]][21] [[Hummingbird Bioscience Linkedin][Hummingbird Bioscience Linkedin]][22] [[Hummingbird Bioscience YouTube] [Hummingbird Bioscience YouTube]][23] [Subscribe to our updates][24] Registered Company No: 201505192N [PRIVACY POLICY][25] | © 2025 Hummingbird Bioscience × * [About Us][26] * [Science][27] * [ADC Platform][28] * [Antibody Platform][29] * [Publications][30] * [Pipeline][31] * [HMBD-001][32] * [HMBD-501][33] * [News][34] * [Partnering][35] * [Patients][36] * [Contact][37] * [Join Us][38] × What are you looking for? Search for: ### Subscribe to our updates *indicates required *Email Address *First Name *Last Name *Company You can unsubscribe at any time by clicking the link in the footer of our emails. For information about our privacy practices, please visit our website. For questions about this mailing list, please email communications@hummingbirdbio.com We use Mailchimp as our marketing platform. By clicking below to subscribe, you acknowledge that your information will be transferred to Mailchimp for processing. [ Learn more about Mailchimp's privacy practices here.][39] Close dsa8ds9vmd7d9wmksur63n3jd03ms6ej [1]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/ [2]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/ [3]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/ [4]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/about-us/ [5]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/science/ [6]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/adc-platform/ [7]: https://hummingbirdbioscience.com/antibo