ion-de-utilidades/ [66]: https://liomont.com.mx/aviso-de-privacidad/ [67]: https://liomont.com.mx/es_mx/politica-de-cookies/ [68]: https://liomont.com.mx/es_mx/terminos-de-uso/ [69]: https://liomont.com.mx/donde-estamos/#contactoform [70]: https://www.facebook.com/liomont.com.mx [71]: https://twitter.com/Liomont [72]: https://www.instagram.com/liomont/ [73]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/laboratorios-liomont/ [74]: https://www.youtube.com/user/LiomontOficial [75]: # [76]: https://liomont.com.mx/en/ [77]: #", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Laboratorios Liomont — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Liomont markets biosimilars in Mexico, including rituximab and trastuzumab, owning or marketing these products. | Markets biosimilars in Mexico, including rituximab and trastuzumab, and has partnerships for biologic production. | Mexico | Mexico City, Mexico", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "60", "Y Score": "62", "Overall Score": "61", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Laboratorios Richmond", "Website": "https://www.richmond.com.ar", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Buenos, Aires, Argentina", "Continent / Geography": "LATAM(Argentina)", "Operational Presence": "Argentina", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops and markets biosimilars, including rituximab and trastuzumab, in Argentina and other Latin American countries.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "AR", "Region Code": "LATAM", "Summary": "Laboratorios Richmond — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Richmond develops and markets biosimilars.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "D