ced Materials * [All][128] * [By Material][129] * [By Applicable Industry][130] * [By Division][131] Life Sciences * [All][132] * [By Medical Condition][133] * [By Product Type][134] * [By Division][135] * SUSTAINABILITY확장됨 Sustainability Strategy * [Sustainability Strategy][136] * [ Sustainability Report ][137] * [ESG Bonds][138] * [Eco-friendly Materials Brand LETZero][139] Climate Change * [Climate Action][140] Circularity * [Circular Economy][141] Supply Chain * [Responsible Supply Chain][142] Compliance * [Environment, Health & Safety][143] * [Compliance Management][144] Human Rights * [Human Rights][145] * CAREERS확장됨 [Workplace Vision][146] [People][147] [Life][148] [Apply][149] * [ 2026 Company Profile ][150] * [ 2025 Sustainability Report ][151] * [ Eco-friendly Materials LETZero ][152] * [ CI Logo ][153] ## Tech-driven Converting Company Driving change through technology, we create new markets with our customers ## Sustainability Sustainability is LG Chem's driving force into the future and what we ultimately aspire to achieve. ## Green Connector Through social responsibility with environmental awareness, LG Chem integrates green values into individual lives and society at large. ## LETZero LETZero, LG Chem’s Integrated Green Brand * 01Tech-driven Converting Company * 02Sustainability * 03Green Connector * 04LETZero ### “Tech-driven Converting Company” #### LG Chem is a converting company with strong technological capabilities. ##### About LG Chem * **1947** Established [go to History >][154] * **17,389** Number of Employees^{} Korea 12,943 ,Global 4,446 * **56** Global Business Sites^{} Korea16, Global40 * **50,434** Patents^{} Korea 17,975, Global 32,459 * KRW **45.93** trillion Sales^{} * KRW **1.18** trillion Operating Income^{} ##### Sustainability at LG Chem * **3**× Revenue of Four Core Growth Drivers (by 2030) * * Battery & Electronic Materials * Oncology New Drugs * Eco-friendly Sustainability * High Value-Added Business * **2050** Net Zero * **2030** Carbon-neutral Growth * **1.93** million tons Carbon Emissions Reduced Through Renewable Energy^{} * KRW **6.4** billion Social Contribution Achievements^{} * ^{}as of 2025 * ^{}as of today * ^{}2021~2025 (Estimation) ### Business #### Our exceptional products and materials with world-leading quality and cutting-edge technology #### are advancing the future life forward. * **Petrochemicals [**Petrochemicals][155] Petrochemicals Company We focus on eco-friendly materials to lead the sustainability business. * **Advanced Materials [**Advanced Materials][156] Advanced Materials Company We aim to become a global top‑tier battery and electronic materials company leading next‑generation technologies. * **Life Sciences [**Life Sciences][157] Life Sciences Company We aim to rise as a global pharmaceutical company that develops innovative new drugs. Petrochemicals Company We focus on eco-friendly materials to lead the sustainability business. The Petrochemicals Company is LG Chem's major business area with world-class productivity and cost competitiveness. We have established a vertically integrated system from basic raw materials such as ethylene and propylene to downstream products such as PE, ABS, and synthetic rubber. Advanced Materials Company We aim to become a global top‑tier battery and electronic materials company leading next‑generation technologies. The Advanced Materials Company is enhancing our business competitiveness in specialty materials through a market and customer-oriented approach. Life Sciences Company We aim to rise as a global pharmaceutical company that develops innovative new drugs. As a new growth engine for the future to be fostered in the medium and long term, the Company has differentiated R&D capabilities that have received new drug approval from the U.S. FDA for the first time in Korea. play ### News * [ALL][158] * [Press Releases][159] * [Notice][160] [Read More**][161] * [ Newsroom 2026.08.26 LG Chem to Showcase Advanced Packaging Material Solutions for AI Semiconductors at SEMICON Taiwan 2026 LG Chem to Showcase Advanced Packaging Material Solutions for AI Semiconductors at SEMICON Taiwan 2026 ][162] * [ Newsroom 2026.07.31 LG Chem Announces Q2 Financial Results LG Chem Announces Q2 Financial Results ][163] * [ Notice 2026.07.22 Warning Regarding Counterfeit Products Warning Regarding Counterfeit Products ][164] * [ Newsroom 2026.07.17 LG Chem Enters Semiconductor Stripper Market with Mass Supply to Amkor LG Chem Enters Semiconductor Stripper Market with Mass Supply to Amkor ][165] * [ Newsroom 2026.08.26 LG Chem to Showcase Advanced Packaging Material Solutions for AI Semiconductors at SEMICON Taiwan 2026 LG Chem to Showcase Advanced Packaging Material Solutions for AI Semiconductors at SEMICON Taiwan 2026 ][166] * [ Newsroom 2026.07.31 LG Chem Announces Q2 Financial Results LG Chem Announces Q2 Financial Results ][167] * [ Newsroom 2026.07.17 LG Chem Enters Semiconductor Stripper Market with Mass Supply to Amkor LG Chem Enters Semiconductor Stripper Market with Mass Supply to Amkor ][168] * [ Newsroom 2026.06.23 LG Chem to Invest KRW 15 Trillion in R&D, Intensifying Focus on Semiconductor, Mobility, and Robotics Materials LG Chem to Invest KRW 15 Trillion in R&D, Intensifying Focus on Semiconductor, Mobility, and Robotics Materials ][169] * [ LinkedIn 2025.12.17 Youth Activists for Biodiversity Conservation Youth Activists for Biodiversity Conservation ][170] * [ LinkedIn 2025.12.17 Partnering for Better Perfomance - Enhancing PVC quality with analytical expertise Partnering for Better Perfomance - Enhancing PVC quality with analytical expertise ][171] * [ LinkedIn 2025.12.17 Participating in Shanghai World of Packaging 2025, LG Chem will present its ultra-thin packaging film material, UNIQABLE™ Participating in Shanghai World of Packaging 2025, LG Chem will present its ultra-thin packaging film material, UNIQABLE™ ][172] * [ LinkedIn 2025.12.17 LG Chem Participates in High-Performance Thermal Materials Technology Seminar 2025 LG Chem Participates in High-Performance Thermal Materials Technology Seminar 2025 ][173] * [ Notice 2026.07.22 Warning Regarding Counterfeit Products ][174] * [ Notice 2026.05.21 Notice of Transfer of Personal Data ][175] * [ Notice 2026.03.19 Notice on Electronic Voting and Live Online Broadcasting for the 25th AGM of Shareholders ][176] * [ Notice 2026.02.27 Explanatory Materials for the 25th Annual General Meeting ][177] Discover LG Chem's latest content on social media. * [유튜브][178] * [인스타그램][179] * [네이버 블로그][180] * [Privacy Policy][181] * [Ethics Hotline][182] * [Site Map][183] * [1:1 Inquiries][184] Survey [LG Chem History Highlights][185] LEGAL * [Rejection of Unauthorized E-mail Collection][186] * [Cookie Setting][187] Related Sites * LG Corp. * [LG][188] * [LG Display][189] * [LG Electronics ][190] * [LG U+][191] * [LG Household&Health Care][192] Family Site * [LG Chem Blog][193] * [LG Energy Solution][194] * [Innovation Center][195] * [Farmhannong][196] * [AVEO Pharmaceuticals][197] * [Virtual e-Mobility Solution Site][198] Business * [LG Chem On][199] * [Procurement Portal System][200] * [SINGLEX Supplier Portal][201] ©LG Chem. All Rights Reserved Welcome! This site uses cookies to provide you with the best user experience. By continuing to browse the site, you agree to the use of cookies. Recommandation You have the option to accept all cookies recommended by us, or to make your own selection. You can revoke your consent to the selection made at any time. [Accept all][202] [More options][203] 닫기 ### alert Confirm Close Popup ** alert Confirm Close Popup ** close ** Rejection of e-mail collection without We reject any automatic collection of e-mail addresses on this website. Please note that anyone violating this can be punished in accordance with the information and communication network laws. Crime Response Center [http://www.spamcop.or.kr][204] Survey [ 1:1 Inquiries ][205] Top 1* 1 2 3 4 5 2 ** The LG Ethics Hotline W