n[Know More][101]\n\n> \"Some journeys are measured in kilometers. Others are measured in lives changed.\"\n\nThis is the story of one man and his unique journey\nThis is the Lupin Story\n[Know More][102]\nIntegrated Report 2025–2026\n[Know More][103]\nWith S&P Global ESG Score of 91, we are\nWorld No.1\n\n> in sustainability in the pharmaceutical industry\n\n[Know More][104]\n\n## The Lupin Story\n\nDriven by Science,\nInspired by Patients\n\nFounded by Dr. Desh Bandhu Gupta in 1968,\nLupin aimed to improve access to essential\nmedicines. Today we stand tall as a globally\ntrusted pharmaceutical company guided by\nscience, quality, and a patient-first mindset.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][105]\n\n## Our Purpose\n\nWe Catalyze\nTreatments\nThat Transform\nHope Into\nHealing\n\nOurs is a purpose-driven\njourney of over 5 decades,\nwhere we aim to improve\nlives, build sustainability\nand deliver long-term\nsolutions to all.\n\nRelief from disease\n\nDelivering meaningful\ntreatments for today and\ntomorrow\n\nInnovation to unlock access at scale\n\nMaking complex, cutting-edge\nhealthcare solutions accessible\nto all\n\n[Know More][106]\nSolutions for underserved communities\n\nServing markets and patients\noverlooked by others\n\n## Overview\n\nGlobal Impact\nHuman Touch\n0+\n\nGlobal Facilities\n\n[Know More][107]\n0+\n\nCountries\n\n[Know More][108]\n0+\n\nEmployees\n\n[Know More][109]\n0+\n\nProducts\n\n[Know More][110]\n\n## Our Business\n\nLupin operates a highly d"}}, "page_text": "[[Lupin Logo][Lupin Logo]][1] [About Us][2] [Our Business][3] [Investors][4] [Media][5] [Community][6] [Sustainability][7] [Careers][8] [Contact][9] [Globe] [Menu]Menu [Globe] [[India flag icon]India][10][[USA flag icon]USA][11][[Great Britain flag icon]UK][12][[South Africa flag icon]South Africa][13][[Australia flag icon]Australia][14][[Philippines flag icon]Philippines][15][[Germany flag icon]Germany][16][[Netherlands flag icon]Netherlands][17][[Mexico flag icon]Mexico][18][[Brazil flag ic