 testament to the potential of human imagination, compassion, and the unwavering pursuit of a better tomorrow. [Know More][101] > \"Some journeys are measured in kilometers. Others are measured in lives changed.\" This is the story of one man and his unique journey This is the Lupin Story [Know More][102] Integrated Report 2025–2026 [Know More][103] With S&P Global ESG Score of 91, we are World No.1 > in sustainability in the pharmaceutical industry [Know More][104] ## The Lupin Story Driven by Science, Inspired by Patients Founded by Dr. Desh Bandhu Gupta in 1968, Lupin aimed to improve access to essential medicines. Today we stand tall as a globally trusted pharmaceutical company guided by science, quality, and a patient-first mindset. [ Know More ][105] ## Our Purpose We Catalyze Treatments That Transform Hope Into Healing Ours is a purpose-driven journey of over 5 decades, where we aim to improve lives, build sustainability and deliver long-term solutions to all. Relief from disease Delivering meaningful treatments for today and tomorrow Innovation to unlock access at scale Making complex, cutting-edge healthcare solutions accessible to all [Know More][106] Solutions for underserved communities Serving markets and patients overlooked by others ## Overview Global Impact Human Touch 0+ Global Facilities [Know More][107] 0+ Countries [Know More][108] 0+ Employees [Know More][109] 0+ Products [Know More][110] ## Our Business Lupin operates a highly diversified pharmaceutical business with a strong presence across key global markets. Our operations span generics, complex formulations, branded products, and other high-burden specialty segments, supported by robust R&D and manufacturing capabilities. Spread across developed and emerging markets, Lupin's business is anchored in patient-centric approach and operational excellence. [ Know More ][111] [Healthcare Professional with Patient] Stock Quotes Last updated on — NSE : — — — — BSE : — — — — Financial Results [ Know More ][112] Exchange Filings [ Know More ][113] [Sustainability] ## Sustainability Caring for People, Planet, Patients Our mission extends beyond medicines. We invest in people, communities, and a greener tomorrow. [ Know More ][114] [CSR Activities] ## Community Beyond Medicines Lupin Foundation works in 5,500+ villages in 8 states of India. At the core of Lupin's community work is a passion to build sustainable models for uplifting lives. [ Know More ][115] [Life at Lupin] ## Life ## at Lupin Our people are the driving force behind our mission to improve patients’ lives and longevity. [ Join Our Team ][116] ## News and Insights [ Know More ][117] 17 August, 2026 Lupin Announces Approval from U.S. FDA for Pitolisant Tablets [ Know More ][118] 20 August, 2026 Lupin and Tenpoint Therapeutics Announce Strategic Partnership to Commercialize YUVEZZI™ in the European Union, the United Kingdom, Switzerland, Norway, and Iceland [Lupin Logo] [info@lupin.com][119] [+91 22 6640 2323][120] [Contact Us][121] [Consumer Advisory Notification][122] © 2025 Lupin. All rights reserved [Privacy][123] | [Disclaimer][124] | [Sitemap][125] | Cookie settings [About Us][126] * [The Lupin Story][127] * [Our Purpose][128] * [Our Values][129] * [Our Leadership][130] * [Compliance, Ethics and Governance][131] * [Global Presence][132] * [Our Manufacturing Approach][133] * [Quality in Action][134] * [Our Science][135] * [Awards and Recognitions][136] [Our Business][137] * [Global Generics][138] * [Emerging Markets][139] * [India][140] * [Specialty and Innovation][141] * [Biosimilars][142] * [Our Adjacencies][143] [Investors][144] * [Financial Reporting][145] * [Corporate Governance][146] * [Shareholder Information][147] * [News and Events][148] * [Disclosure Under Regulation 46 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015][149] [Media][150] * [Press Releases][151] * [Media Coverage][152] * [Perspectives][153] * [Media Kit][154] [Community][155] [Sustainability][156] [Careers][157] [Lupin For Suppliers][158]