tions][15] * [Consumer Healthcare][16] * [APIs][17] * [Veterinary][18] * [Pet Care][19] * [Agritech][20] * [About BSV][21] * [R&D & Innovation][22] Go Back Menu * [Overview][23] * [Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients (API)][24] * [Formulation R&D][25] * [New Drug Discovery Research (NDDR)][26] * [Biotechnology][27] * [Analytical R&D][28] * [Intellectual Property Rights][29] * [Safety & Sustainability][30] Go Back Menu * [Environment Health & Safety][31] * [Kind Care][32] * [International][33] Go Back Menu * [North America][34] * [Emerging Markets][35] * [Investor Center][36] Go Back Menu * [Investor Hub][37] * [Board Of Directors][38] * [Disclosures under Regulation 46 and 62 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015][39] * [Financials][40] * [Investor Presentations][41] * [Annual Reports][42] * [Intimation To Stock Exchange][43] * [Shareholder Information][44] * [Corporate Governance][45] * [Company Contact][46] * [Postal Ballot][47] * [Qualified Institutional Placement - PPD][48] * [Qualified Institutional Placement - PD][49] * [Careers][50] Go Back Menu * [Life At Mankind][51] * [Current Openings][52] * [Shop][53] * [Blog][54] * [Media][55] * [Contact Us][56] Company * [About Mankind][57] * [Overview][58] * [Milestones][59] * [Management][60] * [Products][61] * [Partner With Us][62] * [Awards & Recognition][63] * [Our Initiatives][64] * [Our Brand][65] * [Quality][66] * [Manufacturing][67] * [Our Business][68] * [Formulations][69] * [Consumer Healthcare][70] * [APIs][71] * [Veterinary][72] * [Pet Care][73] * [Agritech][74] * [About BSV][75] We are driven by three core values of quality, affordability and accessibility. R&D & Innovation * [Overview][76] * [Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients (API)][77] * [Formulation R&D][78] * [New Drug Discovery Research (NDDR)][79] * [Biotechnology][80] * [Analytical R&D][81] * [Intellectual Property Rights][82] With 6 cutting-edge R&D facilities, we pioneer breakthroughs like Dydrogesterone in pharmaceutical excellence. Safety & Sustainability * [Environment Health & Safety][83] * [Kind Care][84] We have adopted policies aimed at complying with legislative requirements and ensuring the safety of our employees and the personnel working at our facilities or under our management. International * [North America][85] * [Emerging Markets][86] Committed towards a healthier and happier world, we strive to provide accessible and affordable healthcare to all sections of the society. Investor Center * [Investor Hub][87] * [Board Of Directors][88] * [Disclosures under Regulation 46 and 62 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015][89] * [Financials][90] * [Investor Presentations][91] * [Annual Reports][92] * [Intimation To Stock Exchange][93] * [Shareholder Information][94] * [Corporate Governance][95] * [Company Contact][96] * [Postal Ballot][97] * [Qualified Institutional Placement - PPD][98] * [Qualified Institutional Placement - PD][99] Mankind Pharma Ltd NSE: MANKIND - - Careers * [Life At Mankind][100] * [Current Openings][101] Mankind Pharma is not just a workplace; it's a frontier of innovation. Join us in leveraging science to shape a healthier Bharat. [Shop][102] * [Blog][103] * [Media][104] * [Contact Us][105] Discover more of Mankind Close Your browser does not support the video element. # Advancing Healthcare and Better Science for a Healthier Bharat Advancing Healthcare and Better Science for a Healthier Bharat scroll Mankind Pharma, where every stride is a step towards better science and a healthier, resilient Bharat. [Learn More][106] ISO-45001 Certified R&D & INNOVATION We seek out, and solve, tough challenges. Your browser does not support the video tag. R&D Excellence 740+ Scientists 07 Top Notch R&D Centers 918 Product Filings Worldwide Your browser does not support the video tag. MANKIND IMPACT 200+ Speciality Drugs for Tier 2-3 Cities in India Highest Coverage in Tier II - Tier IV cities and rural markets 44 Billion units installed capacity Your browser does not support the video tag. R&D Highlights First in India to develop and commercialize Dydrogesterone [Learn More ][107] Innovating for the world The obsession with innovative healthcare solutions has made us the most prescribed pharma company in India. We are architects of the future, setting new benchmarks in pharmaceutical excellence with drug discovery, advanced formulations, generic APIs, and biotechnology. Your browser does not support the video tag. Our Promise Leave no citizen behind in the journey towards a healthier nation. [quality] Quality Our non-compromising approach to quality ensures that we are constantly endeavoring to achieve and maintain the highest quality standards in the pharmaceutical industry in India. [affordability] Affordability Staying true to our founding principles of being a price disruptor, we deliver affordable medication that meets the healthcare needs of Bharat. [accessibility] Accessibility More than 50% of India’s total population resides in villages, making access to medicines difficult. Mankind’s pioneering use of supply chains and a company-owned distribution setup bolsters accessibility. Your browser does not support the video tag. Our Business Verticals We excel in developing, manufacturing and marketing a diverse range of pharmaceutical formulations across various acute and chronic therapeutic areas, as well as several consumer healthcare products. We excel in developing, manufacturing and marketing a diverse range of pharmaceutical formulations across various acute and chronic therapeutic areas, as well as several consumer healthcare products. [ Formulations A range of pharmaceutical formulations across acute and chronic therapeutic areas. Multiple brands within the same therapeutic area allow us to cater to the requirements of a wide range of patients. ][108] [ [Consumer Healthcare] Consumer Healthcare A range of consumer healthcare products to meet the non-prescription segment ranging from antacids to condoms to pregnancy test kits. ][109] [ [Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients] Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients (APIs) High-quality Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients to help patients get access to affordable and innovative medicines. We manufacture NCEs, generic APIs, advanced organic intermediates, and agrochemicals ][110] [ [Veterinary Care] Veterinary Care Achieving a remarkable 200 crore business within a decade of establishment, we're a leading player in the Indian veterinary sector. Our comprehensive offerings include nutritional supplements, anti-infectives, dewormers, hormonal preparations, and acidifiers. ][111] [ Pet Care We support the pet care ecosystem with a diverse lineup of nutritious offerings, including food, medicine, supplements, and grooming products. Our UK-made pet food, sourced from Europe, meets BRCGS standards, ensuring international quality and safety. ][112] [ [Agritech] Agritech We meet the agri-input and crop protection demands of growers for safe, productive and sustainable production. Our R&D Centre and collaborations with multinationals bring world-class crop protection solutions to Indian farmers. ][113] SUSTAINABILITY SPOTLIGHT Committed to Creating Value for People and Planet [ [Building a Decarbonized Society] Climate Action Building a Decarbonized Society BLOG | Nov 2024 ][114] [ [Embracing Waste Reduction and Circularity] Circular Economy Embracing Waste Reduction and Circularity BLOG | Nov 2024 ][115] [ [Resource Management: Preserving Our Ecosystem] Resource Management Resource Management: Preserving Our Ecosystem BLOG | Nov 2024 ][116] [ [Ensuring Employee and Partner Wellbeing and Safety: A Zero-Impact Commitment] Employee Safety Ensuring Employee and Partner Wellbeing and Safety: A Zero-Impact Commitment BLOG | Nov 2024 ][117] [ [Strengthening Our Supply Chain for Sustainable Growth] Supplier Assessments Strengthening Our Supply Chain for Sustainable Growth BLOG | Nov 2024 ][118] Our Environment, Social and Governance Strategy [Download 2023 ESG Report ][119] Join us, fuel the future. Mankind Pharma is not just a workplace. It’s a frontier of innovation. And by joining us, you will be one of the trailblazers using science to shape a healthier Bharat. * Nurturing growth in a world-class environment * Industry-leading compensation and perks * Innovation that impacts global healthcare [VIEW OPEN POSITIONS][120] Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the audio element. Listen to Our Latest Earnings Call - Q4 FY26 0:00/01 : 08 : 00 1X 1.5X 2X Annual Report FY 25-26 Mankind Pharma Ltd NSE: MANKIND - - Contact Information Registered Office Mankind Pharma Limited CIN: L74899DL1991PLC044843 208, Okhla Industrial Estate Phase-III New Delhi 110 020, Delhi, India Tel: [+91 11 4747 6600][121] Corporate Office 262, Okhla Industrial Estate Phase-III New Delhi 110 020, Delhi, India Tel: [+91 11 4684 6700][122] E-mail: [investors@mankindpharma.com][123] Quick Links * [iTAP][124] * [Blog][125] * [Media][126] * [Career][127] * [SSO Login][128] * [Stockist][129] * [ESS][130] * [FAQ's][131] [GET IN TOUCH][132] * [Code Of Conduct][133] * [Privacy Policy][134] * [Disclaimer][135] * [Smart ODR Portal][136] * [Recruitment Fraud Policy][137] * [Disclosures][138] [contact@mankindpharma.com][139] Mankind@2026. All Rights Reserved [1]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/products/new-gst-prices/ [2]: # [3]: # [4]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/company/ [5]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/company/heritage/ [6]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/company/management/ [7]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/products/ [8]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/partnership/ [9]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/company/awards-recognition/ [10]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/company/our-initiatives/ [11]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/our-brand/ [12]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/company/quality/ [13]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/company/manufacturing/ [14]: # [15]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/formulations/ [16]: https://www.mankindpharma.com/consumer-healthcare/ [1