rters": "Adelaide, Australia", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Australia)", "Operational Presence": "Australia", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Mayne Pharma is an Australian-based pharmaceutical company that markets a portfolio of generic and specialty products, including biosimilars.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Marketer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "AU", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Mayne Pharma Group — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Mayne Pharma is an Australian pharmaceutical company that markets generic and specialty products, including biosimilars.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "maynepharma.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "maynepharma.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to the content][1]\n* About\n  * [About Mayne Pharma][2]\n  * [Company History][3]\n  * [From Faulding to Mayne Pharma][4]\n  * [Senior Leadership and Directors][5]\n  * [Corporate Governance][6]\n* [Contact][7]\n* [Careers][8]\n  * [Careers Welcome][9]\n  * [Our Global Organisation][10]\n  * [Global Locations][11]\n    * [Adelaide, South Australia][12]\n    * [Melbourne, Victoria][13]\n    * [Raleigh, North Carolina][14]\n  * [Culture][15]\n  * [Australian Employee Benefits][16]\n  * [US Employee Benefits][17]\n  * [Employee Wellness][18]\n  * [Learning and Development][19]\n  * [Mayne Pharma in the Community][20]\n  * [AU Job Opportunities][21]\n  * [US Job Opportunities][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n  * [Our Approach][25]\n  * [Our People][26]\n    * [Diversity][27]\n    * [Health and Safety][28]\n    * [Health and Wellness][29]\n  * [Our Products][30]\n    * [Ethical Sourcing and Modern Slavery][31]\n    * [Product Quality and Safety][32]\n  * [Our Operations][33]\n    * [Environmental, Health and Safety (EHS)][34]\n    * [Energy Use and Emissions][35]\n    * [Packaging Sustainability][36]\n    * [Waste Management][37]\n  * [Our Contribution][38]\n    * [Community Investment][39]\n    * [Research, Education and Training][40]\nSearch for:\n* [Home][41]\n* Products\n  * [Australian Products][42]\n    * [Generic Products][43]\n    * [Specialty Brands][44]\n  * [Rest of World Products][45]\n  * [US Products][46]\n    * [Women’s Health][47]\n      * [Supplements][48]\n    * [Dermatology][49]\n  * [Therapeutic Focus][50]\n* Contract Services\n  * [About Contract Services][51]\n  * [Mayne Pharma Services (Australia)][52]\n* [Capabilities][53]\n  * [Australian Facilities][54]\n  * [Specialty Technologies][55]\n    * [CLEANTASTE® Technology][56]\n    * [Controlled Release Delivery System][57]\n    * [Pellet Technology][58]\n    * [SUBA® Bioavailability Technology][59]\n* [Partnering Opportunities][60]\n* [Investor Relations][61]\n\n# Improving patient access to **life-enhancing** medications\n\nMayne Pharma is an ASX-listed specialty pharmaceutical company focused on commercialising\npharmaceuticals.\n\nWe have a 40-year track record of innovation and success developing new oral drug delivery systems\nand these technologies have been successfully commercialised in numerous products that continue to\nbe marketed around the world.\n\n[More about us][62][Our capabilities][63]\n[A couple with adult children and a dog walk in nature, parents with two adult daughters]\n\n## We offer patients better, safe & more accessible medicines.\n\n[View our products][64][Explore our capabilities][65]\n[\n[Man looking in microscope]\n[Man looking in microscope]\n\n### Capabilities\n\nTo improve patient access to life-enhancing prescription medications, Mayne Pharma offers a robust\nportfolio of branded and generic drugs in multiple therapeutic areas, including women's health and\ndermatology.\n\nLearn more\n][66]\n[\n[Pills]\n[Pills]\n\n### Contract services\n\nMayne Pharma has a full service contract development and manufacturing organisations (CDMO)\nspecialising in novel oral and topical dose forms providing pharmaceutical development, analytical\ntesting and commercial manufacturing to clients worldwide. Our mission is to partner with clients to\ndevelop and deliver pharmaceutical products from “concept to commercialisation” to change the lives\nof patients around the globe:\n\nLearn more\n][67]\n[\n\n### Sustainability\n\nAt Mayne Pharma, we recognise that we are part of a global community. As part of this community, we\nare committed to operating our business in a sustainable manner. We ensure our people are safe and\nwell-supported, local communities prosper and the environment is well cared for so that it benefits\nfuture generations.\n\nLearn more\n][68]\n\n## For investors\n\n[Company Announcements][69]\n\n## Looking for something specific?\n\nSearch for:\n\n### © 2026 Mayne Pharma Group Limited\n### All rights reserved. MAYNE PHARMA and the MAYNE PHARMA logo are registered trademarks of Mayne\n### Pharma Group Ltd. All other trademarks are the pr"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to the content][1] * About * [About Mayne Pharma][2] * [Company History][3] * [From Faulding to Mayne Pharma][4] * [Senior Leadership and Directors][5] * [Corporate Governance][6] * [Contact][7] * [Careers][8] * [Careers Welcome][9] * [Our Global Organisation][10] * [Global Locations][11] * [Adelaide, South Australia][12] * [Melbourne, Victoria][13] * [Raleigh, North Carolina][14] * [Culture][15] * [Australian Employee Benefits][16] * [US Employee Benefits][17] * [Employee Wellness][18] * [Learning and Development][19] * [Mayne Pharma in the Community][20] * [AU Job Opportunities][21] * [US Job Opportunities][22] * [News][23] * [Sustainability][24] * [Our Approach][25] * [Our People][26] * [Diversity][27] * [Health and Safety][28] * [Health and Wellness][29] * [Our Products][30] * [Ethical Sourcing and Modern Slavery][31] * [Product Quality and Safety][32] * [Our Operations][33] * [Environmental, Health and Safety (EHS)][34] * [Energy Use and Emissions][35] * [Packaging Sustainability][36] * [Waste Management][37] * [Our Contribution][38] * [Community Investment][39] * [Research, Education and Training][40] Search for: * [Home][41] * Products * [Australian Products][42] * [Generic Products][43] * [Specialty Brands][44] * [Rest of World Products][45] * [US Products][46] * [Women’s Health][47] * [Supplements][48] * [Dermatology][49] * [Therapeutic Focus][50] * Contract Services * [About Contract Services][51] * [Mayne Pharma Services (Australia)][52] * [Capabilities][53] * [Australian Facilities][54] * [Specialty Technologies][55] * [CLEANTASTE® Technology][56] * [Controlled Release Delivery System][57] * [Pellet Technology][58] * [SUBA® Bioavailability Technology][59] * [Partnering Opportunities][60] * [Investor Relations][61] # Improving patient access to **life-enhancing** medications Mayne Pharma is an ASX-listed specialty pharmaceutical company focused on commercialising pharmaceuticals. We have a 40-year track record of innovation and success developing new oral drug delivery systems and these technologies have been successfully commercialised in numerous products that continue to be marketed around the world. [More about us][62][Our capabilities][63] [A couple with adult children and a dog walk in nature, parents with two adult daughters] ## We offer patients better, safe & more accessible medicines. [View our products][64][Explore our capabilities][65] [ [Man looking in microscope] [Man looking in microscope] ### Capabilities To improve patient access to life-enhancing prescription medications, Mayne Pharma offers a robust portfolio of branded and generic drugs in multiple therapeutic areas, including women's health and dermatology. Learn more ][66] [ [Pills] [Pills] ### Contract services Mayne Pharma has a full service contract development and manufacturing organisations (CDMO) specialising in novel oral and topical dose forms providing pharmaceutical development, analytical testing and commercial manufacturing to clients worldwide. Our mission is to partner with clients to develop and deliver pharmaceutical products from “concept to commercialisation” to change the lives of patients around the globe: Learn more ][67] [ ### Sustainability At Mayne Pharma, we recognise that we are part of a global community. As part of this community, we are committed to operating our business in a sustainable manner. We ensure our people are safe and well-supported, local communities prosper and the environment is well cared for so that it benefits future generations. Learn more ][68] ## For investors [Company Announcements][69] ## Looking for something specific? Search for: ### © 2026 Mayne Pharma Group Limited ### All rights reserved. MAYNE PHARMA and the MAYNE PHARMA logo are registered trademarks of Mayne ### Pharma Group Ltd. All other trademarks are the property of their respective owners. ### ### Mayne Pharma / You Deserve Tomorrow. * [Home][70] * [About Mayne Pharma][71] * [Contact][72] * [News][73] * [Careers Welcome][74] * [Sustainability][75] * [About Contract Services][76] * [AU Products][77] * [US Products][78] * [Terms and Conditions][79] * [Privacy Notice][80] * [Social Media Notice][81] * [Accessibility Statement][82] * [US Compliance Notices][83] [LinkedIn][84] Search for: * [Home][85] * Products * [Australian Products][86] * [Generic Products][87] * [Specialty Brands][88] * [Rest of World Products][89] * [US Products][90] * [Women’s Health][91] * [Supplements][92] * [Dermatology][93] * [Therapeutic Focus][94] * Contract Services * [About Contract Services][95] * [Mayne Pharma Services (Australia)][96] * [Capabilities][97] * [Australian Facilities][98] * [Specialty T