nd Caregivers * [ Healthcare Professionals ][150] * [ Healthcare professional country resource ][151] * [ Adverse Event Reporting ][152] * [ Novartis Clinical Trials ][153] * [ Grants & Sponsorships ][154] [A female doctor looking in the distance] Healthcare Professionals * [ ESG ][155] * [ Ethics, Risk and Compliance ][156] * [ Access ][157] * [ Environmental Sustainability ][158] * [ Global Health ][159] * [ Ethical Behavior ][160] * [ Corporate Responsibility ][161] [Young patients waiting outside hospital in Rwanda] ESG * [ News ][162] * [ Recent News ][163] * [ News Archive ][164] * [ Stories ][165] * [ Contacts ][166] [A photo of people in a meeting hall] News * [ Careers ][167] * [ Career Search ][168] * [ Meet the teams ][169] * [ Personal Growth ][170] * [ Early Talent ][171] * [ How We Work ][172] * [ Well-being ][173] * [ Diversity and Inclusion ][174] * [ Employee Benefits ][175] * [ Awards & Recognition ][176] [Search jobs] Careers * [ Coronavirus ][177] Coronavirus [Novartis South Africa building] Home Header [Novartis building] # Novartis South Africa [female scientist in lab] ## Novartis in South Africa Our purpose is to reimagine medicine to improve and extend patient lives in South Africa. We achieve this everyday by aspiring to be a trusted leader in changing the practice of medicine in both private and public sector. [Learn More][178] [Young patients waiting outside hospital in Rwanda] ## The Novartis Commitment to Patients and Caregivers Novartis works with the patient community around the world to discover new ways to improve and extend people’s lives. [Learn More][179] [ [Scientist in laboratory] ### About We discover and develop breakthrough treatments and find new ways to deliver them to as many people as possible. ][180] [ [A couple holding hands] ### Patients and Caregivers Novartis works with the patient community around the world to discover new ways to improve and extend people’s lives. ][181] [ [A female doctor looking in the distance]