ore": "70", "Overall Score": "68", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Octapharma", "Website": "https://www.octapharma.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Lachen, Switzerland, Its", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Switzerland)", "Operational Presence": "Switzerland", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Octapharma markets plasma-derived biologics and recombinant coagulation factors.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CH", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Octapharma — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Octapharma markets plasma-derived biologics and recombinant coagulation factors, owning and marketing branded biologics.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "octapharma.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "octapharma.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Octapharma\n* Global\n[[Logo]][1]\n* [About us ][2]\n* [Sustainability][3]\n* [Plasma][4]\n* [Products ][5]\n* [News][6]\n* [Careers][7]\n[A smiling couple kneels beside a toddler in a winter scene, all wearing warm clothing. The toddler\nstands between them, holding their hands.]\n\n# Part of a vital chain\n\n[\nRead our Annual Report 2025\n][8]\n\n###### Diseases & Therapies\n\n## We develop and manufacture life-saving therapies\n\n[\n\n##### Haematology\n\nOur medicines help prevent and control bleeding in patients with bleeding disorders.\n][9]\n[\n\n##### Immunotherapy\n\nImmunoglobulins support the immune system in fighting infections and autoimmune diseases.\n][10]\n[\n\n##### Critical care\n\nOur medicines restore haemostasis and blood volume in critically ill patients.\n][11]\n[Blurred image of an Octapharma production line, with numerous vials. ]\n\n###### Who we are\n\n## One of the largest human protein manufacturers in the world\n\nWe develop and produce medicines based on proteins derived from human cell lines and human plasma.\n\n+\n\nemployees\n\n\nstate-of-the-art manufacturing sites\n\n€ bn\n\nrevenue in 2025\n\n[\nLearn more about us\n][12]\n\n###### Our vision\n\n## Advancing human life\n\nInnovationSustainabilityEngagementPlasma\n\n## Research & Development\n\nThrough pre-clinical and clinical research, we develop and test medicines to ensure they are safe\nand effective.\n[\nR&D at Octapharma\n][13]\n[An Octapharma production employee in a green shirt stands indoors with a blurred background,\nlooking towards the camera, while reaching out with one arm.]\n\n###### Careers\n\n## Become part of a vital chain\n\nWe welcome people with a wide range of skills and backgrounds worldwide. Explore our open positions\nand apply today!\n\n[\nWorking at Octapharma\n][14]\n\n###### Our employees\n\n## Growing together\n\n[\nLachen, Switzerland\n\n##### \"Octapharma is the most exciting company I've worked for\"\n\nJoel Lüsher, Head of Controlling\n][15]\n1 / 6\n\nOctapharma news\n\n##### Read our latest stories\n\n[\n30/07/2026\n\n##### Octapharma to build $1.5 billion state-of-the-art critical care manufacturing facility in Rock\n##### Hill, SC\n\n][16]\n[\n27/07/2026\n\n##### When VWD care advances, lives move forward\n\n][17]\n[\n23/06/2026\n\n##### A father, a diagnosis, and the search for answers\n\n][18]\n[\n27/05/2026\n\n##### \"What we do here really makes a difference\"\n\nSophia Sagner, Head of Line Supervisor\n][19]\n\n### What can we help you find?\n* [\n  \n  ###### About us\n  \n  ][20]\n* [\n  \n  About us\n  \n  ][21]\n* [\n  \n  Who we are\n  \n  ][22]\n* [\n  \n  Diseases & therapies\n  \n  ][23]\n* [\