pens a new window ][29] [ Opens a new window ][30] [ Opens a new\nwindow ][31] [ Opens a new window ][32]\n\n[Main menu][33]\n\n## Organon site directory\n* The Americas\n  \n  ### Organon\n  * [Brazil][34]\n  * Canada  [English][35]  ·  [French][36]\n  * [Latin America][37]\n  * [Mexico][38]\n  * [USA][39]\n* Europe\n  \n  ### Organon\n  * [Austria][40]\n  * Belgium  [Dutch][41]  ·  [English][42]  ·  [French][43]\n  * [Bulgaria][44]\n  * [Czech Republic][45]\n  * [Denmark][46]\n  * [Estonia][47]\n  * [Finland][48]\n  * [France][49]\n  * [Germany][50]\n  * [Hungary][51]\n  * [Ireland][52]\n  * [Italy][53]\n  * [Latvia][54]\n  * [Lithuania][55]\n  * Luxembourg  [English][56]  ·  [French][57]\n  * Netherlands  [Dutch][58]  ·  [English][59]\n  * [Norway][60]\n  * [Poland][61]\n  * [Portugal][62]\n  * [Romania][63]\n  * [Russia][64]\n  * [Serbia][65]\n  * [Slovakia][66]\n  * [Slovenia][67]\n  * [Spain][68]\n  * [Sweden][69]\n  * Switzerland  [French][70]  ·  [German][71]  ·  [English][72]\n  * Ukraine  [Ukrainian][73]  · \n  * [United Kingdom][74]\n* Asia Pacific\n  \n  ### Organon\n  * [Australia][75]\n  * [Hong Kong, China][76]\n  * [Indonesia][77]\n  * [Japan][78]\n  * [Malaysia][79]\n  * [New Zealand][80]\n  * [Philippines][81]\n  * [Singapore][82]\n  * [South Korea][83]\n  * [Taiwan][84]\n  * [Thailand][85]\n  * [Vietnam][86]\n* Middle East & Africa\n  \n  ### Organon\n  * [Egypt][87]\n  * [Israel][88]\n  * [Jordan][89]\n  * [KSA][90]\n  * [Kuwait][91]\n  * [Lebanon][92]\n  * Northwest Africa  [French][93]  ·  [Arabic][94]  ·  [Turkey][95]\n  * [Oman][96]\n  * [South Africa][97]\n  * [Turkey][98]\n  * [UAE][99]\n\n[View all locations and contact information][100]\n\n## What can we help you find?\n\nSearch site\nSearch for: Submit\n\n# Organon, here for her health\n\nWe are a global healthcare company with a strategy to improve the health of women throughout their\nlives. Our diverse portfolio across women's health and general medicines includes therapies and\nproducts for a wide range of conditions and diseases.\n\n## Our vision: a better and healthier every day for every woman.\n\n## Our areas of focus\n\nOur portfolio encompasses more than 70 medicines across a range of areas including reproductive\nhealth, cardiovascular disease, neurology, dermatology, autoimmune, and respiratory conditions. We\nbring these important therapies to more than 140 markets around the world.\n\n[Learn more about our focus areas][101]\n\n### Women’s health\n\nThrough our pipeline and portfolio, we are working to deliver medicines and devices that advance the\nhealth of women through all stages of her life journey. We focus on conditions that are unique to\nwomen, affect her disproportionately or impact her differently, including fertility and\ncontraception, maternal health conditions, and vaginal health.\n\n### General medicines\n\nOur general medicines franchise supports patients in managing critical, chronic, and acute\nconditions – including those that disproportionately affect women. Core to this franchise are our\nbiosimilars, which play a vital role in expanding access to essential treatments and reflect our\ncommitment to affordability for communities around the world.\n\n## Latest news\n\n[Click here for our news rel"}}, "page_text": "[ Skip to content ][1] [ [Organon logo] ][2] [Search] Close [menu icon]Menu Close [Main menu][3] * About us * Our products * [Our focus][4] * [Products list][5] * [Patient support programs][6] * [Organon Pro for healthcare professionals][7] * [Safety data sheets][8] * [Product patents][9] * Our leaders * [Leadership team][10] * [Board of Directors][11] * [Corporate governance][12] * [Business development][13] * [Our culture][14] * [Our stories][15] * [Policies & positions][16] * [ESG][17] * Media * [Media][18] * [News][19] * [Suppliers][20] * Investor relations * [Investor relations overview][21] * [Events & presentations][22] * [SEC filings][23] * [Financial Information][24] * [Investor resources][25] * [Careers][26] [Contact us][27] Global [ Opens a new window ][28] [ Opens a new window ][29] [ Opens a new window ][30] [ Opens a new window ][31] [ Opens a new window ][32] [Main menu][33] ## Organon site directory * The Americas ### Organon * [Brazil][34] * Canada [English][35] · [French][36] * [Latin America][37] * [Mexico][38] * [USA][39] * Europe ### Organon * [Austria][40] * Belgium [Dutch][41] · [English][42] · [French][43] * [Bulgaria][44] * [Czech Republic][45] * [Denmark][46] * [Estonia][47] * [Finland][48] * [France][49] * [Germany][50] * [Hungary][51] * [Ireland][52] * [Italy][53] * [Latvia][54] * [Lithuania][55] * Luxembourg [English][56] · [French][57] * Netherlands [Dutch][58] · [English][59] * [Norway][60] * [Poland][61] * [Portugal][62] * [Romania][63] * [Russia][64] * [Serbia][65] * [Slovakia][66] * [Slovenia][67] * [Spain][68] * [Sweden][69] * Switzerland [French][70] · [German][71] · [English][72] * Ukraine [Ukrainian][73] · * [United Kingdom][74] * Asia Pacific ### Organon * [Australia][75] * [Hong Kong, China][76] * [Indonesia][77] * [Japan][78] * [Malaysia][79] * [New Zealand][80] * [Philippines][81] * [Singapore][82] * [South Korea][83] * [Taiwan][84] * [Thailand][85] * [Vietnam][86] * Middle East & Africa ### Organon * [Egypt][87] * [Israel][88] * [Jordan][89] * [KSA][90] * [Kuwait][91] * [Lebanon][92] * Northwest Africa [French][93] · [Arabic][94] · [Turkey][95] * [Oman][96] * [South Africa][97] * [Turkey][98] * [UAE][99] [View all locations and contact information][100] ## What can we help you find? Search site Search for: Submit # Organon, here for her health We are a global healthcare company with a strategy to improve the health of women throughout their lives. Our diverse portfolio across women's health and general medicines includes therapies and products for a wide range of conditions and diseases. ## Our vision: a better and healthier every day for every woman. ## Our areas of focus Our portfolio encompasses more than 70 medicines across a range of areas including reproductive health, cardiovascular disease, neurology, dermatology, autoimmune, and respiratory conditions. We bring these important therapies to more than 140 markets around the world. [Learn more about our focus areas][101] ### Women’s health Through our pipeline and portfolio, we are working to deliver medicines and devices that advance the health of women through all stages of her life journey. We focus on conditions that are unique to women, affect her disproportionately or impact her differently, including fertility and contraception, maternal health conditions, and vaginal health. ### General medicines Our general medicines franchise supports patients in managing critical, chronic, and acute conditions – including those that disproportionately affect women. Core to this franchise are our biosimilars, which play a vital role in expanding access to essential treatments and reflect our commitment to affordability for communities around the world. ## Latest news [Click here for our news releases][102] youtube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wx_PLiEYfVg :https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wx_PLiEYfVg ## Creating a brighter future for her We imagine a world where women, the backbone of a thriving and resilient society, can readily access solutions which meet her health needs. A world where she prospers, and so does her family, her community, and her world for generations to come. Together, we are building a brighter future for her. [Discover our story][103] ## Industry awards and recognition received [View all][104] [Disability Index 2025 award winner] Disability Index, Best Place to Work for Disability Inclusion, 2025 [America’s Most JUST Companies, CNBC 2025] JUST Capital, America’s Most JUST Companies, JUST 100 Index, 2025 [Fortune change the world] Fortune, Change the World, Recognized for our work in expanding global access to our contraceptions, 2023 [SHE Is Global Forum 2023] She Is Global Forum, Organization of the Year with the Power to Generate Change Towards Gender Equity, 2023 ## Careers ### Join our team Our global community is united to better support the health of women both within our company and around the world. Join a passionate team dedicated to being part of a strong corporate culture rooted in our corporate mission, vision, and values. We’re looking forward to an exciting future. [Search open opportunities][105] [Illustration of two women holding briefcases shaking hands] ### Investor relations Our growth enables us to strengthen our business and initiatives in order to make a greater impact on patients’ lives, realize long-term success, and deliver value to our shareholders. [Learn more][106] [Illustration of two women, one passing microphone to the other] ### Our stories We share stories that amplify unheard voices and highlight how we are sparking collective action and delivering a new era in healthcare to help empower women globally. [Read our stories][107] ### Connect with us on social [ Opens a new window ][108] [ Opens a new window ][109] [ Opens a new window ][110] [ Opens a new window ][111] [ Opens a new window ][112] [ [Organon logo] ][113] ## Company * [About us][114] * [Our Leaders][115] * [Environmental, social & governance][116] * [Policies & positions][117] ## Resources * [Patient resources][118] * [Investor relations][119] * [Media][120] * [Organon Pro for healthcare professionals][121] ## Contact us * [Contact information][122] * [Global locations][123] * [Forward-Looking Statement][124] * [Cookie policy][125] * Your Privacy Choices * [Privacy Policy][126] * [Consumer Health Data Policy][127] * [Terms of Use][128] * [Sitemap][129] © 2026 Organon group of companies. All rights reserved. ORGANON and the ORGANON Logo are trademarks of the Organon group of companies. This site is intended for residents of the United States. [ Opens a new window ][130] [ Opens a new window ][131] ## You are leaving Organon.com [Cancel][132] [Continue Opens a new window ][133] ## 