 "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Panacea Biotec", "Website": "https://www.panaceabiotec.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "New Delhi, India", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(India)", "Operational Presence": "India", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Indian biopharmaceutical company with biologic products including vaccines and recombinant therapeutics.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Panacea Biotec — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Biopharmaceutical company with biologic products including vaccines and recombinant therapeutics.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "panaceabiotec.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "panaceabiotec.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[About Us][1][Our Products][2][Investor Zone][3][Careers][4][Contact Us][5]\nEnglish Global\n[English][6][Germany][7]\n[Panacea Biotec | Pharma & Biotechnology Company]\n\n### About Us and Our Journey\n\nCreating Innovative ways for enhanced customer experience each time every time\nPanacea Biotec is an Innovation driven company doing Research and Development, Manufacturing, Sales,\nDistribution and Marketing of Nutrition, Vaccines & Pharmaceuticals.\n[Read More][8]\n\n### Press Releases\n\nJune 8, 2026\n[Launch of the DENSTAR project: advancing the licensure of a tetravalent live-attenuated dengue\nvaccine (DengiAll) in sub-Saharan Africa and to facilitate its global access][9]\nSeptember 25, 2025\n[Press Release - Launch of Niko Mom Baby Skin Care][10]\nJune 3, 2025\n[Press Release - Panacea Biotec is proud to announce the inclusion of EmulsiPan adjuvant in the CEPI\nAdjuvant Library and its foray into commercialisation of its indigenously developed adjuvants][11]\n[Investor Information][12][News Center][13]\n[**Standalone and Consolidated Audited Financial Results for the quarter and financial year ended\nMarch 31, 2026**][14][View Quarterly Result][15]\n[**CORPORATE PRESENTATION**][16]\nBuilding on the Growth Momentum\n[Download][17]\n[**Annul Report 2024-25**][18][Download][19]\n[Panacea Biotec | Pharma & Biotechnology Company]\nMaking a\nDifference\n\n### Making a Difference\n\nFrom playing a pivotal role in eradication of polio by supplying billions of doses of Oral Polio\nVaccine to launching the World's first fully liquid wP-Pentavalent & wP-IPV based Hexavalent\nvaccines.\nFind opportunities right for you\n[Find a Career][20]\n\n# Panacea Biotec 2.0\n\n**Deadlier Diseases - Smarter solutions - More impact**\nOur mission is even bolder to provide innovative, high quality, affordable and accessible healthcare\nsolutions.\n\n### Live Well -Live Longer\n\nPanacea Biotec believes in giving a chance for better health to live well and live longer\n\n### People\n\nWe cultivate culture and an environment where happy employees go home to joyful parents and\ncherished family members\n\n### Innovation\n\nA way of life in every activity from administration to creating new products and services\n\n### Value\n\nConvert people's unmet needs in to products and services\n\n### Impact\n\nBeing Wise Accountable Responsible in all our actions\n\n### Live Well -Live Longer\n\nPanacea Biotec believes in giving a chance for better health to live well and live longer\n\n### People\n\nWe cultivate culture and an environment where happy employees go home to joyful parents and\ncherished family members\n\n### Innovation\n\nA way of life in every activity from administration to creating new products and services\n\n### Value\n\nConvert people's unmet needs in to products and services\n\n### Impact\n\nBeing Wise Accountable Responsible in all our actions\n\n## Our Purpose\n\nPanacea Biotec believes in nurturing and nourishing Life on the way to better health\n\n> Our Purpose\n> Panacea Biotec believes in nurturing and nourishing Life on the way to better health\n\n# Our Purpose\n\nPanacea Biotec believes in nurturing and nourishing Life on the way to better health\n\n# Be in touch with the latest updates\n# at Panacea Biotec\n\n[Annual Sales Meet 2025][21]\n\nFrom April 7-8th, the vibrant spirit of Panacea Biotec lit up #**Goa** as we gathered for our\n**Annual Sales Meet 2025**.\n\nApril 7, 2025\n[Celebrating the Women Who Inspire Us!][22]\n\nOn March 8th, Panacea Biotec honoured the incredible women leaders who have shaped our journey.\n\nMarch 8, 2025\n[Happy New Year 2025][23]\n\nMay the new year bring you Good Health, Happiness, Success and Prosperity.\n\nJanuary 1, 2025\n[\nNext\n][24]\n\n#### Follow Panacea Biotec :\n* [\n  Follow Panacea Biotec on Facebook\n  ][25]\n* [\n  Follow Panacea Biotec on X\n  ][26]\n* [\n  Connect with Panacea Biotec on LinkedIn\n  ][27]\n* [\n  Watch Panacea Biotec on YouTube\n  ][28]\n* [\n  Home\n  ][29]\n* [\n  About Us\n  ][30]\n* [\n  Products\n  ][31]\n* [\n  Investor Zone\n  ][32]\n* [\n  Report Adverse Event (दवाईओं की सुरक्षा रिपोर्टिंग)\n  ][33]\n* "}}, "page_text": "[About Us][1][Our Products][2][Investor Zone][3][Careers][4][Contact Us][5] English Global [English][6][Germany][7] [Panacea Biotec | Pharma & Biotechnology Company] ### About Us and Our Journey Creating Innovative ways for enhanced customer experience each time every time Panacea Biotec is an Innovation driven company doing Research and Development, Manufacturing, Sales, Distribution and Marketing of Nutrition, Vaccines & Pharmaceuticals. [Read More][8] ### Press Releases June 8, 2026 [Launch of the DENSTAR project: advancing the licensure of a tetravalent live-attenuated dengue vaccine (DengiAll) in sub-Saharan Africa and to facilitate its global access][9] September 25, 2025 [Press Release - Launch of Niko Mom Baby Skin Care][10] June 3, 2025 [Press Release - Panacea Biotec is proud to announce the inclusion of EmulsiPan adjuvant in the CEPI Adjuvant Library and its foray into commercialisation of its indigenously developed adjuvants][11] [Investor Information][12][News Center][13] [**Standalone and Consolidated Audited Financial Results for the quarter and financial year ended March 31, 2026**][14][View Quarterly Result][15] [**CORPORATE PRESENTATION**][16] Building on the Growth Momentum [Download][17] [**Annul Report 2024-25**][18][Download][19] [Panacea Biotec | Pharma & Biotechnology Company] Making a Difference ### Making a Difference From playing a pivotal role in eradication of polio by supplying billions of doses of Oral Polio Vaccine to launching the World's first fully liquid wP-Pentavalent & wP-IPV based Hexavalent vaccines. Find opportunities right for you [Find a Career][20] # Panacea Biotec 2.0 **Deadlier Diseases - Smarter solutions - More impact** Our mission is even bolder to provide innovative, high quality, affordable and accessible healthcare solutions. ### Live Well -Live Longer Panacea Biotec believes in giving a chance for better health to live well and live longer ### People We cultivate culture and an environment where happy employees go home to joyful parents and cherished family members ### Innovation A way of life in every activity from administration to creating new products and services ### Value Convert people's unmet needs in to products and services ### Impact Being Wise Accountable Responsible in all our actions ### Live Well -Live Longer Panacea Biotec believes in giving a chance for better health to live well and live longer ### People We cultivate culture and an environment where happy employees go home to joyful parents and cherished family members ### Innovation A way of life in every activity from administration to creating new products and services ### Value Convert people's unmet needs in to products and services ### Impact Being Wise Accountable Responsible in all our actions ## Our Purpose Panacea Biotec believes in nurturing and nourishing Life on the way to better health > Our Purpose > Panacea Biotec believes in nurturing and nourishing Life on the way to better health # Our Purpose Panacea Biotec believes in nurturing and nourishing Life on the way to better health # Be in touch with the latest updates # at Panacea Biotec [Annual Sales Meet 2025][21] From April 7-8th, the vibrant spirit of Panacea Biotec lit up #**Goa** as we gathered for our **Annual Sales Meet 2025**. April 7, 2025 [Celebrating the Women Who Inspire Us!][22] On March 8th, Panacea Biotec honoured the incredible women leaders who have shaped our journey. March 8, 2025 [Happy New Year 2025][23] May the new year bring you Good Health, Happiness, Success and Prosperity. January 1, 2025 [ Next ][24] #### Follow Panacea Biotec : * [ Follow Panacea Biotec on Facebook ][25] * [ Follow Panacea Biotec on X ][26] * [ Connect with Panacea Biotec on LinkedIn ][27] * [ Watch Panacea Biotec on YouTube ][28] * [ Home ][29] * [ About Us ][30] * [ Products ][31] * [ Investor Zone ][32] * [ Report Adverse Event (दवाईओं की सुरक्षा रिपोर्टिंग) ][33] * [ Contact Us ][34] * [ Privacy Policy ][35] All material provided on the website is for informational purposes only, and is not to be taken as medical advice or recommendation. Any health concern or condition should be addressed by a doctor or other appropriate health care professional. Panacea Biotec Limited | (CIN: L33117PB1984PLC022350) **Regd. Office:** Ambala- Chandigarh Highway, Lalru – 140501, Punjab **Corp. Office:** B-1 Extn./G-3, Mohan Co-operative Industrial Estate, Mathura Road, New Delhi - 110044 © Panacea Biotec - All rights reserved [1]: /en/about [2]: /en/our-products [3]: /en/investor-zone [4]: /en/career [5]: