tories][48] [Podcasts][49] * [Newsroom][50] * [Press Releases][51] [Media Asset Library][52] [Updates and Statements][53] [Partnering News][54] [Media Contacts][55] * [About][56] * [Leadership][57] [Purpose & History][58] [Responsibility][59] * [Responsible Business][60] * [Global Impact][61] * [Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion][62] * [Environmental Sustainability][63] * [Health & Safety][64] * [Global HCP/HCO/PO Transparency Reporting][65] * [Misinformation][66] * [Antimicrobial Resistance][67] [Principles & Positions][68] * [Ethics & Compliance][69] * [Political Partnership][70] * [Prescription Value & Pricing][71] * [Policy Positions][72] * [Ready for Cures][73] [Partnering with Others][74] * [Funding Global Health Through Grants][75] * [Patient Advocacy & Engagement][76] * [Working with Healthcare Professionals][77] * [Research and Business Development Partnerships][78] * [Venture Investments][79] * [Supplier & Business-to-Business Resources][80] * [Pfizer CentreOne][81] [ Investors ][82][ Media ][83][ Careers ][84][ Partners ][85] [ Contact Us ][86] * [Careers][87] * [Investors][88] Search [ Contact Us ][89] Changed Changed How can we help you? **0** search results for Suggestions within Pfizer.com Header close Header close [ Pfizer_LabToLifeManufacturing_HomepageBanner_080626_1440x710_b.jpg ] # The Manufacturing Work That Enables Patient Access Behind every medicine is a global network ensuring quality, scale, and delivery. Discover how Pfizer turns innovation into patient impact worldwide. [Explore the Science of Manufacturing][90] [Photograph of a woman smiling as a child lifts a toy plane toward the sky.] #### Pfizer's 2025 Impact Report Every year, we take stock of the impact our work has on the world, the environment, and people themselves. [Read the report][91] Articles [More articles > ][92] [The Hidden Infrastructure Behind Every Pfizer Medicine][93] [Decoding Tumors: Inside the Spatial Revolution in Cancer Research][94] [Listening to the Hemophilia Community: Pfizer Survey Reveals Unspoken Compromises][95] Press Releases [More press releases > ][96] [Pfizer and Valneva’s Lyme Disease Vaccine Candidate Marketing Authorization Application Validated by European Medicines Agency][97] | 08.14.2026 [Pfizer Reports Second-Quarter Results And Raises Midpoint of 2026 Revenue Guidance][98] | 08.04.2026 [Pfizer Announces Positive Topline Phase 3 Results for LITFULO in Patients with Nonsegmental Vitiligo][99] | 07.30.2026 ### Products Every product is the result of 1,500 scientists overseeing more than 500,000 lab tests and over 36 clinical trials before the first prescription. Product [Browse All Products][100] ### Pfizer RxPathways Pfizer RxPathways connects eligible patients to a range of assistance programs that offer insurance support, co-pay help, and medicines for free or at a savings. [ Explore RxPathways Details][101] Pipeline Snapshot as of August 4, 2026 * [00Phase 1][102] * [00Phase 2][103] * [00Phase 3][104] * [00Registration][105] * [00 Total][106] [Explore the Product Pipeline][107][Download Complete Pipeline PDF][108] [pipeline animated GIF lines loading in 3D] Areas of Focus #### Revolutionary medicines enable us to enrich and extend life for people living with all types of #### diseases. [Internal medicine graphical thumbnail portrait image 2] ##### [ Internal Medicine ][109] [ View All Internal Medicine ][110] We’re developing therapies to treat, slow, or prevent disease progression and improve the quality of life for patients with obesity, type 2 diabetes, and cardiovascular and kidney diseases. [Inflammation and Immunology graphical thumbnail portrait image 3] ##### [ Inflammation & Immunology ][111] [ View All Inflammation & Immunology ][112] We look for treatments that provide more than just symptom relief, in order to address the root cause of chronic inflammatory diseases at a molecular level [Vaccine graphical thumbnail portrait image 4] ##### [ Vaccines ][113] [ View All Vaccines ][114] Vaccines are the single most important innovation in the science of health to significantly reduce the threat of diseases that were once widespread and oftentimes fatal. [Vaccines][115] [Milestones][116] [Pipeline & Clinical Trials ][117] [Oncology graphical thumbnail portrait image 5] ##### [ Oncology ][118] [ View All Oncology ][119] Cancer treatment needs to be transformed across the entire landscape to significantly improve the lives of cancer patients worldwide. [Oncology][120] [Biology into medicine][121] [Advocacy][122] [Global Impact][123] Button previous Button next ## About #### Starting with Charles Pfizer inventing an almond-flavored antiparasite medicine in 1849, our #### people have always been innovators and trailblazers, committed to finding the next cure. [ Learn More About Us Details][124] #### An Accord for a Healthier World Where people live shouldn’t impact the quality of their healthcare and income shouldn’t determine health outcomes. [ Learn More About The Accord Details][125] [Accord for healthier world globe] [Accord for healthier world globe] ### Sign Up for ### **communications from Pfizer** Receive the latest news from Pfizer in our monthly The Breakthrough newsletter and email alerts on a variety of topics. [ Sign up now Details][126] [[Pfizer: One of the world’s premier biopharmaceutical companies]][127] * ###### [ Investors ][128] * ###### [ Media ][129] * ###### [ Careers ][130] * ###### [ Partners ][131] * [ PfizerForAll ][132] * [ Healthcare Professionals ][133] * [ Grant Seekers ][134] * [ Supplier & B2B Resources ][135] * [ Privacy Statement ][136] * [ Accessibility Statement ][137] * [ Terms of Use ][138] * [ Contact Us ][139] Close ### Glossary * © 2026 Pfizer Inc. All rights reserved This information—including product information—is intended only for residents of the United States. The products discussed herein may have different labeling in different countries. * [Twitter][140] * [Facebook][141] * [Linked In][142] * [Instagram][143] * [