ublic Tender Offer][54]\n    * [Analyst Coverage][55]\n  * [Investor Block 3][56]\n    * [Company Announcements][57]\n    * [Regulated information service providers][58]\n    * [Contacts][59]\n* [Sustainability][60]Open menu\n  * [Sustainability Block 1][61]\n    * [Our Commitment][62]\n    * [Sustainability\n      plan][63]\n  * [Sustainability Block 2][64]\n    * [Main ESG Indices & ratings][65]\n    * [Contacts & Documents][66]\n* [People][67]Open menu\n  * [Careers Block 1][68]\n    * [Unlocking Potential][69]\n    * [Join our team][70]\n    * [Supporting education & research][71]\n* [Media][72]\n\n# Unlocking the full\n# potential of life.\n\n[ Learn more ][73]\n\n# Unlocking the full\n# potential of life\n\n[ Learn more ][74]\n\nPlease refer to this page for documents relating to the voluntary tender offer launched by Respighi\nBidCo S.p.A.\n\n[ Public Tender Offer ][75]\n\nRecordati has been at the forefront of life-enhancing & life-changing medicines for 100 years.\n\n**Image:** Founder, Giovanni Recordati\n\n[ Learn More ][76]\n\nRecordati is a global pharmaceutical company, listed on the Italian stock exchange, **with over\n4,700 employees.** We develop and commercialise medicines to serve people living with common\ndiseases, as well as those living with some of the rarest, **in around 150 countries**.\n\n[ Discover Our Operations ][77]\n\nWe are committed to being socially and environmentally responsible throughout all our activities\n\n[ Our Commitment ][78]\n\n#### Share Price\n\n[ Investor Relations ][79]\n\n#### Careers at Recordati\n\n##### We are constantly looking for highly talented individuals to join the Recordati family.\n\n[ View Opportunities ][80]\n[ ][81]\n* [Alert Services][82]\n* [Safety Reporting][83]\n* [Privacy Policy][84]\n* [Privacy Policy: HCP][85]\n* [Cookie Policy][86]\n* [Legal Notice][87]\n\nRECORDATI INDUSTRIA CHIMICA E FARMACEUTICA S.p.A.\nVIA MATTEO CIVITALI, 1 – 20148 MILAN, ITALY\nSHARE CAPITAL € 26.140.644,50 I.V.\nREG. IM