an-Assessed Flare-ups in a Placebo-controlled #### Trial in Adults with Fibrodysplasia Ossificans Progressiva (FOP) [ Read more ][89] Jul 31 #### Regeneron Awards $150,000 to Winners of the 2026 Regeneron Prize for Creative Innovation [ Read more ][90] [ Visit our newsroom ][91] ## Our stories [ See all stories ][92] ## Creating a ## Healthier World Learn about what’s next for responsibility at Regeneron [ Learn more ][93] ## Fueling the Future ## of Science A second decade of the Regeneron Science Talent Search [ Learn more ][94] ## Reducing COPD’s ## Global Impact on Lung Health See why lung health belongs at the center of the healthy aging conversation [ Learn more ][95] ## The Power of Proof ## in Modern Science Connor Hill, top winner of Regeneron Science Talent Search 2026, shows how math thinking helps solve complex scientific challenges [ Read the story ][96] ## The Regeneron Scientific Journey A deep understanding of human biology guides our path to potential medicines [ Learn more ][97] [ See all stories ][98] From biologics to genetic medicines, our journey turns **cutting-edge science into transformative medicine,** redefining excellence and efficiency in research and development. [ OUR MEDICINES ][99] [ OUR COMPANY ][100] [ OUR PIPELINE ][101] We're guided by our philosophy of ## doing well by doing good We’re dedicated to responsible business practices, integrating the highest standards of integrity into every facet of our operations. Our responsibility strategy addresses the issues that matter most to our business and our stakeholders — because we understand that our actions have a profound impact on the world around us. [ Learn about our approach to corporate responsibility ][102] ## Careers at Regeneron Join the brightest, most passionate innovators in science. Find your next opportunity by applying for jobs and internships at Regeneron today. [ Join our team ][103] ## Our clinical trials Our journey of discovery continues as we strive to transform 