ap [123]: # [124]: [125]: [126]:", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Regeneron Pharmaceuticals — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Regeneron markets biologic drugs like Eylea and Dupixent, owning and marketing branded biologics. | Regeneron markets biologic drugs like Eylea and Dupixent, major biologics. | United States | County, New, York", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "79", "Y Score": "66", "Overall Score": "72", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Reliance Life Sciences", "Website": "https://www.rellife.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Mumbai, India, Its", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(India)", "Operational Presence": "India", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops and markets biosimilars for global markets, including filgrastim, rituximab, and trastuzumab.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Reliance Life Sciences — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Reliance Life Sciences develops and markets biosimilars, clearly owning and marketing products in this market.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "rellife.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "rellife.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "# Navigation\n* [Skip to Content][1]\n\n[ [Reliance Life Sciences] ][2]\nTogglenavigation\n* [ Home][3]\n* About Us\n  * * [Overview][4]\n    * [Infrastructure][5]\n    * [Policies][6]\n    * [Accreditation][7]\n* Businesses\n  * * [Plasma Proteins][8]\n    * [Biosimilars][9]\n    * [Pharmaceuticals][10]\n    * [Clinical Research Services][11]\n    * [Regenerative Medicine][12]\n    * [Cord Blood Repository][13]\n    * [Diagnostics][14]\n* [ Careers][15]\n* [ Contact Us][16]\n* ## Search\n  \n  [ ][17]\n\n# Clinical Research Services, Regenerative Medicine, Specialty Pharmaceuticals | Reliance Life\n# Sciences - LifeSciences\n\n## Home Slider WebContent\n\nWelcome to Reliance Life Sciences\nBuilding a global, integrated biopharmaceutical business\nBuilding an India-based global specialty pharmaceuticals business\nOffering a complete range of services for clinical development of molecules\nDeveloping a wide range of novel cell therapies to bring about an era of Regenerative Medicine\nInvolved in high-end DNA based diagnostic testing and research in Molecular Medicine\nWe don't just deliver test reports, we deliver SMART Diagnostics.\n\n## Scroll-WC\n\nReliance Life Sciences is a testing centre for Covid-19. To know more [click here][18].\n\n#### **Covid-19 Testing**\n\n×\n\nReliance Life Sciences is one of the first few private organizations to be approved by Indian\nCouncil of Medical Research (ICMR) for Covid-19 testing.\n\nReliance Life Sciences performs Covid-19 testing using Real Time Reverse Transcription - Polymerase\nChain Reaction (RT- PCR), based on detection of unique sequences of viral RNA in nasopharyngeal or\noropharyngeal samples. As recommended by ICMR, individuals identified by clinical symptoms, contact\ntracing or epidemiological history, are tested, based on doctor’s prescription.\n\nReliance Life Sciences tests samples received from hospitals and collection centres. A 100%\nconcordance in inter-laboratory validation of test results with approved laboratories such as\nKasturba Hospital, Mumbai, reinforces the high quality testing standards.\n\nAs the nation battles the pandemic, Reliance Life Sciences is committed to offer diagnostic support,\nleveraging on the strength of its state-of-the-art infrastructure and round-the-clock service\nprovided by its trained professionals in delivering accurate test results within the specified\nturnaround time.\n\n## Main Footer Web Content\n\n[Media][19]  |  [Publications][20]  |  [Adverse Drug Event Reporting][21]  |  [Statutory\nInformation][22]\n\nGroup Sites :   [RIL][23]  |  [Reliance Inst. of Life Sciences][24]\n\n© 2024 Reliance Life Sciences. All Rights Reserved.\n* [Legal Notice][25]\n* |\n* [Privacy Policy][26]\n* |\n* [Disclaimer][27]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences\n[3]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/home\n[4]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/overview\n[5]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/infrastructure\n[6]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/policies\n[7]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/accreditation\n[8]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/plasma-proteins\n[9]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/biosimilars\n[10]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/pharmaceuticals\n[11]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/clinical-research-services\n[12]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/regenerative-medicine\n[13]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/cord-blood-repository\n[14]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/diagnostics\n[15]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/careers\n[16]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/contact-us\n[17]: javascript:;\n[18]: #\n[19]: /web/lifesciences/media\n[20]: /web/lifesciences/publications\n[21]: /web/lifesciences/adversedrugreaction\n[22]: /web/lifesciences/statutory-information\n[23]: http://www.ril.com/\n[24]: http://www.rils.ac.in\n[25]: /web/lifesciences/legalnotice\n[26]: /web/lifesciences/privacy-policy\n[27]: /web/lifesciences/disclaimer"}}, "page_text": "# Navigation * [Skip to Content][1] [ [Reliance Life Sciences] ][2] Togglenavigation * [ Home][3] * About Us * * [Overview][4] * [Infrastructure][5] * [Policies][6] * [Accreditation][7] * Businesses * * [Plasma Proteins][8] * [Biosimilars][9] * [Pharmaceuticals][10] * [Clinical Research Services][11] * [Regenerative Medicine][12] * [Cord Blood Repository][13] * [Diagnostics][14] * [ Careers][15] * [ Contact Us][16] * ## Search [ ][17] # Clinical Research Services, Regenerative Medicine, Specialty Pharmaceuticals | Reliance Life # Sciences - LifeSciences ## Home Slider WebContent Welcome to Reliance Life Sciences Building a global, integrated biopharmaceutical business Building an India-based global specialty pharmaceuticals business Offering a complete range of services for clinical development of molecules Developing a wide range of novel cell therapies to bring about an era of Regenerative Medicine Involved in high-end DNA based diagnostic testing and research in Molecular Medicine We don't just deliver test reports, we deliver SMART Diagnostics. ## Scroll-WC Reliance Life Sciences is a testing centre for Covid-19. To know more [click here][18]. #### **Covid-19 Testing** × Reliance Life Sciences is one of the first few private organizations to be approved by Indian Council of Medical Research (ICMR) for Covid-19 testing. Reliance Life Sciences performs Covid-19 testing using Real Time Reverse Transcription - Polymerase Chain Reaction (RT- PCR), based on detection of unique sequences of viral RNA in nasopharyngeal or oropharyngeal samples. As recommended by ICMR, individuals identified by clinical symptoms, contact tracing or epidemiological history, are tested, based on doctor’s prescription. Reliance Life Sciences tests samples received from hospitals and collection centres. A 100% concordance in inter-laboratory validation of test results with approved laboratories such as Kasturba Hospital, Mumbai, reinforces the high quality testing standards. As the nation battles the pandemic, Reliance Life Sciences is committed to offer diagnostic support, leveraging on the strength of its state-of-the-art infrastructure and round-the-clock service provided by its trained professionals in delivering accurate test results within the specified turnaround time. ## Main Footer Web Content [Media][19] | [Publications][20] | [Adverse Drug Event Reporting][21] | [Statutory Information][22] Group Sites : [RIL][23] | [Reliance Inst. of Life Sciences][24] © 2024 Reliance Life Sciences. All Rights Reserved. * [Legal Notice][25] * | * [Privacy Policy][26] * | * [Disclaimer][27] [1]: #main-content [2]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences [3]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/home [4]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/overview [5]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/infrastructure [6]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/policies [7]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/accreditation [8]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/plasma-proteins [9]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/biosimilars [10]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/pharmaceuticals [11]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/clinical-research-services [12]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/regenerative-medicine [13]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/cord-blood-repository [14]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/diagnostics [15]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/careers [16]: https://rellife.com/web/lifesciences/contact-us [17]: javascript:; [18]: # [19]: /web/lifesciences/media [20]: /web/lifesciences/publications [21]: /web/lifesciences/adversedrugreaction [22]: /web/lifesciences/statutory-information [23]: http://www.ril.com/ [24]: http://www.rils.ac.in [25]: /web/lifesciences/legalnotice [26]: /web/lifesciences/privacy-policy [27]: /web/lifesciences/disclaimer", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Reliance Life Sciences — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Reliance Life Sciences develops and markets biosimilars, clearly owning and marketing products in this market. | Develops and markets biosimilars for global markets, including filgrastim, rituximab, and trastuzumab. | India | Mumbai, India, Its", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X S