information][86]\n  * [Download center][87]\n  * [Frequently asked questions][88]\n* Media\n  * [Media][89]\n  * [Media releases][90]\n  * [Media events][91]\n  * [Media statements][92]\n  * [Media library][93]\n* [Stories][94]\n* [Careers][95]\n* [Contact][96]\n\nWorldwide\n\n## Doing now what patients need next\n\nPioneering diagnostics and pharma to create a healthier future for everyone\n\n[\nRead our story\n][97]\n[\nAbout Roche\n][98]\n[A family gathers around an outdoor table, enjoying a meal. A man hugs a smiling boy, while two\nwomen sit nearby, all appearing content and joyful.]\n\n## In the spotlight\n\n[Roche publishes its half year results for 2026][99]\n\nRoche reports +6% (CER) sales growth in the first six months of 2026. Commenting on the results, CEO\nThomas Schinecker said: “Our strong momentum continued in the first half of the year, driven by a 6%\nsales increase at constant exchange rates and significant positive pipeline development.”\n\n[Inside Roche R&D: From bold questions to breakthroughs][100]\n\nDiscover how Roche scientists combine biology, data, and AI to push past today's limits and\ntransform new discoveries into life-changing medicines.\n\n[\nVisit Media center\n][101]\n\n> Our two divisions are focusing jointly on three disease areas that will account for almost 50% of\n> the global disease burden by 2035: cancer, cardiovascular-metabolic diseases and neurological\n> diseases.\n\n[Portrait of Thomas "}}, "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] [][2] * [Stories][3] * [Careers][4] * [Contact][5] [][6] [][7] * About Roche * [About Roche][8] * Business * Governance * Sustainability * [Roche Global Citizenship][9] * [Strategy][10] * [Leadership][11] * [History][12] * Solutions * [Solutions][13] * Focus areas * Pharma solutions * Diagnostic solutions * [Product Development Pipeline][14] * Innovation * [Innovation][15] * Partnering * Ethical standards * Team and structure * [Innovation process][16] * [Clinical trials][17] * Investors * [Investors][18] * [Investor updates][19] * [Investor events][20] * [Reporting][21] * [Finance Information Tool][22] * [Share and Bond information][23] * [Download center][24] * [Frequently asked questions][25] * Media * [Media][26] * [Media releases][27] * [Media events][28] * [Media statements][29] * [Media library][30] * About Roche * [About Roche][31] * Business * [Business][32] * [Diagnostics][33] * [Pharma][34] * Governance * [Governance][35] * [Annual general meetings][36] * [Board of directors][37] * [Committees][38] * [Executive committee][39] * [Code of conduct][40] * Sustainability * [Sustainability][41] * [Approach][42] * [Goals and performance][43] * [ESG index][44] * [Safety health and wellbeing][45] * [Roche Global Citizenship][46] * [Strategy][47] * [Leadership][48] * [History][49] * Solutions * [Solutions][50] * Focus areas * [Focus areas][51] * [Cardiometabolic][52] * [Haematology][53] * [Diabetes][54] * [Immunology][55] * [Infectious diseases][56] * [Inflammatory bowel diseases][57] * [Neurology][58] * [Oncology][59] * [Ophthalmology][60] * [Respiratory][61] * [Women's health][62] * Pharma solutions * [Pharma solutions][63] * [Safety reporting][64] * Diagnostic solutions * [Diagnostic solutions][65] * [Safety officers][66] * [Product Development Pipeline][67] * Innovation * [Innovation][68] * Partnering * [Partnering][69] * [Pharma][70] * [Diagnostics][71] * [Areas of interest][72] * Ethical standards * [Ethical standards][73] * [Advisory][74] * [Animal research][75] * [Genetics][76] * Team and structure * [Team and structure][77] * [R&D locations][78] * [Innovation process][79] * [Clinical trials][80] * Investors * [Investors][81] * [Investor updates][82] * [Investor events][83] * [Reporting][84] * [Finance Information Tool][85] * [Share and Bond information][86] * [Download center][87] * [Frequently asked questions][88] * Media * [Media][89] * [Media releases][90] * [Media events][91] * [Media statements][92] * [Media library][93] * [Stories][94] * [Careers][95] * [Contact][96] Worldwide ## Doing now what patients need next Pioneering diagnostics and pharma to create a healthier future for everyone [ Read our story ][97] [ About Roche ][98] [A family gathers around an outdoor table, enjoying a meal. A man hugs a smiling boy, while two women sit nearby, all appearing content and joyful.] ## In the spotlight [Roche publishes its half year results for 2026][99] Roche reports +6% (CER) sales growth in the first six months of 2026. Commenting on the results, CEO Thomas Schinecker said: “Our strong momentum continued in the first half of the year, driven by a 6% sales increase at constant exchange rates and significant positive pipeline development.” [Inside Roche R&D: From bold questions to breakthroughs][100] Discover how Roche scientists combine biology, data, and AI to push past today's limits and transform new discoveries into life-changing medicines. [ Visit Media center ][101] > Our two divisions are focusing jointly on three disease areas that will account for almost 50% of > the global disease burden by 2035: cancer, cardiovascular-metabolic diseases and neurological > diseases. [Portrait of Thomas Schinecker] Dr Thomas Schinecker CEO Roche Group ## Investor information [ Visit Investor center ][102] Sales by HY 2026 ### [CHF 30.4 billion][103] Finance Information Tool Dividend Yield for FY 2025 ### [3.2%][104] Share and Bond Information Next Report ### [22 October 2026][105] Reporting ## We are Roche We combine life-changing diagnostics and medicines to take on the toughest healthcare challenges, those that place the greatest strain on patients, families, communities, and health systems. Guided by the experiences of patients, we are determined to prevent, stop and cure diseases so people can live healthier, longer lives. [Man holding a surfing board, wearing a helmet on a beach] ## Our mission in action * [Two colleagues sit on a green couch in a modern office, engaged in conversation. One person gestures while speaking, and the other listens attentively with a slight smile.] Prevent ### [Identifying high-risk patients][106] We prevent diseases by identifying high-risk patients early to enable timely use of medicines. Our strategy * [A laboratory scientist wearing safety glasses and gloves looks into a microscope while conducting research in a lab setting.] Stop ### [Halting disease progression][107] We stop disease progression by accurately diagnosing patients and delivering targeted medicines. Our diagnostics solutions * [A laboratory professional wearing glasses and gloves explains a piece of equipment to a colleague while holding its open lid in a lab setting.] Cure ### [Restoring health through medicines][108] We cure diseases by identifying the cause of a patient’s condition and restoring health through curative medicines. Our pharma solutions ## Read our stories [ View all stories ][109] [A person faces a landscape of blue mountains, with a large eye symbol above, conveying vision and insight. The sky is clear with a small cloud.] ### Our holistic ophthalmology vision: From prevention to vision restoration How AI and Real-World Data are unlocking innovation to address high-burden eye diseases at scale [ Read the story ][110] [Decorative Illustration] ### [Transforming autoimmune treatment: How data-driven therapies are changing patient ### outcomes][111] Three diseases. One mission. Roche combines breakthrough technologies with deep immunology expertise and real-world data to transform treatment for lupus, IBD, and COPD [Decorative illustration] ### [Haemophilia treatment for all: A partnership for better access][112] The Humanitarian Aid Program, a landmark initiative led by the World Federation of Hemophilia (WFH) and supported by partners including Roche, is working to ensure that people with bleeding disorders in developing countries can access the diagnosis, treatment and care they need. ## Shape the future of healthcare Join our global team of innovators, scientists, and changemakers [ Explore Careers ][113] [ Inclusion and Belonging at Roche ][114] [A gloved hand holds a petri dish with gold-colored bacterial colonies on a reddish-brown medium, suggesting a laboratory experiment.] ### [About Roche][115] We unite leading science and technology across diagnostics, medicines, and digital solutions to prevent, stop and cure diseases. [Abstract close-up of geometric shapes with vibrant pink and orange hues. A pattern of glowing circles creates an energetic and modern feel.] ### [Solutions][116] We are committed to tackling the most complex healthcare challenges that place the greatest strain on people and societies worldwide. [3D Insights into Novel Cancer Models.] ### [Innovation][117] In everything we do, we are guided by the needs of patients and their loved ones, acting with integrity, courage and passion. [Close-up of a microplate with multiple wells, each being filled by thin metallic pipettes. The setting is a laboratory environment, conveying precision.] ### [Media][118] Access a wide range of materials relating to our company, our people, innovation, solutions and diagnostics tools or get in touch with us. [Modern indoor space with large windows, wooden walls, and hanging lights. Curved planter with lush green ferns and plants creates a refreshing atmosphere.] ### [Investors][119] We are committed to delivering value for all our stakeholders through continuous innovation, groundbreaking solutions, trust and sustainable business practices. * [Contact][120] * [Locations][121] ### Helpful links * [Pharma solutions][122] * [Upcoming events][123] * [Annual Report 2025][124] * [Report a potential side effect][125] ### Roche websites * [Diagnostics portal][126] * [Suppliers information][127] * [Roche around the world][128] * [Patients and clinical trials platform][129] * [ linkedin][130] * [ facebook][131] * [ twitter][132] * [ instagram][133] * [ youtube][134] * [Privacy notice][135] * [Legal statement][136] * [Accessibility statement][137] * [Social Media guidelines][138] * Cookies © F. Hoffmann-La Roche Ltd This website contains information on products which is targeted to a wide range of audiences and could contain product details or information otherwise not accessible or valid in your country. Please be aware that we do not take any responsibility for accessing such information which may not comply with any legal process, regulation, registration or usage in the country of your origin. [1]: #main-content [2]: / [3]: /stories [4]: https://careers.roche.com [5]: /contact [6]: /search [7]: /search [8]: /about [9]: /about/roche-global-citizenship [10]: /about/strategy [11]: /about/leadership [12]: /about/history [13]: /solutions [14]: /solutions/pipeline [15]: /innovation [16]: /innovation/process [17]: /innovation/clinical-trials [18]: /investors [19]: /investors/updates [20]: /investors/events [21]: /investors/reports [22]: /investors/rofis [23]: /investors/bonds [24]: /investors/downloads [25]: /investors/faq_investors [26]: /media [27]: /media/releases [28]: /media/events [29]: /media/statements [30]: /media/library-images [31]: /about [32]: /about/business [33]: /about/business/diagnostics [34]: /about/business/pharmaceuticals [35]: /about/governance [36]: /about/governance/annual-general-meetings [37]: /about/governance/board-of-directors [38]: /about/governance/committees [39]: /about/governance/executive-committee [40]: /about/governance/code-of-conduct [41]: /about/sustainability [42]: /about/sustainability/approach [43]: /about/sustainability/goals-performance [44]: /about/sustainability/esg-index [45]: /about/sustainability/safety-health-and-well-being [46]: /about/roche-global-citizenship [47]: /about/strategy [48]: /about/leadership [49]: /about/history [50]: /solutions [51]: /solutions/focus-areas [52]: /solutions/focus-areas/cardiometabolic [53]: /solutions/focus-areas/haematology [54]: /solutions/focus-areas/diabetes [55]: /solutions/focus-areas/immunology [56]: /solutions/focus-areas/infectious-diseases [57]: /solutions/focus-areas/inflammatory-bowel-diseases [58]: /solutions/focus-areas/neurology [59]: /solutions/focus-areas/oncology [60]: /solutions/focus-areas/ophthalmology [61]: /solutions/focus-areas/respiratory [62]: /solutions/focus-areas/womens-health [63]: /solutions/pharma [64]: /solutions/pharma/safety-reporting [65]: /solutions/diagnostics [66]: /solutions/diagnostics/safety-officers [67]: /solutions/pipeline [68]: /innovation [69]: /innovation/partnering [70]: /innovation/partnering/pharma [71]: /innovation/partnering/diagnostics [72]: /innovation/partnering/areas-of-interest [73]: /innovation/ethical-standards [74]: /innovation/ethical-standards/advisory [75]: /innovation/ethical-standards/animal-research [76]: /innovation/ethical-standards/genetics [77]: /innovation/structure [78]: /innovation/structure/rnd-locations [79]: /innovation/process [80]: /innovation/clinical-trials [81]: /investors [82]: /investors/updates [83]: /investors/events [84]: /investors/reports [85]: /investors/rofis [", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Roche — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Roche is a leading global biotech company that develops and markets biologics and biosimilars. | Leading global biotech company with major biologic portfolio and biosimilar development | Switzerland | Basel, Switzerland", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "85", "Y Score": "81", "Overall Score": "83", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Roche Brasil", "Website": "https://www.roche.com.br", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "São Paulo, Brazil", "Continent / Geography": "LATAM(Brazil)", "Operational Presence": "Brazil", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Roche Brasil is a subsidiary of Roche, a global leader in biotechnology, marketing innovative biologics in Brazil.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Marketer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "BR", "Region Code": "LATAM", "Summary": "Roche Brasil — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Subsidiary of Roche, a global leader in biotechnology, marketing innovative biologics in Brazil; owns and markets products.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "roche.com.br", "data": {"company": {"name": "roche.com.br"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[][2]\n* [Imprensa][3]\n* [Carreiras][4]\n[][5][][6]\n[][7][][8]\n* Sobre\n  * [Sobre][9]\n  * [Roche no Mundo][10]\n  * [Nossos negócios][11]\n  * [Princípios corporativos][12]\n  * [Sustentabilidade][13]\n  * [Prêmios e reconhecimentos][14]\n  * [Compliance no Grupo Roche][15]\n* Soluções\n  * [Soluções][16]\n  * [Farmacêutica][17]\n  * [Diabetes][18]\n  * [Diagnóstica][19]\n  * [Áreas Terapêuticas][20]\n* Inovação\n  * [Inovação][21]\n  * [Pesquisa Clínica][22]\n* [Por dentro da Roche][23]\n* Sobre\n  * [Sobre][24]\n  * [Roche no Mundo][25]\n  * [Nossos negócios][26]\n  * [Princípios corporativos][27]\n  * [Sustentabilidade][28]\n  * [Prêmios e reconhecimentos][29]\n  * [Compliance no Grupo Roche][30]\n* Soluções\n  * [Soluções][31]\n  * [Farmacêutica][32]\n  * [Diabetes][33]\n  * [Diagnóstica][34]\n  * [Áreas Terapêuticas][35]\n* Inovação\n  * [Inovação][36]\n  * [Pesquisa Clínica][37]\n* [Por dentro da Roche][38]\n* [Imprensa][39]\n* [Carreiras][40]\n\nglobal\n\n# Doing now what patients need next.\n\n## Revolucionando a medicina personalizada\n\nTrazemos os tratamentos certos para os pacientes certos, na hora certa. Com nossas forças combinadas\nem farmacêutica e diagnóstica, somos muito equipados para levar a medicina personalizada mais longe.\n\n[\nMais sobre medicina personalizada\n][41]\n\n## Entregando valor e sustentabilidade\n\nNossa ambição não é apenas transformar o cuidado com a saúde por meio de soluções inovadores, mas,\ntambém contribuir para proteção ambiental, sustentabilidade na cadeia de suprimentos e compromisso\nsocial.\n\n[\nMais sobre sustentabilidade\n][42]\n\n## Sobre a Roche\n\nNosso foco é encontrar novos medicamentos e diagnósticos utilizando conhecimentos baseados em dados,\npara evoluir a prática da medicina e ajudar os pacientes a viver mais e melhor.\n\n[\nSaiba mais\n][43]\n\n## Soluções\n\nDesde a fundação de nossa empresa, temos desenvolvido medicamentos, tratamentos e diagnósticos\ninovadores, que continuam revolucionando a saúde. \n\n[\nSaiba mais\n][44]\n\n## #NaoUsouDescartou\n\nUse nossa ferramenta digital e encontre o ponto de descarte de medicamentos mais próximo de você!\nEssa é uma iniciativa do Grupo Mulheres do Brasil e Ciência na Saúde, que conta com o apoio da Roche\nBrasil e da eCycle.\n\n[\nAcesse agora\n][45]\n\n## Saúde para todos\n\nJunte-se a nós e saiba como você pode fazer a diferença e contribuir para um sistema de saúde mais\njusto e igualitário.\n\n[\nAcesse agora\n][46]\n\n## Esclarecimento sobre o medicamento Rivotril®\n\nA Roche esclarece que o medicamento Rivotril® (clonazepam) não integra o portfólio de produtos da\nRoche no Brasil desde Julho de 2021.\n\n[\nAcesse agora\n][47]\n\n## Comunicado Herceptin® (trastuzumabe) 150 mg\n\nProdutos Roche Químicos e Farmacêuticos S.A. informa que foi submetida a notificação da\nDescontinuação Definitiva de Importação do medicamento Herceptin® (trastuzumabe) na apresentação de\n150 mg intravenosa, no dia 10/02/2026, devido a ausência de demanda para o medicamento no mercado\nbrasileiro.\n\n[\nAcesse agora\n][48]\n\n## Comunicado Cellcept® (micofenolato de mofetila)\n\nInformamos que foi submetida a notificação da Descontinuação Definitiva de Importação do medicamento\nCellcept®.\n\n[\nAcesse agora\n][49]\n\n## Descubra histórias incríveis sobre\n## CiênciaParceriasCulturaComunidadesPacientes\n* ### [Agosto Lilás: Como reconhecer a violência contra a mulher e os impactos na saúde ][50]\n  \n  Neste Agosto Lilás, aprenda a reconhecer os sinais da violência contra a mulher, entenda seus\n  impactos na saúde e saiba como buscar ajuda.\n  \n  19 Agosto, 2026\n* ### [Um olhar sobre a AME tipo III no Brasil][51]\n  \n  Confira a nova pesquisa realizada pela Veja Saúde, com o apoio da Roche e do INAME (Instituto\n  Nacional de Atrofia Muscular Espinhal)\n  \n  12 Agosto, 2025\n* ### [Dados de vida real em saúde na América Latina: ensaios e percepções][52]\n  \n  Iniciativa RWD Latam Initiative, da Roche Farma, lança e-book com informações aprofundadas sobre\n  diretrizes, uso de wearables e aplicação na prática clínica dos dados em saúde na vida real\n"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] [][2] * [Imprensa][3] * [Carreiras][4] [][5][][6] [][7][][8] * Sobre * [Sobre][9] * [Roche no Mundo][10] * [Nossos negócios][11] * [Princípios corporativos][12] * [Sustentabilidade][13] * [Prêmios e reconhecimentos][14] * [Compliance no Grupo Roche][15] * Soluções * [Soluções][16] * [Farmacêutica][17] * [Diabetes][18] * [Diagnóstica][19] * [Áreas Terapêuticas][20] * Inovação * [Inovação][21] * [Pesquisa Clínica][22] * [Por dentro da Roche][23] * Sobre * [Sobre][24] * [Roche no Mundo][25] * [Nossos negócios][26] * [Princípios corporativos][27] * [Sustentabilidade][28] * [Prêmios e reconhecimentos][29] * [Compliance no Grupo Roche][30] * Soluções * [Soluções][31] * [Farmacêutica][32] * [Diabetes][33] * [Diagnóstica][34] * [Áreas Terapêuticas][35] * Inovação * [Inovação][36] * [Pesquisa Clínica][37] * [Por dentro da Roche][38] * [Imprensa][39] * [Carreiras][40] global # Doing now what patients need next. ## Revolucionando a medicina personalizada Trazemos os tratamentos certos para os pacientes certos, na hora certa. Com nossas forças combinadas em farmacêutica e diagnóstica, somos muito equipados para levar a medicina personalizada mais longe. [ Mais sobre medicina personalizada ][41] ## Entregando valor e sustentabilidade Nossa ambição não é apenas transformar o cuidado com a saúde por meio de soluções inovadores, mas, também contribuir para proteção ambiental, sustentabilidade na cadeia de suprimentos e compromisso social. [ Mais sobre sustentabilidade ][42] ## Sobre a Roche Nosso foco é encontrar novos medicamentos e diagnósticos utilizando conhecimentos baseados em dados, para evoluir a prática da medicina e ajudar os pacientes a viver mais e melhor. [ Saiba mais ][43] ## Soluções Desde a fundação de nossa empresa, temos desenvolvido medicamentos, tratamentos e diagnósticos inovadores, que continuam revolucionando a saúde. [ Saiba mais ][44] ## #NaoUsouDescartou Use nossa ferramenta digital e encontre o ponto de descarte de medicamentos mais próximo de você! Essa é uma iniciativa do Grupo Mulheres do Brasil e Ciência na Saúde, que conta com o apoio da Roche Brasil e da eCycle. [ Acesse agora ][45] ## Saúde para todos Junte-se a nós e saiba como você pode fazer a diferença e contribuir para um sistema de saúde mais justo e igualitário. [ Acesse agora ][46] ## Esclarecimento sobre o medicamento Rivotril® A Roche esclarece que o medicamento Rivotril® (clonazepam) não integra o portfólio de produtos da Roche no Brasil desde Julho de 2021. [ Acesse agora ][47] ## Comunicado Herceptin® (trastuzumabe) 150 mg Produtos Roche Químicos e Farmacêuticos S.A. informa que foi submetida a notificação da Descontinuação Definitiva de Importação do medicamento Herceptin® (trastuzumabe) na apresentação de 150 mg intravenosa, no dia 10/02/2026, devido a ausência de demanda para o medicamento no mercado brasileiro. [ Acesse agora ][48] ## Comunicado Cellcept® (micofenolato de mofetila) Informamos que foi submetida a notificação da Descontinuação Definitiva de Importação do medicamento Cellcept®. [ Acesse agora ][49] ## Descubra histórias incríveis sobre ## CiênciaParceriasCulturaComunidadesPacientes * ### [Agosto Lilás: Como reconhecer a violência contra a mulher e os impactos na saúde ][50] Neste Agosto Lilás, aprenda a reconhecer os sinais da violência contra a mulher, entenda seus impactos na saúde e saiba como buscar ajuda. 19 Agosto, 2026 * ### [Um olhar sobre a AME tipo III no Brasil][51] Confira a nova pesquisa realizada pela Veja Saúde, com o apoio da Roche e do INAME (Instituto Nacional de Atrofia Muscular Espinhal) 12 Agosto, 2025 * ### [Dados de vida real em saúde na América Latina: ensaios e percepções][52] Iniciativa RWD Latam Initiative, da Roche Farma, lança e-book com informações aprofundadas sobre diretrizes, uso de wearables e aplicação na prática clínica dos dados em saúde na vida real 11 Agosto, 2023 Mostrar mais ## Para profissionais * ### [Imprensa][53] Conheça as últimas notícias, anúncios e comunicados da Roche e entre em contato com nossa assessoria de imprensa. * [Contato][54] * [Localização][55] ### Links úteis * [Perguntas frequentes][56] * [Medicamentos][57] * [Carreiras][58] * [Facebook][59] * [Instagram][60] * [YouTube][61] * [Política de Privacidade][62] * Preferências de Cookies * [Declaração de Acessibilidade da Roche][63] * [Declaração legal][64] * [Diretrizes da Comunidade para Redes Sociais][65] © Produtos Roche Químicos e Farmacêuticos S.A. Todos os direitos reservados. Proibida a reprodução sem autorização. Os programas deste Portal não condicionam a prescrição, recomendação ou comercialização de produtos Roche, preservando a independência profissional. Conteúdo exclusivo para usuários no Brasil. A Roche não se responsabiliza por acessos que violem as normas do país de origem do visitante. [1]: #main-content [2]: / [3]: /imprensa [4]: https://careers.roche.com/pt/pt [5]: https://www.roche.com/worldwide#americas [6]: /global-components/search [7]: https://www.roche.com/worldwi