Y Score": "74", "Overall Score": "74", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Roche South Africa", "Website": "https://www.roche.co.za", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Midrand, South Africa", "Continent / Geography": "AF(South Africa)", "Operational Presence": "South Africa", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Roche has a strong presence in Africa, marketing biologic therapies for oncology and other diseases.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Marketer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "ZA", "Region Code": "AF", "Summary": "Roche South Africa — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Roche markets biologic therapies in Africa through its subsidiary.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "roche.co.za", "data": {"company": {"name": "roche.co.za"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[][2]\n* [Media][3]\n* [Careers][4]\n[][5][][6]\n[][7][][8]\n* About Roche\n  * [About Roche][9]\n  * [Sustainability][10]\n  * [Leadership][11]\n  * [History][12]\n  * [Personalised healthcare][13]\n* Solutions\n  * [Solutions][14]\n  * [Focus areas][15]\n* [Stories][16]\n* About Roche\n  * [About Roche][17]\n  * [Sustainability][18]\n  * [Leadership][19]\n  * [History][20]\n  * [Personalised healthcare][21]\n* Solutions\n  * [Solutions][22]\n  * [Focus areas][23]\n* [Stories][24]\n* [Media][25]\n* [Careers][26]\n\nWorldwide\n\n# Welcome to Roche South Africa\n\n## About Roche\n\nWe focus on finding new medicines and diagnostics and utilising data-based insights to evolve the\npractice of medicine and help patients live longer, better lives.\n\n[\nRead more\n][27]\n\n## Solutions\n\nSince the founding of our company, we have been developing innovative medicines, treatments and\ndiagnostics that continue to revolutionise healthcare.\n\n[\nRead more\n][28]\n\n## Discover\n## Roche South Africa\n\n### Breast Cancer #Every30Days - Breast Self-Exam\n\nThe better you know your breasts, the better you’re able to spot changes. By being comfortable with\nyour body and checking your breasts every month, you can catch the and symptoms of breast cancer\nearly.\n\n[\nRead the story\n][29]\n[A diverse group of eleven professionals stands in a line indoors, smiling and posing for a photo\nwhile holding a Roche-branded cardboard box.]\n\n### [Investing in the Future: The Roche Registrar Event at NASA][30]\n\nRead how Roche supported South Africa's next generation of medical specialists with practical\nclinical guidance at the NASA Registrar Event.\n\n12 August 2026\n[Two professionals in business attire proudly holding a trophy, celebrating their achievement\ntogether.]\n\n### [Roche | Partnerships scaling clinical research in South Africa][31]\n\nRoche South Africa honours Professor Johnny Mahlangu for his pioneering work in clinical\nhaematology. Discover how this partnership drives clinical research and improves patient outcomes\nacross the African continent\n\n04 August 2026\n[A group photo of the Roche Products and Unjani Alliance Clinic teams]\n\n### [Women at the heart of community healthcare][32]\n\nDiscover how Sister Portia Shezi and Unjani Clinic are bringing quality primary healthcare and early\ncancer detection to Benoni working families through key partnerships.\n\n30 July 2026\n[\nExplore more stories\n][33]\n\n## For professionals\n\n### [Press Releases South Africa][34]\n\nStay up-to-date with Roche's latest news, events and announcements.\n\n### [Careers][35]\n\nFind jobs and learn more about exciting career opportunities at Roche, one of the world's leading\nresearch-based healthcare companies.\n* [Contact][36]\n* [Locations][37]\n\n### Helpful links\n* [About Roche][38]\n* [Personalised healthcare][39]\n* [Stories][40]\n* [Media releases][41]\n* [Roche careers][42]\n* [ linkedin][43]\n* [ facebook][44]\n* [ twitter][45]\n* [ instagram][46]\n* [ youtube][47]\n* [Roche Pharma Privacy Policy][48]\n* [Diagnostics Privacy Policy][49]\n* [Cookie Policy][50]\n* Cookies\n\n©  F. Hoffmann-La Roche Ltd  \n\nThis website contains information on products which is targeted to a wide range of audiences and\ncould contain product details or information otherwise not accessible or valid in your country.\nPlease be aware that we do not take any responsibility for accessing such information which may not\ncomply with any legal process, regulation, registration or usage in the country of your origin.\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /media-release\n[4]: https://careers.roche.com/global/en\n[5]: https://www.roche.com/worldwide#popular\n[6]: /search\n[7]: https://www.roche.com/worldwide#popular\n[8]: /search\n[9]: /about\n[10]: /about/sustainability\n[11]: /about/roche-sa-leadership-team\n[12]: /about/history\n[13]: /about/personalised-healthcare\n[14]: /solutions\n[15]: /solutions/focus-areas\n[16]: /stories\n[17]: /about\n[18]: /about/sustainability\n[19]: /about/roche-sa-leadership-team\n[20]: /about/history\n[21]: /about/personalised-healthcare\n[22]: /solu"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] [][2] * [Media][3] * [Careers][4] [][5][][6] [][7][][8] * About Roche * [About Roche][9] * [Sustainability][10] * [Leadership][11] * [History][12] * [Personalised healthcare][13] * Solutions * [Solutions][14] * [Focus areas][15] * [Stories][16] * About Roche * [About Roche][17] * [Sustainability][18] * [Leadership][19] * [History][20] * [Personalised healthcare][21] * Solutions * [Solutions][22] * [Focus areas][23] * [Stories][24] * [Media][25] * [Careers][26] Worldwide # Welcome to Roche South Africa ## About Roche We focus on finding new medicines and diagnostics and utilising data-based insights to evolve the practice of medicine and help patients live longer, better lives. [ Read more ][27] ## Solutions Since the founding of our company, we have been developing innovative medicines, treatments and diagnostics that continue to revolutionise healthcare. [ Read more ][28] ## Discover ## Roche South Africa ### Breast Cancer #Every30Days - Breast Self-Exam The better you know your breasts, the better you’re able to spot changes. By being comfortable with your body and checking your breasts every month, you can catch the and symptoms of breast cancer early. [ Read the story ][29] [A diverse group of eleven professionals stands in a line indoors, smiling and posing for a photo while holding a Roche-branded cardboard box.] ### [Investing in the Future: The Roche Registrar Event at NASA][30] Read how Roche supported South Africa's next generation of medical specialists with practical clinical guidance at the NASA Registrar Event. 12 August 2026 [Two professionals in business attire proudly holding a trophy, celebrating their achievement together.] ### [Roche | Partnerships scaling clinical research in South Africa][31] Roche South Africa honours Professor Johnny Mahlangu for his pioneering work in clinical haematology. Discover how this partnership drives clinical research and improves patient outcomes across the African continent 04 August 2026 [A group photo of the Roche Products and Unjani Alliance Clinic teams] ### [Women at the heart of community healthcare][32] Discover how Sister Portia Shezi and Unjani Clinic are bringing quality primary healthcare and early cancer detection to Benoni working families through key partnerships. 30 July 2026 [ Explore more stories ][33] ## For professionals ### [Press Releases South Africa][34] Stay up-to-date with Roche's latest news, events and announcements. ### [Careers][35] Find jobs and learn more abou