 biosimilars in Brazil.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "X Score": "73", "Y Score": "78", "Overall Score": "76", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Sandoz Limited", "Website": "https://www.sandoz.co.uk", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Bracknell, United Kingdom", "Continent / Geography": "EU(United Kingdom)", "Operational Presence": "United Kingdom", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "UK division of Sandoz, a global leader in biosimilars and generics, with a significant biosimilar portfolio.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "GB", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Sandoz Limited — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: UK division of Sandoz, a global leader in biosimilars and generics; markets biosimilars under its brand.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "sandoz.co.uk", "data": {"company": {"name": "sandoz.co.uk"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "↑S Upstream Creativity\n· Frontier [↑Strategy][1] [→Transformation][2] [↓Market][3]\n\n## Upstream\n## for an idea\n## that flows ~\n\nHello, I'm an experienced leader working across creativity, technology and business who takes ideas\nupstream and makes value flow.\n\nApplying brand, design and communication at the frontier, up to [strategy][4], through\n[transformation][5], and out to [market][6], for your next wave of growth.\n\nUsing multidisciplinary, multi-industry, expertise built as a global partner at Deloitte, president\nof D&AD, and exited founder of a creative hotshop.\n\nNothing creates value\nlike an idea that flows\n~\n\n→ and back.\n\nExperienced working across Creativity Brand, Design & Communication Technology Digital, Enterprise &\nAI and Business Strategy, Transformation & Marketing ...\n\n[Partner.]\n\nPartner & Global CCO.\n* UK Gov, Unilever, UN, Polestar, Netflix, Insta, Qatar, HSBC, Aviva, Uber, Virgin.\n* Led globally, building brand, prop design, experience, and EMEA ad network.\n* Into Marketing Transformation, Sustainability, Human Capital, Tax, Strategy and more.\n* In-house on Deloitte and Digital brands across strategy, internal comms, marketing and events.\n\n[Read More][7]\n\nPresident.\n* Leading this industry icon in commercial creative excellence.\n* Innovation and growth through White Pencil, Festival, New Blood & Shift.\n* Strengthened industry and education link with the Win One, Teach One platform.\n\n[President.]\n[Exited Founder.]\n\nExited Agency Founder.\n* Coke, Google, Pernod, Disney, Land Rover, Adidas, General Mills.\n* Campaign's Digital AOY, Top 5 most respected & best to work for. \"Welcome to the Science Fair\" Ad\n  Age Alist.\n* Sold to Havas.\n\n[Read More][8]\n\n[selfie]\n↑Sandoz\nUpstream Creativity [Email][9] [LinkedIn][10]\n· Frontier [↑Strategy][11] [→Transformation][12] [↓Market][13]\n[Deloitte][14] [Work Club][15] [D&AD][16]\n\n[1]: /strategy/\n[2]: /transformation/\n[3]: /market/\n[4]: /strategy/\n[5]: /transformation/\n[6]: /market/\n[7]: /deloitte/\n[8]: /workclub/\n[9]: mailto:andrew@sandozadvisory.com\n[10]: #\n[11]: /strategy/\n[12]: /transformation/\n[13]: /market/\n[14]: /deloitte/\n[15]: /workclub/\n[16]: /dandad/"}}, "page_text": "↑S Upstream Creativity · Frontier [↑Strategy][1] [→Transformation][2] [↓Market][3] ## Upstream ## for an idea ## that flows ~ Hello, I'm an experienced leader working across creativity, technology and business who takes ideas upstream and makes value flow. Applying brand, design and communication at the frontier, up to [strategy][4], through [transformation][5], and out to [market][6], for your next wave of growth. Using multidisciplinary, multi-industry, expertise built as a global partner at Deloitte, president of D&AD, and exited founder of a creative hotshop. Nothing creates value like an idea that flows ~ → and back. Experienced working across Creativity Brand, Design & Communication Technology Digital, Enterprise & AI and Business Strategy, Transformation & Marketing ... [Partner.] Partner & Global CCO. * UK Gov, Unilever, UN, Polestar, Netflix, Insta, Qatar, HSBC, Aviva, Uber, Virgin. * Led globally, building brand, prop design, experience, and EMEA ad network. * Into Marketing Transformation, Sustainability, Human Capital, Tax, Strategy and more. * In-house on Deloitte and Digital brands across strategy, internal comms, marketing and events. [Read More][7] President. * Leading this industry icon in commercial creative excellence. * Innovation and growth through White Pencil, Festival, New Blood & Shift. * Strengthened industry and education link with the Win One, Teach One platform. [President.] [Exited Founder.] Exited Agency Founder. * Coke, Google, Pernod, Disney, Land Rover, Adidas, General Mills. * Campaign's Digital AOY, Top 5 most respected & best to work for. \"Welcome to the Science Fair\" Ad Age Alist. * Sold to Havas. [Read More][8] [selfie] ↑Sandoz Upstream Creativity [Email][9] [LinkedIn][10] · Frontier [↑Strategy][11] [→Transformation][12] [↓Market][13] [Deloitte][14] [Work Club][15] [D&AD][16] [1]: /strategy/ [2]: /transformation/ [3]: /market/ [4]: /strategy/ [5]: /transformation/ [6]: /market/ [7]: /deloitte/ [8]: /workclub/ [9]: mailto:andrew@sandozadvisory.com [10]: # [11]: /strategy/ [12]: /transformation/ [13]: /market/ [14]: /deloitte/ [15]: /workclub/ [16]: /dandad/", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Sandoz Limited — channel partic