d", "Specialty Focus": "CSL's influenza vaccine business, produces and markets biologics vaccines in Australia and globally.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "Seqirus — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: CSL's influenza vaccine business, produces and markets biologics vaccines.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "seqirus.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "seqirus.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\n[ [CSL] ][2]\n* [ Global Selector ][3]\n* [ Newsroom ][4]\n* [ Partnering ][5]\n* [ Contact ][6]\n* [ We Are CSL ][7]\n  [We Are CSL][8]\n  [Our Businesses and Products][9]\n  [Vita: Original Stories][10]\n  [Our Leadership][11]\n  [Worldwide Locations][12]\n  [Corporate Governance][13]\n  [Our Impact][14]\n  [Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)][15]\n  [Our Businesses and Products][16]\n  [CSL Behring][17]\n  [CSL Seqirus][18]\n  [CSL Vifor][19]\n  [Corporate Governance][20]\n  [Code of Conduct][21]\n  [Core Policies][22]\n  \n  Vita means life. It's also our platform for sharing the stories of biotech's promise to patients\n  and public health.\n  \n  [Read the Stories][23]\n  \n  CSL consists of CSL Behring, CSL Seqirus and CSL Vifor. Learn more by visiting each section.\n  \n  [Our Businesses and Products][24]\n* [ Patients & Public Health ][25]\n  [Patients & Public Health][26]\n  [Rare & Serious Diseases ][27]\n  [Iron Deficiency][28]\n  [Nephrology][29]\n  [Vaccines][30]\n  [Patient Support & Organizations][31]\n  [Rare & Serious Diseases ][32]\n  [Immunodeficiency and Autoimmune Diseases][33]\n  [Hereditary Bleeding Disorders][34]\n  [Hereditary Angioedema][35]\n  [Alpha 1 Antitrypsin Deficiency][36]\n  [Iron Deficiency][37]\n  [Iron Deficiency Patient Stories][38]\n  [Nephrology][39]\n  [Nephrology Patient Stories][40]\n  [Vaccines][41]\n  [COVID-19][42]\n  [Pandemic Response][43]\n  [In-Licensing][44]\n  [Antivenoms and Q fever Vaccine][45]\n  [Patient Support & Organizations][46]\n  [CSL Behring USA Support & Assistance Programs][47]\n  [CSL Vifor Managed Access Programs][48]\n  [LEAD Grants][49]\n  [CSL Community Impact Awards][50]\n  \n  Biotechnology leader CSL Behring offers the broadest range of quality plasma-derived and\n  recombinant therapies in our industry.\n  \n  [CSL Behring: Rare & Serious Diseases][51]\n  \n  Derived from the expression 'securing health for all of us', CSL Seqirus is one of the world's\n  largest influenza vaccine providers.\n  \n  [CSL Seqirus: Vaccines][52]\n* [ R&D ][53]\n  [R&D][54]\n  [R&D Capabilities][55]\n  [Awards, Grants and Initiatives][56]\n  [World-Class R&D Network][57]\n  [Product Pipeline][58]\n  [Clinical Studies at CSL][59]\n  [Partnering][60]\n  [Clinical Studies at CSL][61]\n  [Current Clinical Trials][62]\n  [Research Practices][63]\n  [How to Participate][64]\n  [Clinical Studies FAQs][65]\n  \n  R&D focuses its expertise on four strategic platforms: plasma protein technology; recombinant\n  technology; cell and gene therapy; and vaccines technology.\n  \n  [R&D Capabilities][66]\n  \n  One of our core values at CSL is Innovation. We support collaborative innovation through the\n  endowment of awards and grants to researchers around the world.\n  \n  [Awards, Grants and Initiatives][67]\n* [ Sustainability ][68]\n  [Sustainability][69]\n  [Healthier Communities][70]\n  [Healthier Environment][71]\n  [Data and Reports][72]\n* [ Careers ][73]\n  [Careers][74]\n  [Explore Careers at CSL][75]\n  [Life at CSL][76]\n  [Benefits][77]\n  [Early Careers at CSL][78]\n  [Inclusion and Belonging][79]\n  [People Powering Science][80]\n  [Early Careers at CSL][81]\n  [Apprenticeships][82]\n  [Internships at CSL][83]\n  [Graduate Rotational Programs at CSL][84]\n  \n  At CSL, Inclusion and Belonging is at the core of our mission and who we are. It fuels our\n  innovation day in and day out.\n  \n  [Read About Our Approach to Inclusion and Belonging][85]\n  \n  Whether you are early in your college education or recently completed your degree, it's never too\n  soon to consider CSL for your Promising Future!\n  \n  [Early Careers at CSL][86]\n* [ Investors ][87]\n[ CSL ][88]\nBack\nSearch\n\n* [ We Are CSL ][89]\n  * [ We Are CSL ][90]\n  * [ Our Businesses and Products ][91]\n    * [ Our Businesses and Products ][92]\n    * [ CSL Behring ][93]\n    * [ CSL Seqirus ][94]\n    * [ CSL Vifor ][95]\n  * [ Vita: Original Stories ][96]\n  * [ Our Leadership ][97]\n  * [ Worldwide Locations ][98]\n  * [ Corporate Governance ][99]\n    * [ Corporate Governance ][100]\n    * [ Code of Conduct"}}, "page_text": "[ Skip to main content ][1] [ [CSL] ][2] * [ Global Selector ][3] * [ Newsroom ][4] * [ Partnering ][5] * [ Contact ][6] * [ We Are CSL ][7] [We Are CSL][8] [Our Businesses and Products][9] [Vita: Original Stories][10] [Our Leadership][11] [Worldwide Locations][12] [Corporate Governance][13] [Our Impact][14] [Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)][15] [Our Businesses and Products][16] [CSL Behring][17] [CSL Seqirus][18] [CSL Vifor][19] [Corporate Governance][20] [Code of Conduct][21] [Core Policies][22] Vita means life. It's also our platform for sharing the stories of biotech's promise to patients and public health. [Read the Stories][23] CSL consists of CSL Behring, CSL Seqirus and CSL Vifor. Learn more by visiting each section. [Our Businesses and Products][24] * [ Patients & Public Health ][25] [Patients & Public Health][26] [Rare & Serious Diseases ][27] [Iron Deficiency][28] [Nephrology][29] [Vaccines][30] [Patient Support & Organizations][31] [Rare & Serious Diseases ][32] [Immunodeficiency and Autoimmune Diseases][33] [Hereditary Bleeding Disorders][34] [Hereditary Angioedema][35] [Alpha 1 Antitrypsin Deficiency][36] [Iron Deficiency][37] [Iron Deficiency Patient Stories][38] [Nephrology][39] [Nephrology Patient Stories][40] [Vaccines][41] [COVID-19][42] [Pandemic Response][43] [In-Licensing][44] [Antivenoms and Q fever Vaccine][45] [Patient Support & Organizations][46] [CSL Behring USA Support & Assistance Programs][47] [CSL Vifor Managed Access Programs][48] [LEAD Grants][49] [CSL Community Impact Awards][50] Biotechnology leader CSL Behring offers the broadest range of quality plasma-derived and recombinant therapies in our industry. [CSL Behring: Rare & Serious Diseases][51] Derived from the expression 'securing health for all of us', CSL Seqirus is one of the world's largest influenza vaccine providers. [CSL Seqirus: Vaccines][52] * [ R&D ][53] [R&D][54] [R&D Capabilities][55] [Awards, Grants and Initiatives][56] [World-Class R&D Network][57] [Product Pipeline][58] [Clinical Studies at CSL][59] [Partnering][60] [Clinical Studies at CSL][61] [Current Clinical Trials][62] [Research Practices][63] [How to Participate][64] [Clinical Studies FAQs][65] R&D focuses its expertise on four strategic platforms: plasma protein technology; recombinant technology; cell and gene therapy; and vaccines technology. [R&D Capabilities][66] One of our core values at CSL is Innovation. We support collaborative innovation through the endowment of awards and grants to researchers around the world. [Awards, Grants and Initiatives][67] * [ Sustainability ][68] [Sustainability][69] [Healthier Communities][70] [Healthier Environment][71] [Data and Reports][72] * [ Careers ][73] [Careers][74] [Explore Careers at CSL][75] [Life at CSL][76] [Benefits][77] [Early Careers at CSL][78] [Inclusion and Belonging][79] [People Powering Science][80] [Early Careers at CSL][81] [Apprenticeships][82] [Internships at CSL][83] [Graduate Rotational Programs at CSL][84] At CSL, Inclusion and Belonging is at the core of our mission and who we are. It fuels our innovation day in and day out. [Read About Our Approach to Inclusion and Belonging][85] Whether you are early in your college education or recently completed your degree, it's never too soon to consider CSL for your Promising Future! [Early Careers at CSL][86] * [ Investors ][87] [ CSL ][88] Back Search * [ We Are CSL ][89] * [ We Are CSL ][90] * [ Our Businesses and Products ][91] * [ Our Businesses and Products ][92] * [ CSL Behring ][93] * [ CSL Seqirus ][94] * [ CSL Vifor ][95] * [ Vita: Original Stories ][96] * [ Our Leadership ][97] * [ Worldwide Locations ][98] * [ Corporate Governance ][99] * [ Corporate Governance ][100] * [ Code of Conduct ][101] * [ Core Policies ][102] * [ Our Impact ][103] * [ Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) ][104] * [ Patients & Public Health ][105] * [ Patients & Public Health ][106] * [ Rare & Serious Diseases ][107] * [ Rare & Serious Diseases ][108] * [ Immunodeficiency and Autoimmune Diseases ][109] * [ Hereditary Bleeding Disorders ][110] * [ Hereditary Angioedema ][111] * [ Alpha 1 Antitrypsin Deficiency ][112] * [ Iron Deficiency ][113] * [ Iron Deficiency ][114] * [ Iron Deficiency Patient Stories ][115] * [ Nephrology ][116] * [ Nephrology ][117] * [ Nephrology Patient Stories ][118] * [ Vaccines ][119] * [ Vaccines ][120] * [ COVID-19 ][121] * [ Pandemic Response ][122] * [ In-Licensing ][123] * [ Antivenoms and Q fever Vaccine ][124] * [ Patient Support & Organizations ][125] * [ Patient Support & Organizations ][126] * [ CSL Behring USA Support & Assistance Programs ][127] * [ CSL Vifor Managed Access Programs ][128] * [ LEAD Grants ][129] * [ CSL Community Impact Awards ][130] * [ R&D ][131] * [ R&D ][132] * [ R&D Capabilities ][133] * [ Awards, Grants and Initiatives ][134] * [ World-Class R&D Network ][135] * [ Product Pipeline ][136] * [ Clinical Studies at CSL ][137] * [ Clinical Studies at CSL ][138] * [ Current Clinical Trials ][139] * [ Research Practices ][140] * [ How to Participate ][141] * [ Clinical Studies FAQs ][142] * [ Partnering ][143] * [ Sustainability ][144] * [ Sustainability ][145] * [ Healthier Communities ][146] * [ Healthier Environment ][147] * [ Data and Reports ][148] * [ Careers ][149] * [ Careers ][150] * [ Explore Careers at CSL ][151] * [ Life at CSL ][152] * [ Benefits ][153] * [ Early Careers at CSL ][154] * [ Early Careers at CSL ][155] * [ Apprenticeships ][156] * [ Internships at CSL ][157] * [ Graduate Rotational Programs at CSL ][158] * [ Inclusion and Belonging ][159] * [ People Powering Science ][160] * [ Investors ][161] * [ Newsroom ][162] * [ Partnering ][163] * [ Contact ][164] * [Global Selector][165] [CSL Manufacturing Employee] # CSL Behring *^{Pictured: CSL manufacturing employee in Australia}* * [CSL][166] * [We Are CSL][167] * [Our Businesses and Products][168] * [CSL Behring][169] ## Leading the Way on Serious & Rare Diseases CSL Behring is a global biotherapeutics leader driven by our promise to save lives. Focused on serving patients’ needs by using the latest technologies, we discover, develop and deliver innovative therapies for people living with conditions in the immunology, hematology, cardiovascular and metabolic, respiratory, and transplant therapeutic areas. We use three strategic scientific platforms of plasma fractionation, recombinant protein technology, and cell and gene therapy to support continued innovation and continually refine ways in which products can address unmet medical needs and help patients lead full lives. Our parent company, CSL, headquartered in Melbourne, Australia, employs more than 32,000 people, and delivers its lifesaving therapies to people in more than 100 countries. [Test tubes] ## CSL Behring Products We develop and deliver innovative medicines for treating bleeding disorders, immune deficiencies and chronic inflammatory demyelinating polyneuropathy, as well as hereditary angioedema and Alpha 1 Antitrypsin Deficiency, among others. [See the CSL Behring Global Product List][170] ## Our Products [CIDP Patient Arthur standing near a rock wall] ### Achieving better health CSL Behring's R&D efforts have resulted in a wide range of biotherapy products that have had a lasting impact on human health around the world. [Emily and A.J. Bartko] ### Making a difference with one treatment at a time We bring to market biotherapy products for rare diseases that might not have been produced otherwise. [Smith family at a picnic] ### Our commitment and delivering our promise We are committed to delivering value through fulfilling unmet needs and enhancing patient experience. Our promise is to protect the health and well-being of people with life-threatening medical conditions. [HAE patient Zahra Khan] ## Putting Patients First Our patients are our passion and that drives the way we work. We are committed to full transparency of expectations and outcomes when partnering with them. We listen closely to patients about their experiences and collaborate with them from early research through the delivery of our innovative medicines. [Learn More About the Diseases We Treat][171] [A group shot of the Alpha 1 cycling team from CSL Behring] ## Vita: You Are Not Alone There is drama and emotion in the promise of biotechnology. We find it in the stories of patients and their families, and in the persistence and resolve of our researchers. And we see it in the drive and enduring optimism of our employees, who are committed to delivering on our promise of a brighter future. Visit our digital storytelling page, Vita, to read inspiring stories. [Read Vita Stories][172] [Doctors conferring] ## CSL Behring Events Attention Healthcare Professionals! CSL Behring participates in congresses and events around the globe. Want to know more? [Visit CSLBehringEvents.com][173] [CSL Plasma] ## CSL Behring Operates CSL Plasma CSL Behring operates one of the world’s largest plasma collection networks, **CSL Plasma**. CSL Plasma is vertically integrated, meaning plasma collected at CSL Plasma facilities is used by CSL Behring for the sole purpose of manufacturing and delivering its life-saving therapies to people in more than 100 countries. [Learn More About CSL Plasma][174] [ Terms of Use ][175] [ Cookie Policy ][176] [ Global Privacy Policy ][177] [ Accessibility Statement ][178] [ Sitemap ][179] * [ Terms of Use ][180] * [ Cookie Policy ][181] * [ Global Privacy Policy ][182] * [ Accessibility Statement ][183] * [ Sitemap ][184] [ [CSL logo] ][185] CSL, All Rights Reserved © 2026 * [ [Instagram] ][186] Search [1]: #main-content-area [2]: / [3]: https://www.csl.com/globalselector [4]: https://newsroom.csl.com/ [5]: /partnering [6]: /contact [7]: /we-are-csl [8]: /we-are-csl [9]: /we-are-csl/our-businesses-and-products [10]: /we-are-csl/vita-original-stories [11]: /we-are-csl/our-leadership [12]: /we-are-csl/worldwide-locations [13]: /we-are-csl/corporate-governance [14]: /we-are-csl/our-impact [15]: /we-are-csl/frequently-asked-questions [16]: /we-are-csl/our-businesses-and-products [17]: /we-are-csl/our-businesses-and-products/csl-behring [18]: /we-are-csl/our-businesses-and-products/csl-seqirus [19]: /we-are-csl/our-businesses-and-products/csl-vifor [20]: /we-are-csl/corporate-governance [21]: /we-are-csl/corporate-governance/code-of-conduct [22]: /we-are-csl/corporate-governance/core-policies [23]: https://www.csl.com/we-are-csl/vita-original-stories [24]: https://www.csl.com/we-are-csl/our-businesses-and-products [25]: /patients-public-health [26]: /patients-public-health [27]: /patients-public-health/rare-and-serious-diseases [28]: /patients-public-health/iron-deficiency [29]: /patients-public-health/nephrology [30]: /patients-public-health/vaccines [31]: /patients-public-health/patient-support-and-organizations [32]: /patients-public-health/rare-and-serious-diseases [33]: /patients-public-health/rare-and-serious-diseases/immunodeficiency-and-autoimmune-diseases [34]: /patients-public-health/rare-and-serious-diseases/hereditary-bleeding-disorders [35]: /patients-public-health/rare-and-serious-diseases/hereditary-angioedema [36]: /patients-public-health/rare-and-serious-diseases/alpha-1-antitrypsin-deficiency [37]: /patients-public-health/iron-deficiency [38]: /patients-public-health/iron-deficiency/iron-deficiency-patient-stories [39]: /patients-public-health/nephrology [40]: /patients-public-health/nephrology/nephrology-patient-stories [41]: /patients-public-health/vaccines [42]: /patients-public-", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Seqirus — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: CSL's influenza vaccine business, produces and markets biologics vaccines. | CSL's influenza vaccine business, produces and markets biologics vaccines in Australia and globally. | Australia | United, Kingdom, Its", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "44", "Y Score": "54", "Overall Score": "49", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Biotechnology", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Shanghai Fosun Pharmaceutical", "Website": "https://www.fosunpharma.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Shanghai, China", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(China)", "Operational Presence": "China", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Fosun Pharma markets biosimilars and biologics in China and globally.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Shanghai Fosun Pharmaceutical — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Fosun Pharma is a pharmaceutical company that markets biosimilars and biologics, owning and marketing its products.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "fosunpharma.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "fosunpharma.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "* 中文简体 *\n  [En][1]\n  \n  [中文简体][2]\n  \n  [中文繁体][3]\n* [投资者][4]\n* [媒体][5]\n* [应聘者][6]\n* [廉政举报][7]\n* [联系][8]\n* [关于复星医药][9]\n  \n  [ 返回 ][10]\n  \n  ### 关于复星医药\n  \n  上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团。\n  \n  [公司简介][11]\n  \n  [领导团队][12]\n  \n  [公司荣誉][13]\n  \n  [品牌文化][14]\n  \n  [成员企业][15]\n  \n  **\n    上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司（“复星医药”，股票代码：600196.SH，02196.HK）成立于1994\n    年，是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团，直接运营的业务包括制药、医疗器械与医学诊断\n    、医疗健康服务，并通过参股国药控股覆盖到医药商业领域。\n* [我们的业务][16]\n  \n  [ 返回 ][17]\n  \n  ### 我们的业务\n  \n  上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司直接运营的业务包括制药、医疗器械与医学诊断、医疗健康服务，并通过参\n  股国药控股覆盖到医药商业领域。\n  \n  [制药][18]\n  \n  [疫苗][19]\n  \n  [医疗器械][20]\n  \n  [医学诊断][21]\n  \n  [医疗健康服务][22]\n  \n  [医药分销与零售][23]\n  \n  **\n    复星医药以患者为中心、临床需求为导向，通过自主研发、合作开发、许可引进、深度孵化的方式，持续丰富\n    创新产品管线，提升FIC（First-in-class，即同类首创）与BIC（Best-in-class，即同类最佳）新药的研究\n    与临床开发能力，加快创新技术和产品的研发和转化落地。\n* [研发创新][24]\n  \n  [ 返回 ][25]\n  \n  ### 研发创新\n  \n  上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司成立于1994 年，是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团。\n  \n  [研发管线][26]\n  \n  [创新平台][27]\n  \n  [临床开发][28]\n  \n  [研发动态][29]\n  \n  **\n    公司以创新和国际化为导向，通过自主研发、合作开发、许可引进、深度孵化等多元化、\n    多层次的合作模式，持续丰富创新产品管线，提升 FIC（First-in-class，即同类首创）与\n    BIC（Bestin-class，即同类最佳）新药的研究与临床开发能力，加快创新技术和产品的研发和转化落地。\n* [ESG][30]\n  \n  [ 返回 ][31]\n  \n  ### ESG\n  \n  *数据来源：复星医药《2025年度ESG暨可持续发展报告》\n  \n  [卓越治理][32]\n  \n  [普惠医疗][33]\n  \n  [质量为先][34]\n  \n  [绿色环境][35]\n  \n  [可持续供应链][36]\n  \n  [聚焦人才][37]\n  \n  [星爱121公益基金][38]\n  \n  [ESG报告下载][39]\n  \n  [新闻动态][40]\n  \n  **\n    复星医药集团将可持续发展纳入公司整体发展战略，重视ESG长效治理能力，建立了由董事会监管、ESG委员会\n    实施、ESG工作小组执行的三级ESG治理架构。董事会ESG委员会负责制定并推进本集团ESG愿景、目标、策略，\n    并向董事会提供建议；ESG工作小组负责梳理拟订重要ESG议题，拟订可持续发展量化目标并跟踪达成进度。ES\n    G委员会和ESG工作小组致力于将ESG理念融入企业运营，提升企业可持续发展能力。\n* [投资者关系][41]\n  \n  [ 返回 ][42]\n  \n  ### 投资者关系\n  \n  上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团。\n  \n  [公告与通函][43]\n  \n  [公司治理][44]\n  \n  [财务报告][45]\n  \n  [投资者演示材料][46]\n  \n  [常见问题][47]\n  \n  [投资者联络][48]\n  \n  **\n    上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司（“复星医药”，股票代码：600196.SH，02196.HK）成立于1994\n    年，是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团，直接运营的业务包括制药、医疗器械与医学诊断\n    、医疗健康服务，并通过参股国药控股覆盖到医药商业领域。\n* [新闻中心][49]\n  \n  [ 返回 ][50]\n  \n  ### 新闻中心\n  \n  上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团。\n  \n  [集团新闻][51]\n  \n  [星动态][52]\n  \n  [媒体聚焦][53]\n  \n  [媒体资料库][54]\n  \n  [媒体联络][55]\n  \n  **\n    上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司（“复星医药”，股票代码：600196.SH，02196.HK）成立于1994\n    年，是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团，直接运营的业务包括制药、医疗器械与医学诊断\n    、医疗健康服务，并通过参股国药控股覆盖到医药商业领域。\n* [职业发展][56]\n  \n  [ 返回 ][57]\n  \n  ### 职业发展\n  \n  我们汇聚全球最具有企业家精神的优秀人才。\n  \n  [人才理念][58]\n  \n  [成长激励][59]\n  \n  [员工生活][60]\n  \n  [加入我们][61]\n  \n  **\n    认同并践行复星的文化价值观，自我驱动、快速学习并持续创造价值，专业方面具备产业深度、跨区域的宽度\n    以及全球某个领域制高点的高度。复星将致力于持续培养业绩卓越、高潜力的全球顶尖人才。\n* [投资者][62]\n* [媒体][63]\n* [应聘者][64]\n* [廉政举报][65]\n* [联系][66]\n* ### 致力于成为\n  ### 全球领先的医疗创新整合者\n  \n  We are dedicated to being the global leading\n  integrator of pharmaceutical and healthcare innovation\n* ### 让每个家庭\n  ### 乐享健康\n  \n  Better Health for\n  Families Worldwide\n* ### 致力于成为\n  ### 全球领先的医疗创新整合者\n  \n  We are dedicated to being the global leading\n  integrator of pharmaceutical and healthcare innovation\n创新驱动的全球化\n医药健康产业集团\n* * 416.62 *亿元* *\n    2025年营业收入\n* * 33.71 *亿元* *\n    2025年归母净利润\n* * 59.13 *亿元* *\n    2025年研发投入\n* * 40,603 *人* *\n    全球员工总数\n* * AA ** *\n    MSCI ESG评级\n* * *\n*单位：人民币\n截至2025年12月31日\n[查看更多][67]\n* ### 注射用青蒿琥酯Artesun^{®}\n  \n  #### 获WHO推荐为重症疟疾治疗的首选用药\n  \n  截至2022年底，复星医药自主研发的抗疟创新药Artesun^{®}（注射用青蒿琥酯）救治了全球超5,600万重症疟疾\n  患者。\n* ### 汉利康^{®}（利妥昔单抗注射液）\n  \n  #### 中国首个生物类似药\n  \n  自2019年获批上市以来，汉利康^{®}已累计惠及超过10万名中国患者\n  \n  [查看更多][68]\n* ### 汉曲优^{®}（注射用曲妥珠单抗，欧洲商品名：Zercepac^{®}）\n  \n  #### 首个中欧双批的国产单抗生物类似药\n  \n  Zercepac^{®}（150mg）已于英国、德国、西班牙、法国等近20个欧洲国家和地区成功上市\n* ### 汉斯状^{®}（斯鲁利单抗注射液）\n  \n  \n  复宏汉霖首款自主研发并在中国获批上市的创新型单抗H药汉斯状^{®}（抗PD-1单抗）\n* ### 奕凯达^{®}（阿基仑赛注射液）\n  \n  #### 中国首个获批上市的CAR-T细胞治疗产品\n  \n  截至2022年末，奕凯达^{®}已被纳入70个省市的城市惠民保和超过60项商业保险，备案的治疗中心超过130家。\n  截至2023年1月末，奕凯达^{®}已治疗近300位复发或难治性大B细胞淋巴瘤患者。\n  \n  [查看更多][69]\n* ### 苏可欣^{®}（马来酸阿伐曲泊帕片）\n  \n  #### 复星医药首个引进的小分子创新药，中国首个获批用于CLDT治疗的药物\n  \n  苏可欣^{®}于2020年12月纳入国家医保目录，并于2021年3月1日起医保标准执行，全面提升患者临床治疗可及性\n  \n  [查看更多][70]\n* ### 复必泰（mRNA新冠疫苗，即BNT162b2）\n  \n  \n  复必泰BNT162b2及复必泰二价mRNA疫苗均已于中国香港获正式注册、于中国澳门获批常规进口疫苗，实现公立和\n  私营市场全覆盖。\n  \n  [查看更多][71]\n* ### 达芬奇手术机器人\n  \n  \n"}}, "page_text": "* 中文简体 * [En][1] [中文简体][2] [中文繁体][3] * [投资者][4] * [媒体][5] * [应聘者][6] * [廉政举报][7] * [联系][8] * [关于复星医药][9] [ 返回 ][10] ### 关于复星医药 上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团。 [公司简介][11] [领导团队][12] [公司荣誉][13] [品牌文化][14] [成员企业][15] ** 上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司（“复星医药”，股票代码：600196.SH，02196.HK）成立于1994 年，是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团，直接运营的业务包括制药、医疗器械与医学诊断 、医疗健康服务，并通过参股国药控股覆盖到医药商业领域。 * [我们的业务][16] [ 返回 ][17] ### 我们的业务 上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司直接运营的业务包括制药、医疗器械与医学诊断、医疗健康服务，并通过参 股国药控股覆盖到医药商业领域。 [制药][18] [疫苗][19] [医疗器械][20] [医学诊断][21] [医疗健康服务][22] [医药分销与零售][23] ** 复星医药以患者为中心、临床需求为导向，通过自主研发、合作开发、许可引进、深度孵化的方式，持续丰富 创新产品管线，提升FIC（First-in-class，即同类首创）与BIC（Best-in-class，即同类最佳）新药的研究 与临床开发能力，加快创新技术和产品的研发和转化落地。 * [研发创新][24] [ 返回 ][25] ### 研发创新 上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司成立于1994 年，是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团。 [研发管线][26] [创新平台][27] [临床开发][28] [研发动态][29] ** 公司以创新和国际化为导向，通过自主研发、合作开发、许可引进、深度孵化等多元化、 多层次的合作模式，持续丰富创新产品管线，提升 FIC（First-in-class，即同类首创）与 BIC（Bestin-class，即同类最佳）新药的研究与临床开发能力，加快创新技术和产品的研发和转化落地。 * [ESG][30] [ 返回 ][31] ### ESG *数据来源：复星医药《2025年度ESG暨可持续发展报告》 [卓越治理][32] [普惠医疗][33] [质量为先][34] [绿色环境][35] [可持续供应链][36] [聚焦人才][37] [星爱121公益基金][38] [ESG报告下载][39] [新闻动态][40] ** 复星医药集团将可持续发展纳入公司整体发展战略，重视ESG长效治理能力，建立了由董事会监管、ESG委员会 实施、ESG工作小组执行的三级ESG治理架构。董事会ESG委员会负责制定并推进本集团ESG愿景、目标、策略， 并向董事会提供建议；ESG工作小组负责梳理拟订重要ESG议题，拟订可持续发展量化目标并跟踪达成进度。ES G委员会和ESG工作小组致力于将ESG理念融入企业运营，提升企业可持续发展能力。 * [投资者关系][41] [ 返回 ][42] ### 投资者关系 上海复星医药（集团）股份有限公司是一家植根中国、创新驱动的全球化医药健康产业集团。 [公告与通函][43] [公司治理][44] [财务报告][45] [投资者演示材料][46] [常见问题][47] [投资者联络][48] **