ility][48]\n  * [Sustainability Report][49]\n  * [Supply Chain Act][50]\n* Investors[Chevron Right Icon]\n  [Investors][51]\n  * [At a Glance][52]\n  * [Corporate Governance][53]\n  * [IR Contact][54]\n* Media[Chevron Right Icon]\n  [Media][55]\n  * [Newsroom][56]\n  * [Press Releases][57]\n  * [Media assets][58]\n  * [STADA Health Report][59]\n  * [Media Contact][60]\n* [Career][61]\n* en-GB\n  * [[Deutsch]Deutsch (DE-DE)][62]\n  [Chevron Right Icon]\n* Select your country[Chevron Right Icon]\n[STADA Supports Cancer Care in Uganda]\n\n# STADA Supports Cancer Care in Uganda\n\n[Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][63]\n\n## STADA Health Report 2026\n\n[Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][64]\n[The #STADAHealthReport 2026 is here]\n\n## The STADAHealthReport 2026 is here.\n\nby Peter Goldschmidt, STADA CEO\n\n[Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][65]\n[STADA acquires significant Consumer Healthcare portfolio from Orifarm]\n\n## STADA acquires significant Consumer Healthcare portfolio from Orifarm\n\n[Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][66]\n[STADA strengthens as a leader in consumer healthcare in Europe]\n\n## STADA strengthens as a leader in consumer healthcare in Europe\n\n[Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][67]\n\n## Explore STADA\n\n[\n][68]\n\n[****][69]**[Sustainability][70]\n**Healthcare comes with responsibility. STADA’s 2025 Sustainability Report shows our progress on\nESG, product safety and patient well-being.\n\n[\n][71]\n\n[****][72]**[STADA - Top Employer][73]\n**Five years in a row: STADA has been recognized as Top Employer Europe 2026.\n\n**[STADA Health Report][74]**\nAI is Transforming Healthcare – Are Europeans Ready?\n\n[\n][75]\n\n[****][76]**[Nizoral Turns 40][77]\n**Nizoral marked its 40-year anniversary with a 2-day international expert event in Brussels.\n\n[\n][78]\n\n[****][79]**[Cancer Care][80]\n**STADA has donated 4,000 vials of the cancer medicine bortezomib to the Uganda Cancer Institute, in\ncooperation with the humanitarian organization Direct Relief.\n\n[\n][81]\n\n[****][82]**[Three-pillar Strategy][83]\n**Our diversified portfolio spans Consumer Healthcare, Generics and Specialty medicines.\n\n## STADA Health Report: AI is Transforming Healthcare – Are Europeans Ready?\n\n[Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][84]\n\n## Latest press releases\n\nFor media and investors\n\n## STADA LinkedIn\n\nLatest insights from our colleagues\n\n[STADA Switzerland empowers colleagues to “Grow Your Own Way”]\n[Strengthening pharmacy partnerships to advance eye health in the Philippines]\n[Growing Consumer Healthcare with strong brands in Czechia]\n[From FMCG to STADA: a new chapter in Global CHC]\n[New beginnings in Data & Analytics with STADA India]\n\n## Consumer Healthcare products\n\n[\n][8"}}, "page_text": "[][1] * [Company][2] * [About STADA][3] * [Management][4] * [Our corporate culture][5] * [STADA worldwide][6] * [Company history][7] * [Compliance][8] * [Products][9] * [Consumer Healthcare products][10] * [Specialty Pharmaceuticals][11] * [Generics][12] * [Partnerships][13] * [Quality at STADA][14] * [Adverse drug reaction report][15] * [Stories][16] * [Sustainability][17] * [Sustainability Report][18] * [Supply Chain Act][19] * [Investors][20] * [At a Glance][21] * [Corporate Governance][22] * [IR Contact][23] * [Media][24] * [Newsroom][25] * [Press Releases][26] * [Media assets][27] * [STADA Health Report][28] * [Media Contact][29] * [Career][30] [Search Icon] [Location Icon][Chevron Down Icon] en-GB [Chevron Down Icon] * [[Deutsch]Deutsch (DE-DE)][31] [Hamburger Menu Icon] [][32] [Hamburger Menu Icon]Mobile Navigation Search[Search Icon] * Company[Chevron Right Icon] [Company][33] * [About STADA][34] * [Management][35] * [Our corporate culture][36] * [STADA worldwide][37] * [Company history][38] * [Compliance][39] * Products[Chevron Right Icon] [Products][40] * [Consumer Healthcare products][41] * [Specialty Pharmaceuticals][42] * [Generics][43] * [Partnerships][44] * [Quality at STADA][45] * [Adverse drug reaction report][46] * [Stories][47] * Sustainability[Chevron Right Icon] [Sustainability][48] * [Sustainability Report][49] * [Supply Chain Act][50] * Investors[Chevron Right Icon] [Investors][51] * [At a Glance][52] * [Corporate Governance][53] * [IR Contact][54] * Media[Chevron Right Icon] [Media][55] * [Newsroom][56] * [Press Releases][57] * [Media assets][58] * [STADA Health Report][59] * [Media Contact][60] * [Career][61] * en-GB * [[Deutsch]Deutsch (DE-DE)][62] [Chevron Right Icon] * Select your country[Chevron Right Icon] [STADA Supports Cancer Care in Uganda] # STADA Supports Cancer Care in Uganda [Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][63] ## STADA Health Report 2026 [Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][64] [The #STADAHealthReport 2026 is here] ## The STADAHealthReport 2026 is here. by Peter Goldschmidt, STADA CEO [Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][65] [STADA acquires significant Consumer Healthcare portfolio from Orifarm] ## STADA acquires significant Consumer Healthcare portfolio from Orifarm [Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][66] [STADA strengthens as a leader in consumer healthcare in Europe] ## STADA strengthens as a leader in consumer healthcare in Europe [Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][67] ## Explore STADA [ ][68] [****][69]**[Sustainability][70] **Healthcare comes with responsibility. STADA’s 2025 Sustainability Report shows our progress on ESG, product safety and patient well-being. [ ][71] [****][72]**[STADA - Top Employer][73] **Five years in a row: STADA has been recognized as Top Employer Europe 2026. **[STADA Health Report][74]** AI is Transforming Healthcare – Are Europeans Ready? [ ][75] [****][76]**[Nizoral Turns 40][77] **Nizoral marked its 40-year anniversary with a 2-day international expert event in Brussels. [ ][78] [****][79]**[Cancer Care][80] **STADA has donated 4,000 vials of the cancer medicine bortezomib to the Uganda Cancer Institute, in cooperation with the humanitarian organization Direct Relief. [ ][81] [****][82]**[Three-pillar Strategy][83] **Our diversified portfolio spans Consumer Healthcare, Generics and Specialty medicines. ## STADA Health Report: AI is Transforming Healthcare – Are Europeans Ready? [Read more[Arrow Right Icon]][84] ## Latest press releases For media and investors ## STADA LinkedIn Latest insights from our colleagues [STADA Switzerland empowers colleagues to “Grow Your Own Way”] [Strengthening pharmacy partnerships to advance eye health in the Philippines] [Growing Consumer Healthcare with strong brands in Czechia] [From FMCG to STADA: a new chapter in Global CHC] [New beginnings in Data & Analytics with STADA India] ## Consumer Healthcare products [ ][85] [ ][86] [ [Synthol®] ][87] [ [Grippostad] ][88] [ ][89] [ ][90] [ [Lunestil] ][91] [ [Oilatum] ][92] [ [BIOPRON®] ][93] ## Improving access to life-changing treatments for patients worldwide Speciality Pharmaceuticals are medicines that give patients access to innovative treatment options, especially for chronic, severe or rare diseases. STADA's Specialty portfolio includes innovative treatments for conditions such as Parkinson’s disease and a rare kidney disease, as well as a range of biologic medicines across uses in cancer, eyecare and autoimmune conditions. Through partnerships, we are establishing a sustainable specialty pipeline to deliver on our purpose of “Caring for People's Health as a Trusted Partner”. [Specialty Pharmaceuticals[Arrow Right Icon]][94] ## Affordable generics have been the backbone of STADA since 1895 As a major player in the generics sector, we support patient care with affordable medicines. This is especially true in Europe, where STADA ranks as the fourth-largest manufacturer and supplier of generics in terms of sales. Seven out of ten medicines prescribed in Europe are generic, but these account for only about 30% of all pharmaceutical expenditure. [Generics[Arrow Right Icon]][95] ## Our purpose is ‘Caring for People’s Health as a Trusted Partner At STADA, this purpose unites all employees globally as a One STADA team with the aim of bringing health to society. It guides STADA's people in their day-to-day business – and drives the company’s ambition to be the partner of choice in Consumer Healthcare, Generics and Specialty. [Our Purpose[Arrow Right Icon]][96] ### Explore your ### next career step [Careers[Arrow Right Icon]][97][Explore open roles[Arrow Right Icon]][98] PRODUCTS [ Nizoral®][99][ Grippostad®][100][ Lunestil®][101][ Immunology][102][ Nephrology][103][ Neurology][104] COMPANY [ About us][105][ Products][106][ Investors][107][ Media][108][ Career][109][ STADA worldwide][110] GET IN TOUCH [ Contact][111][ [email protected]][112][ +49 6101 603-0][113][ Compliance Reporting Portal ⧉][114] FOLLOW US [[LinkedIn Icon]][115][[Instagram Icon]][116][[Facebook Icon]][117][[Twitter Icon]][118][[YouTube Icon]][119] * [Conditions of Use][120] * [Privacy Policy][121] * [Imprint][122] * [Cookie Settings][123] Progenerika | © Copyright STADA Arzneimittel AG 2025 [1]: / [2]: /about-stada/who-we-are [3]: /about-stada/who-we-are [4]: /about-stada/management/stada-executive-committee [5]: /about-stada/our-corporate-culture [6]: /about-stada/stada-worldwide [7]: /about-stada/company-history [8]: /about-stada/compliance [9]: /products [10]: /products/consumer-healthcare-products [11]: /products/specialty-pharmaceuticals [12]: /products/generics [13]: /products/partnerships [14]: /products/quality-at-stada [15]: /products/adverse-drug-reaction-report [16]: /stories [17]: /sustainability/sustainability-report [18]: /sustainability/sustainability-report [19]: /sustainability/supply-chain-act [20]: /investor-relations/at-a-glance [21]: /investor-relations/at-a-glance [22]: /investor-relations/corporate-governance [23]: /investor-relations/ir-contact [24]: /media/newsroom [25]: /media/newsroom [26]: /media/press-releases/2026 [27]: /media/media-assets [28]: /media/health-reports/stada-health-report [29]: /media/media-contact [30]: https://jobs.stada.com/?locale=en_US [31]: https://www.stada.com/de [32]: / [33]: /about-