resented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Marketer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Strides Pharma Science — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Pharmaceutical company that markets biosimilars in Southeast Asia through partnerships.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "strides.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "strides.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "NSE : [NSE]\nBSE : [NSE]\n[Careers][1] [Contact Us][2]\n[search icon]\n[search icon]\n[search icon] [search icon]\n×\n[sun] [moon]\n[burger icon]\nMenu ×\n* [About Us [Logo]][3]\n  * [Overview][4]\n  * [Our Story][5]\n  * [Our Purpose and Credo][6]\n  * [Board of Directors][7]\n  * [Leadership Team][8]\n  * [Manufacturing][9]\n  * [Research & Development][10]\n  * [Quality][11]\n  * [People & Culture][12]\n  * [Awards & Recognition][13]\n* [Global Presence [Logo]][14]\n  * [Americas][15]\n  * [Europe, Middle East and Africa (EMEA)][16]\n  * [Asia Pacific (APAC)][17]\n  * [Institutional Access Markets][18]\n* [People & Culture [Logo]][19]\n  * [Overview][20]\n  * [Our Culture][21]\n  * [Diversity & Inclusion][22]\n  * [People Stories][23]\n* [Investors [Logo]][24]\n  * [Investor Overview][25]\n  * [Financial Performance][26]\n    * [Quarterly Results][27]\n    * [Annual Reports][28]\n    * [Subsidiary Financials][29]\n  * [Shareholder Information][30]\n    * [Shareholding Pattern][31]\n    * [General Meetings][32]\n    * [Postal Ballot][33]\n    * [Scheme of Arrangements][34]\n    * [Dividend/ Shares][35]\n    * [Shareholder Communication][36]\n    * [Tax on Dividend][37]\n    * [Online Dispute Resolution Mechanism][38]\n    * [Factsheet][39]\n    * [Investor FAQ][40]\n  * [Corporate Governance][41]\n    * [Board of Directors][42]\n    * [Board Committees][43]\n    * [Key Managerial Personnel][44]\n    * [Governance Policies/ Codes][45]\n  * [Stock Exchange Disclosures][46]\n    * [Notice of Board Meetings][47]\n    * [Investor Meetings][48]\n    * [Announcement & Disclosures][49]\n    * [Related Party Transactions Disclosures][50]\n    * [Annual Secretarial Compliance Report][51]\n    * [Statement of Deviations][52]\n    * [Newspaper Advertisement][53]\n  * [Disclosure under Regulation 46 of SEBI LODR][54]\n  * [Investor Contacts][55]\n  Investors\n  \n  Explore our most recent updates, including announcements, results, share price information, and\n  other key resources.\n  \n  [ Annual Report 2025-26 ][56]\n* [Sustainability [Logo]][57]\n  * [Overview][58]\n  * [Our ESG Goals][59]\n  * [Risk Management][60]\n  * [Corporate Social Responsibility][61]\n  * [Policies][62]\n  * [Reports & Ratings][63]\n* [Media][64]\n* [Careers][65] [Contact Us][66]\n\n# Health where it matters\n\n[ Know more [arrow] ][67]\n\n## About Us\n\nWe are committed to making quality healthcare accessible worldwide. Since 1990, our presence in over\n100 countries has been shaped by one purpose to deliver trusted medicines that improve lives and\ntransform health.\n\n[ Know more [arrow] ][68]\n\n## Global Presence\n\nA worldwide commitment to health, bringing life-saving solutions to every market.\n\nManufacturing Units  \n\n[map] \n\n✕\n\n### United States\n\n**Strides Pharma Inc, USA**\n\n1 Ram Ridge Road, Chestnut Ridge, NY 10977, USA.\n\n✕\n\n### Kenya\n\n**Universal Corporation Limited, Kenya (UCL)**\n\nClub Road, Past Post Office, Plot No. 13777, \nP.O. Box 1748 – 00902, Kikuyu Town, Kenya. \n(UCL is an Associate company of the Group effective September 30, 2022)\n\n✕\n\n### Italy\n\n**Beltapharm S.R.L, Italy**\n\n20095 Cusano ML, Via Stelvio, 66, Italy.\n\nBack ✕\n\n✕ \n\n### KRSG Bengaluru\n\n**Strides Pharma Science Limited**\n\nKRS Gardens, No.36/7, Suragajakkanahalli, \nAnekal Taluk, Bengaluru – 562 106.\n\n✕ \n\n### Chandapura Bengaluru\n\n**Strides Pharma Science Limited**\n\n#19/1,19/3, Chandapura, Anekal Taluk, \nBengaluru – 560 099.\n\n✕ \n\n### Chennai\n\n**Strides Pharma Science Limited,**\n\nPlot No. 101, 102, 107, 108 & 153, SIDCO Pharmaceutical Complex, \nAlathur, Chengalpattu, Tamil Nadu, India -603110.\n\n✕ \n\n### Puducherry\n\n**Strides Pharma Science Limited**\n\nPIMS Road, Periyakalapet, \nPuducherry – 605 014.\n\n## Product Offerings\n\nFrom essential generics to speciality formulations, our portfolio is built to meet the diverse and\nevolving needs of patients worldwide. We focus on delivering high-quality, differentiated medicines\nacross a broad range of therapeutic categories, combining scale, innovation, and global reach to\nmake a meaningful impact in healthcare.\n\n## Research & Developm"}}, "page_text": "NSE : [NSE] BSE : [NSE] [Careers][1] [Contact Us][2] [search icon] [search icon] [search icon] [search icon] × [sun] [moon] [burger icon] Menu × * [About Us [Logo]][3] * [Overview][4] * [Our Story][5] * [Our Purpose and Credo][6] * [Board of Directors][7] * [Leadership Team][8] * [Manufacturing][9] * [Research & Development][10] * [Quality][11] * [People & Culture][12] * [Awards & Recognition][13] * [Global Presence [Logo]][14] * [Americas][15] * [Europe, Middle East and Africa (EMEA)][16] * [Asia Pacific (APAC)][17] * [Institutional Access Markets][18] * [People & Culture [Logo]][19] * [Overview][20] * [Our Culture][21] * [Diversity & Inclusion][22] * [People Stories][23] * [Investors [Logo]][24] * [Investor Overview][25] * [Financial Performance][26] * [Quarterly Results][27] * [Annual Reports][28] * [Subsidiary Financials][29] * [Shareholder Information][30] * [Shareholding Pattern][31] * [General Meetings][32] * [Postal Ballot][33] * [Scheme of Arrangements][34] * [Dividend/ Shares][35] * [Shareholder Communication][36] * [Tax on Dividend][37] * [Online Dispute Resolution Mechanism][38] * [Factsheet][39] * [Investor FAQ][40] * [Corporate Governance][41] * [Board of Directors][42] * [Board Committees][43] * [Key Managerial Personnel][44] * [Governance Policies/ Codes][45] * [Stock Exchange Disclosures][46] * [Notice of Board Meetings][47] * [Investor Meetings][48] * [Announcement & Disclosures][49] * [Related Party Transactions Disclosures][50] * [Annual Secretarial Compliance Report][51] * [Statement of Deviations][52] * [Newspaper Advertisement][53] * [Disclosure under Regulation 46 of SEBI LODR][54] * [Investor Contacts][55] Investors Explore our most recent updates, including announcements, results, share price information, and other key resources. [ Annual Report 2025-26 ][56] * [Sustainability [Logo]][57] * [Overview][58] * [Our ESG Goals][59] * [Risk Management][60] * [Corporate Social Responsibility][61] * [Policies][62] * [Reports & Ratings][63] * [Media][64] * [Careers][65] [Contact Us][66] # Health where it matters [ Know more [arrow] ][67] ## About Us We are committed to making quality healthcare accessible worldwide. Since 1990, our presence in over 100 countries has been shaped by one purpose to deliver trusted medicines that improve lives and transform health. [ Know more [arrow] ][68] ## Global Presence A worldwide commitment to health, bringing life-saving solutions to every market. Manufacturing Units [map] ✕ ### United States **Strides Pharma Inc, USA** 1 Ram Ridge Road, Chestnut Ridge, NY 10977, USA. ✕ ### Kenya **Universal Corporation Limited, Kenya (UCL)** Club Road, Past Post Office, Plot No. 13777, P.O. Box 1748 – 00902, Kikuyu Town, Kenya. (UCL is an Associate company of the Group effective September 30, 2022) ✕ ### Italy **Beltapharm S.R.L, Italy** 20095 Cusano ML, Via Stelvio, 66, Italy. Back ✕ ✕ ### KRSG Bengaluru **Strides Pharma Science Limited** KRS Gardens, No.36/7, Suragajakkanahalli, Anekal Taluk, Bengaluru – 562 106. ✕ ### Chandapura Bengaluru **Strides Pharma Science Limited** #19/1,19/3, Chandapura, Anekal Taluk, Bengaluru – 560 099. ✕ ### Chennai **Strides Pharma Science Limited,** Plot No. 101, 102, 107, 108 & 153, SIDCO Pharmaceutical Complex, Alathur, Chengalpattu, Tamil Nadu, India -603110. ✕ ### Puducherry **Strides Pharma Science Limited** PIMS Road, Periyakalapet, Puducherry – 605 014. ## Product Offerings From essential generics to speciality formulations, our portfolio is built to meet the diverse and evolving needs of patients worldwide. We focus on delivering high-quality, differentiated medicines across a broad range of therapeutic categories, combining scale, innovation, and global reach to make a meaningful impact in healthcare. ## Research & Development For us, research & development is a commitment to advancing healthcare through purposeful innovation. Every formulation we develop and every technology we embrace is guided by a single vision to deliver high-quality, patient-centric, and accessible medicines to people globally. [ Know more [arrow] ][69] [Manufacturing] ## Manufacturing We are a global healthcare company driven by a strong manufacturing foundation. We have built advanced manufacturing facilities across continents to deliver high-quality, reliable, and affordable medicines. [ Know more [arrow] ][70] [Quality and global standards] ## Quality and Global Standards Quality is the foundation of our operations and the benchmark for every decision we make. Through robust systems, stringent controls, and a culture of accountability, we ensure every product meets the highest global standards for safety, efficacy, and consistency delivering confidence to healthcare providers and patients worldwide. [ Know more [arrow] ][71] ## Sustainability Our approach to sustainability integrates environmental care, social responsibility, and sound governance into every aspect of our business. From eco-efficient operations and circular practices to inclusive workplaces and transparent reporting, we’re committed to creating long-term value for people, planet, and stakeholders. [ Know more [arrow] ][72] [Life at Strides] ## Life at Strides Our people are the driving force behind our success. At Strides, we nurture a culture that is open, supportive, and entrepreneurial where everyone is encouraged to bring their ideas to life. We believe that by empowering individuals to be creative and take initiative, we can innovate together and create meaningful impact every day. Collaboration, growth, and respect are at the core of how we work, making Strides a place where people thrive and contribute to something bigger. [ Know more [arrow] ][73] ## Latest at Strides ### In the News [ As Strides Pharma stabilizes balance sheet, focus shifts to growth beyond the US 26 March, 2026 ][74] ### LinkedIn [ ][75] ### Stock Price Information [ ][76] ### Quarterly Results [ Quarterly Results Q1 2026-27 ][77] ### Annual Reports [ [Annual report 2023-24] FY 2025-26 ][78] [Strides] [Strides] * [About Us][79] * [People & Culture][80] * [Investors][81] * [Sustainability][82] * [Media][83] * [Careers][84] * [Contact Us][85] [ [linkedin] ][86] [ [Facebook] ][87] [ [X (Twitter)] ][88] © Strides Pharma, All rights reserved. [Privacy Policy][89] [Terms][90] [Sitemap][91] We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, provide social media features, and analyse site traffic. We respect your privacy and do not share data without consent. Accept [Read Policy][92] × [ [Stride Banner] ][93] [1]: /careers [2]: /contact-us [3]: # [4]: /about-us [5]: /about-us/our-story [6]: /about-us/our-purpose-and-credo [7]: /about-us/board-of-directors [8]: /about-us/leadership-team [9]: /about-us/manufacturing [10]: /about-us/research-development [11]: /about-us/quality [12]: /people-and-culture [13]: /about-us/awards-and-recognition [14]: # [15]: /global-presence/americas [16]: /global-presence/emea [17]: /global-presence/apac [18]: /global-presence/institutional-access-markets [19]: [20]: /people-and-culture [21]: /people-and-culture/our-cultu