tter global healthcare\n\n[Explore more ][36]\n\n## Our Values\n\n### Integrity\n\n### Results\n\n### Respect for people\n\n### Stakeholder Centric\n\n## Our Values\n\n### Integrity\n\n### Results\n\n### Respect for people\n\n### Stakeholder Centric\n\n## SustainabilityOur commitment to sustainable progress and innovation\n\n01\n\n###### Thoughtful\n\nPrioritizing impactful actions that enhance sustainability, our approach integrates care and\nresponsibility in every decision.\n02\n\n###### Protective\n\nSafeguarding people and the planet, we implement measures that ensure safety, health, and\nenvironmental conservation.\n03\n\n###### Moral\n\nUpholding ethical standards, we promote transparency, integrity, and accountability across all\naspects of our operations.\n04\n\n###### Circular\n\nChampioning resource efficiency, we focus on recycling, reuse, and sustainable product lifecycles to\nminimize waste.\n\n## productsA rich and diversified portfolio in key therapeutic areas\n\n[Anti-infectives][37]\n[Bone Management][38]\n[Cardiovascular][39]\n[Central Nervous System][40]\n[Dermatology][41]\n[Diabetes][42]\n[Gastrointestinal][43]\n[Hospital Products][44]\n[Iron & Vitamins][45]\n[Pain Management][46]\n[Respiratory / Allergy][47]\n[Urology / Nephrology][48]\n\n## Media CenterStay updated with our latest news, events, and sustainability initiatives\n\n[More articles ][49]\n[[althera]][50]\n[October 28, 2025][51]\n\n##### [Tabuk Pharma and Althera Laboratories Announce Strategic Licensing and Supply Agreement for\n##### Advanced Type 2 Diabetes Therapy in MENA][52]\n\n[[globalhealth]][53]\n[October 1, 2025][54]\n\n##### [Tabuk Ph"}}, "page_text": "[Page Loader Image] * [Home][1] * [About][2] * [Who We Are][3] * [Our Management][4] * [Our Journey][5] * [Certificates][6] * [Manufacturing Sites][7] * [Sustainability][8] * [Sustainability][9] * [Responsible Care][10] * [Products][11] * [Pharmacovigilance][12] * [Media Center][13] * [Press Releases][14] العربية English Fre