][130] [German][131][French][132] * [TaiwanChinese][133] * [ThailandThai][134] * [TurkeyTurkish][135] * [UkraineUkrainian][136] * [United Arab Emirates][137] [English][138][Arabic][139] * [United KingdomEnglish][140] * [United StatesEnglish][141] * [VietnamEnglish][142] # Takeda Pharmaceuticals: Global Homepage [background image] ## [TakedaEdge]Takeda leads with a generational promise # <TakedaEdgeIcon />Takeda leads with a generational promise to boldly reinvent for a healthier world [Scroll to article] ## Unlocking a new era of impact with first-in-class treatments. <h2 align=\"center\">Unlocking a new era of impact with first-in-class treatments.</h2> [Patient on chair] ### MHLW approves Takeda's treatment for adults with narcolepsy type 1 (NT1) ### MHLW approves Takeda's treatment for adults with narcolepsy type 1 (NT1) **A new chapter for narcolepsy type 1 (NT1) care and orexin science** Discovery of this new class of medicine now approved in Japan was spearheaded by Takeda in the company’s labs in Shonan. **A new chapter for narcolepsy type 1 (NT1) care and orexin science** Discovery of this new class of medicine now approved in Japan was spearheaded by Takeda in the company’s labs in Shonan. [Learn more][143] ### FDA approves Takeda’s narcolepsy type 1 medicine ### FDA approves Takeda’s narcolepsy type 1 medicine **A new chapter for narcolepsy type 1 (NT1) care and orexin science** We expect to make this first-in-class medicine available to the NT1 community by November 2026, pending U.S. Drug Enforcement Administration scheduling. **A new chapter for narcolepsy type 1 (NT1) care and orexin science** We expect to make this first-in-class medicine available to the NT1 community by November 2026, pending U.S. Drug Enforcement Administration scheduling. [Learn more][144] [Chevron left][Chevron right] ## Our Stories ## Our Stories [View all stories[Chevron right]][145] [ [Picture of Shatoya] ### Shatoya’s psoriasis journey: More than a diagnosis Shatoya’s psoriasis journey: More than a diagnosis [Calendar] August 24, 2026 ][146] [ [An adult and a child reading a book in a forest] ### Driving innovation in plasma-derived therapies Driving innovation in plasma-derived therapies [Calendar] June 24, 2026 ][147] [ [lab worker] ### Setting a new testing standard in the battle against polio Setting a new testing standard in the battle against polio [Calendar] May 21, 2026 ][148] [View all stories[Chevron right]][149] ## Recent News ## Recent News [View all news[Chevron right]][150] [ ### ORZEYFUL (oveporexton) Approved in Japan as the First and Only Medicine to Treat the Underlying ### Cause of Narcolepsy Type 1 ORZEYFUL (oveporexton) Approved in Japan as the First and Only Medicine to Treat the Underlying Cause of Narcolepsy Type 1 [Calendar]August 24, 2026 [Arrow right] ][151] [ ### U.S. FDA Approves Takeda’s ORZEYFUL™ (oveporexton), the First and Only Medicine to Treat the ### Underlying Cause of Narcolepsy Type 1 U.S. FDA Approves Takeda’s ORZEYFUL™ (oveporexton), the First and Only Medicine to Treat the Underlying Cause of Narcolepsy Type 1 [Calendar]August 5, 2026 [Arrow right] ][152] [ ### Takeda Announces FY2026 First Quarter Results, Near-Term Launch Preparations and Pipeline ### Progress on Track Takeda Announces FY2026 First Quarter Results, Near-Term Launch Preparations and Pipeline Progress on Track [Calendar]July 30, 2026 [Arrow right] ][153] [ ### Takeda’s ORZEYFUL (oveporexton) Approved in China as First Orexin Agonist and Only Medicine to ### Treat Narcolepsy Type 1 Takeda’s ORZEYFUL (oveporexton) Approved in China as First Orexin Agonist and Only Medicine to Treat Narcolepsy Type 1 [Calendar]July 22, 2026 [Arrow right] ][154] [View all news[Chevron right]][155] ## Learn more about Takeda ## Learn more about Takeda [ [People smiling] ### Join Us ### Join Us Work with globally diverse colleagues who are committed to challenging one another to achieve more together. Work with globally diverse colleagues who are committed to challenging one another to achieve more together. Learn more ][156] [ [Person presenting] ### Investors ### Investors Discover how we're unlocking growth potential through bold innovation and a robust pipeline. Discover how we're unlocking growth potential through bold innovation and a robust pipeline. Learn more ][157] [ [Person in lab] ### R&D ### R&D We’re translating cutting-edge science into therapies that address urgent patient needs and create new standards of care. We’re translating cutting-edge science into therapies that address urgent patient needs and create new standards of care. Learn more ][158] ## Sign up for investors newsletter ## Sign up for investors newsletter Stay up to date on financial results, corporate milestones and learn how we're delivering on our commitment to patients, our people and the planet [Sign up][159] [[Takeda]][160] * [ [LinkedIn] ][161] * [ [YouTube] ][162] * [Locations][163] * [Contact us][164] * [Careers][165] * [Financial Highlights][166] * [HCPs][167] * [Patients][168] This website provides information about Takeda's worldwide business. For specific information about our local markets, please use the [country selector][169]. This website provides information about Takeda's worldwide business. For specific information about our local markets, please use the [country selector](/worldwide). * [Terms and Conditions][170] * [Privacy Notice][171] * [Cookie Policy][172] * [Accessibility Statement][173] Copyright 1995-2026 Takeda Pharmaceutical Company Limited. All rights reserved. Copyright 1995-2026 Takeda Pharmaceutical Company Limited. All rights reserved. [1]: #main-content [2]: /about/our-company/ [3]: /about/leadership [4]: /about/corporate-responsibility/corporate-sustainability/sustainability-approach [5]: /about/corporate-responsibility/corporate-sustainability/access-to-medicine [6]: /about/corporate-responsibility/corporate-sustainability/sustainability-approach/sustainability -disclosures/ [7]: /about/corpor