ulation 46 & 62 of SEBI LODR][46]\n  * [Shareholder Services][47]\n  * [Postal Ballot & E-voting][48]\n  * [Shareholder Communication Tax on Dividend][49]\n* [Corp Governance[dropdownarrow]][50]\n  * [Policy or Statutory Documents][51]\n  * [Amalgamation][52]\n  * [MOA / AOA][53]\n  * [Credit Ratings][54]\n  * [Annual Return][55]\n  * [Intimation to Stock Exchange][56]\n  * [Debentures][57]\n  * [Commercial Paper][58]\n* [CSR][59]\n* [Press Releases][60]\n* [Archives][61]\n[Manufacturing][62]\n* [Overview][63]\n* [Indrad][64]\n* [Dahej][65]\n* [Baddi][66]\n* [Sikkim Unit I & II][67]\n* [Sikkim Unit III][68]\n* [Anakapalli][69]\n* [Pithampur][70]\n* [Bileshwarpura][71]\n* [HSES Forum][72]\n[R&D][73]\n* [R&D Centre][74]\n* [Our Research Areas][75]\n* [Portfolio][76]\n* [Innovation & Knowledge][77]\n* [Accreditation][78]\n[Careers][79]\n* [Join Us][80]\n* [Contribution culture][81]\n[Contact Us][82]\n* [Corporate Office][83]\n* [Other Regional Offices][84]\n* [Plants and R&D Centre][85]\n* [International Offices][86]\n* [Reporting of Adverse Event][87]\n\nAn Overview\n\nTorrent Pharma, the flagship Company of Torrent Group, with a turnover of Rs 13,980 crores (FY2026)\nis one of the leading Pharma companies in the Country. We are the pioneers in initiating the concept\nof niche marketing in India and today are ranked amongst the leaders in therapeutic segment of\ncardiovascular (CV), central nervous system (CNS), gastro-intestinal (GI), women healthcare (WHC),\nVitamins Minerals & Nutrients (VMN) and Cosmo-Dermatology. The Company also has significant presence\nin diabetology, pain management, gynaecology, oncology and anti-infective segments. Torrent Pharma\nhas crossed many geographical boundaries with presence in more than 50 countries. The Company is\nranked first amongst Indian Companies for having largest market share in Brazil and Germany.\n\n0\n\n[ManufacturingPlants]Manufacturing Plants\n[horizontal_divider]\n\n0+\n\n[Scientists]Scientists\n[horizontal_divider]\n\n0+\n\n[ProductRegistrations]Product Registrations\n[horizontal_divider]\n\n0+\n\n[Countries]Countries\n\nOur Reach\n\nMarketing Presence in 50+ Countries\n\n[WorldMap]\n[ourreachborder1]\n[\n\nIndia\n\n][88]\n\nTorrent Pharma, the flagship company of the Torrent Group, is one of the leading Pharma companies in\nIndia. Conceived as a small generic company in the early '70s by Late Shri U. N. Mehta, Torrent\nPharma blazed a new trail in the Indian pharmaceutical industry by successfully implementing the\nconcept of niche marketing.\n\n[ourreachborder2]\n[\n\n###### International\n\n][89]\n\nWith significant presence in more than 50 countries, Torrent is all poised to spread wings across\nglobe with strong technical capabilities and international accreditations. To enable strategic\ndifferentiation, Torrent Pharma’s international business is segregated into US, UK, Germany, Europe,\nBrazil and Rest of the World.\n\n[\n\nConsumer Healthcare Brands\n\n][90]\n\nW"}}, "page_text": "[[TorrentPharma Logo]][1] * [Our Story][2] * [Our Products][3] * [Business Areas][4] * [Beyond Business][5] * [Investors][6] * [Manufacturing][7] * [R&D][8] * [Careers][9] * [Contact Us][10] [[TorrentPharma Logo]][11] [Our Story][12] * [Overview][13] * [Torrent Group][14] * [Chairman Emeritus][15] * [ Board of Directors][16] * [Core Values][17] * [Milestones][18] [Our Products][19] * [Therapeutic Areas][20] * [Our Brands][21] * [Prescribing Information][22] [Business Areas][23] * [Overview][24] * [India Business][25] * [International Business][26] [Beyond Business][27] * [Our Philosophy][28] * [Community Healthcare][29] * [Education & Knowledge Enhancement][30] * [Arts, Culture & Wellbeing][31] * [Ecology][32] [Investors][33] * [Overview][34] * [Financial Information[dropdownarrow]][35] * [Quarterly Results][36] * [Annual Reports][37] * [Subsidiary Reports][38] * [AGM[dropdownarrow]][39] * [Chairman's Statements][40] * [AGM Transcript][41] * [Shareholder Information[dropdownarrow]][42] * [Investor Services][43] * [IEPF][44] * [Procedure for Dematerialization of Shares][45] * [Disclosures under Regulation 46 & 62 of SEBI LODR][46] * [Shareholder Services][47] * [Postal Ballot & E-voting][48] * [Shareholder Communication Tax on Dividend][49] * [Corp Governance[dropdownarrow]][50] * [Policy or Statutory Documents][51] * [Amalgamation][52] * [MOA / AOA][53] * [Credit Ratings][54] * [Annual Return][55] * [Intimation to Stock Exchange][56] * [Debentures][57] * [Commercial Paper][58] * [CSR][59] * [Press Releases][60] * [Archives][61] [Manufacturing][62] * [Overview][63] * [Indrad][64] * [Dahej][65] * [Baddi][66] * [Sikkim Unit I & II][67] * [Sikkim Unit III][68] * [Anakapalli][69] * [Pithampur][70] * [Bileshwarpura][71] * [HSES Forum][72] [R&D][73] * [R&D Centre][74] * [Our Research Areas][75] * [Portfolio][76] * [Innovation & Knowledge][77] * [Accreditation][78] [Careers][79] * [Join Us][80] * [Contribution culture][81] [Contact Us][82] * [Corporate Office][83] * [Other Regional Offices][84] * [Plants and R&D Centre][85] * [International Offices][86] * [Reporting of Adverse Event][87] An Overview Torrent Pharma, the flagship Company of Torrent Group, with a turnover of Rs 13,980 crores (FY2026) is one of the leading Pharma companies in the Country. We are the pioneers in initiating the concept of niche marketing in India and today are ranked amongst the leaders in therapeutic segment of cardiovascular (CV), central nervous system (CNS), gastro-intestinal (GI), women healthcare (WHC), Vitamins Minerals & Nutrients (VMN) and Cosmo-Dermatology. The Company also has significant presence in diabetology, pain management, gynaecology, oncology and anti-infective segments. Torrent Pharma has crossed many geographical boundaries with presence in more than 50 countries. The Company is ranked first amongst Indian Companies for having largest market share in Brazil and Germany. 0 [ManufacturingPlants]Manufacturing Plants [horizontal_divider] 0+ [Scientists]Scientists [horizontal_divider] 0+ [ProductRegistrations]Product Registrations [horizontal_divider] 0+ [Countries]Countries Our Reach Marketing Presence in 50+ Countries [WorldMap] [ourreachborder1] [ India ][88] Torrent Pharma, the flagship company of the Torrent Group, is one of the leading Pharma companies in India. Conceived as a small generic company in the early '70s by Late Shri U. N. Mehta, Torrent Pharma blazed a new trail in the Indian pharmaceutical industry by successfully implementing the concept of niche marketing. [ourreachborder2] [ ###### International ][89] With significant presence in more than 50 countries, Torrent is all poised to spread wings across globe with strong technical capabilities and international accreditations. To enable strategic differentiation, Torrent Pharma’s international business is segregated into US, UK, Germany, Europe, Brazil and Rest of the World. [ Consumer Healthcare Brands ][90] We care about your overall health [ [Tedibar][Brandsarrow] [CLIENT_TEDIBAR_SPOO_Shampoo_MERGED_1_68c93923ae.svg][Bathing_bar_8_b20fb7c84f.svg]][91][ [Shelcal][Brandsarrow] [shelcalImg5.png][shelcal_Img2_3ca3654d40.png][shelcalImg4.png][shelcalImg3.png][shelcal_pack_striag ht_2_9531e8cad5.png]][92][ [Unienzyme][Brandsarrow] [UnienzmesProd] ][93][ [Ahaglow][Brandsarrow2] [AhaglowProd] ][94] [ Therapeutic Areas ][95] Torrent Pharmaceuticals follows the tradition of Dedication, Professional Integrity and Robust R&D in the pursuit of excellence. With leading brands in various therapeutic segments, our products have proved to be efficient and effective in various therapeutic areas. Therapeutic areas encompass specialized medical fields dedicated to treating specific diseases or conditions for improved patient health outcomes. [Gastro Intestinal] ###### Gastro Intestinal [Neuro-Psychiatric] ###### Neuro-Psychiatric [Gynecology] ###### Gynecology [Nephrology] ###### Nephrology [Oncology] ###### Oncology [Anti-Microbial] ###### Anti-Microbial [Cardiovascular] ###### Cardiovascular ###### Many More [envSustainability] Environment & Sustainability As much as Torrent is helping the people of our society, we also are very conscious of our environment and our daily impacts on sustainability. [envSustainability] Torrent Pharma is committed to sustainability and responsible practices. We have set ambitious targets for reducing our greenhouse gas emissions and are constantly exploring new ways to reduce the impact of our operations on the environment. Towards this, we have been continuously diversifying our energy mix with cleaner fuels and renewable sources. We will also be identifying interventions to reduce our dependency on grid electricity. As a part of the ESG roadmap, we have invested in Hybrid Solar-Wind project to meet our captive power requirement and to reduce our carbon footprints significantly Press Releases [ ][96] News about Torrent Pharma. [Previous][Next] ### Torrent Pharmaceuticals Ltd. [CIN White 25x25.png]L24230GJ1972PLC002126 [footerLocation.svg]“Avirat”, Thaltej Shilaj Road, Ahmedabad – 380059, Gujarat, India [footerCall.svg]+91 79-26599000 [[footerfacebook.svg]][97] [[footerlinkedin.svg]][98] [[twitter.png]][99] [footerverticalline] [footerverticallinemobile] ### Our Story [Overview][100][Torrent Group][101][Chairman Emeritus][102][Board of Directors][103][Core Values][104][Milestones][105] ### Our Products [Therapeutic Area][106][Prescribing Information][107][Report Adverse Event / दवाओं का दुष्प्रभाव रिपोर्टिंग][108] ### Our Brands [Ahaglow][109][Shelcal][110][Tedibar][111][Unienzyme][112] ### Manufacturing [Overview][113][Indrad][114][Dahej][115][Baddi][116][Sikkim Unit I & II][117][Sikkim Unit III][118][Anakapalli][119][Pithampur][120][Bileshwarpura][121][HSES Forum][122] ### Beyond Business [Our Philosophy][123][Community Healthcare][124][Education & Knowledge Enhancement][125][Arts, Culture & Wellbeing][126][Ecology][127] ### Our Story [Overview][128][Torrent Group][129][Chairman Emeritus][130][Board of