to access the website with one of the following browsers: * Microsoft Edge * Mozilla Firefox * Google Chrome close [ Listen ][56] ### At UCB, we believe that everyone deserves to live the best life that they can. That’s why - as a ### global biopharmaceutical leader - we’re focused on creating valuable solutions that improve the ### lives of people living with neurological and autoimmune conditions. [Discover more about us][57] ### UCBCares® UCBCares® is a personalized service offered by UCB to support people living with a disease and healthcare professionals during their treatment journey with a UCB medicine. [Contact us here][58] [Picture of a UCBCares' employee on a call providing support] [Picture of two UCB employees working in a laboratory] ### A home for innovation Innovation is a key driver of progress in every aspect of human life including advancing healthcare. [Find out more][59] ### UCB Stories & Newsroom Story ## Addressing care gaps across the patient journey: insights from the 2026 UCB Startup Program Pitch ## Day [Read More][60] Story [ [Picture of a financial graph] ][61] 30 Jul 2026 ### [ Delivering today, shaping what comes next ][62] [ Read More ][63] Story [ ][64] 8 Jul 2026 ### [ Seeing beyond the surface: understanding the impact of ocular symptoms in myasthenia gravis ### ][65] [ Read More ][66] Press release [ [Press releases teaser image] ][67] 30 Jul 2026 ### [ UCB Delivers Strong Results, Raises 2026 Guidance and Positions for Next Growth Phase ][68] [ Read More ][69] Press release [ [Press releases teaser image] ][70] 8 Jul 2026 ### [ UCB presents latest data from its targeted generalized myasthenia gravis treatment portfolio ### at... ][71] [ Read More ][72] [Learn more][73] [ [Picture of a woman holding a newborn in her arms with a doctor next to her] ### Empowering women of childbearing age ][74] [ [Picture of the Unbearable Home that has been co-created with people living with Hidradenitis Suppurativa and that provides real insights into their daily life] ### Discover the Unbearable Home ][75] ## “Every breakthrough we achieve brings us closer to a world where patients can live better, ## healthier lives.” ### Sustainability Sustainability is at the heart of everything we do at UCB, guiding our decisions to positively impact society, support communities, and protect the planet for future generations. [Picture of a person holding a globe in his/her hand] [Learn more][76] ### UCB ventures UCB Ventures invests in pioneering companies and technologies that have the potential to transform the lives of people living with severe diseases. [Picture of a hummingbird the symbol of UCB Ventures] [Learn more][77] ## Choose a Country * [Global Site – English][78] * [Australia – English][79] * [België – Engels][80] * [Belgique – Anglais][81] * [Brasil – Português][82] * [България – Български][83] * [Canada – English][84] * [Canada – Français][85] * [中国 – 中文][86] * [Česká Republika – Angličtina][87] * [Danmark – Engelsk][88] * [Deutschland – Deutsch][89] * [France – Français][90] * [España – Español][91] * [Ελλάδα – Ελληνικά][92] * [India – English][93] * [Ireland – English][94] * [Italia – Inglese][95] * [日本 – 日本語][96] * [한국 – 한국어][97] * [Luxembourg – Anglais][98] * [Luxemburg – Engels][99] * [Magyarország – Angol][100] * [México & Latinoamérica – Español][101] * [Nederland – Engels][102] * [New Zealand – English][103] * [Norge – Engelsk][104] * [Österreich – Deutsch][105] * [Polska – Polski][106] * [Portugal – español y portugués][107] * [România – Engleză][108] * [Россия – Русский][109] * [Slovensko – Anglický][110] * [Suomi – Englanti][111] * [Sverige – Engelska][112] * [Schweiz – Deutsch][113] * [Suisse – Français][114] * [Türkiye – Türkçe][115] * [Україна – Англійська][116] * [United Kingdom – English][117] * [U.S.A. – English][118] × [UCB Logo] © 2007 - 2026 UCB S.A., Belgium. All rights reserved. Last updated on: June, 26, 2022 ## Social media links * [linkedin][119] * [instagram][120] * [facebook][12