ut Us We meet the needs of patients around the world by acting decisively with ingenuity and resolve. Whether we’re developing new or more affordable medicines, ensuring a resilient supply of needed therapies, or pursuing bold innovation, we deliver solutions that are effective at scale and built to endure. [See more about us][96] ##### Our Pipeline Developing a growing pipeline that addresses areas of significant unmet need across a broad range of therapeutic areas. [Browse our pipeline][97] ##### Our Products A dynamic global portfolio of medicines spanning generics, established brands and innovative medicines. [Explore our products][98] ## Discover your career at Viatris Our people-first mindset makes Viatris more than just a place to work, but somewhere you can learn, grow and make an impact in the world. [Find your next role][99] ## News & Announcements Discover Viatris ## Viatris Reports Second-Quarter 2026 Financial Results [Learn more][100] Discover Viatris ## U.S. FDA Approves Once-Weekly Combined Hormonal Contraceptive Patch [Read more][101] Patient Inspiration ## Living With the Life-Altering Effects of Lupus [Learn more][102] Voices of Viatris ## Two Little Words, and the Comeback of a Lifetime [Read more][103] ### Stories of Ingenuity [Access & Impact][104] [Living With the Life-Altering Effects of Lupus ][105] [Read More][106] Jun 25, 2026 [Voices of Viatris][107] [Sudden Illness Bolsters Prashant’s Commitment to Patients][108] [Read More][109] Jun 8, 2026 [Access & Impact][110] [Empowering the Front Lines: How the NCD Academy Is Transforming Community Level Care][111] [Read More][112] Mar 11, 2026 [Patient Inspiration][113] [Living With Lupus, Leading With Purpose: Verkeya Holman’s Advocacy for Representation and Mental Health ][114] [Read More][115] Jan 14, 2026 [Voices of Viatris][116] [Two Little Words and the Comeback of a Lifetime][117] [Read More][118] Jan 14, 2026 Contact Us [Close] ## Contact Us [Media Relations **][119] [Investor Relations **